(1002287, 120195, 15381, '<td valign="top">very very cool shot, but its not a macro</td>', 'very very cool shot, but its not a macro', '2004-11-10 00:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002294, 119856, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice Colors great picture but it seems like the colors are to much saturate, but nice.</td>', 'Nice Colors great picture but it seems like the colors are to much saturate, but nice.', '2004-11-10 00:05:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002296, 120125, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, just think that the the light relfetion is a little distracting but nice one.</td>', 'Nice macro, just think that the the light relfetion is a little distracting but nice one.', '2004-11-10 00:06:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002297, 120181, 15381, '<td valign="top">nice capture, but its not really all that interesting...again nice capture</td>', 'nice capture, but its not really all that interesting...again nice capture', '2004-11-10 00:06:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002298, 119789, 20774, '<td valign="top">The subject is not very intresting. to many things to distract. imo the background would be nicer in white.</td>', 'The subject is not very intresting. to many things to distract. imo the background would be nicer in white.', '2004-11-10 00:07:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002299, 119488, 9602, '<td valign="top">good idea, the highlights are all blown out.</td>', 'good idea, the highlights are all blown out.', '2004-11-10 00:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002304, 118934, 3080, '<td valign="top">Nice macro!  There are 2 minor things that stand out to me in the shot though.  First, the reflection doesn''t really ADD to the photo, so I do find it a bit of a distraction.  Maybe if it were a specific shape, or something recognisable, or something, it would be different.  I''m not sure what it is about it that bugs me, but it does a bit.  Also, I wish I could see the ends of the eye lashes.  My brain tells me they are there, and the fact that I can''t see them seems odd.  That being said, I do still love the shot.  Very nice work, focus and clarity are great and I love where you have placed the subject within the photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'Nice macro!  There are 2 minor things that stand out to me in the shot though.  First, the reflection doesn''t really ADD to the photo, so I do find it a bit of a distraction.  Maybe if it were a specific shape, or something recognisable, or something, it would be different.  I''m not sure what it is about it that bugs me, but it does a bit.  Also, I wish I could see the ends of the eye lashes.  My brain tells me they are there, and the fact that I can''t see them seems odd.  That being said, I do still love the shot.  Very nice work, focus and clarity are great and I love where you have placed the subject within the photo.  Good luck in the challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002306, 118214, 20774, '<td valign="top">Great macro i can almost hear the sound of the ocean, nice one.</td>', 'Great macro i can almost hear the sound of the ocean, nice one.', '2004-11-10 00:08:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002308, 119911, 22431, '<td valign="top">I''m pretty sure this is a plant, which means it does not meet the critiria.</td>', 'I''m pretty sure this is a plant, which means it does not meet the critiria.', '2004-11-10 00:09:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002309, 118313, 20774, '<td valign="top">Hope you didn''t burn the lense.. :) nice picture but imo i think the horizontal way you look better but thats my opinion.</td>', 'Hope you didn''t burn the lense.. :) nice picture but imo i think the horizontal way you look better but thats my opinion.', '2004-11-10 00:09:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002311, 119022, 9602, '<td valign="top">This is really good, but it seems difficult to believe that this is a marco shot, and not a telescopic shot.</td>', 'This is really good, but it seems difficult to believe that this is a marco shot, and not a telescopic shot.', '2004-11-10 00:09:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002316, 118826, 12694, '<td valign="top">very clever... wish both fangs were in focus though.</td>', 'very clever... wish both fangs were in focus though.', '2004-11-10 00:11:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002317, 120031, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice ideia. hope the motorcycle does get out of course! :) but i like the way the white space fills the sapce. nice shot.</td>', 'Nice ideia. hope the motorcycle does get out of course! :) but i like the way the white space fills the sapce. nice shot.', '2004-11-10 00:11:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002319, 119058, 20774, '<td valign="top">You should''ve cropped the photo a little more on the left top corner.</td>', 'You should''ve cropped the photo a little more on the left top corner.', '2004-11-10 00:12:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002320, 120195, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not really sure what technically makes up a ''macro'', however, to ME, this is more like a close up.  Macro would show very close up details of one subject.  I know that''s not a ''technical'' deffinition, however, it is what I''m looking for in the challenge.  The challenge description says "extreme close up"<br/>ANYWAY, that being said, I do like the DOF.  Focus is right on where my eyes want to see it.  LIghting is good.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the diagonal division of the shot.  There is a strange darker blue blurr in the upper left of the photo that draws my attention, But otherwise a nice photo. ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not really sure what technically makes up a ''macro'', however, to ME, this is more like a close up.  Macro would show very close up details of one subject.  I know that''s not a ''technical'' deffinition, however, it is what I''m looking for in the challenge.  The challenge description says "extreme close up"ANYWAY, that being said, I do like the DOF.  Focus is right on where my eyes want to see it.  LIghting is good.  Angle and framing/cropping are good.  I like the diagonal division of the shot.  There is a strange darker blue blurr in the upper left of the photo that draws my attention, But otherwise a nice photo. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002321, 120101, 9602, '<td valign="top">focus is all over the place.</td>', 'focus is all over the place.', '2004-11-10 00:13:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002323, 119105, 20774, '<td valign="top">Good picture but i think you should''ve tried a little closer, but i''m guessing that you camera does not premite this.</td>', 'Good picture but i think you should''ve tried a little closer, but i''m guessing that you camera does not premite this.', '2004-11-10 00:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002325, 118979, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, nice close up, and i like the way it is in b&amp;w.</td>', 'Nice picture, nice close up, and i like the way it is in b&w.', '2004-11-10 00:14:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002326, 120144, 20275, '<td valign="top">Needs better lighting</td>', 'Needs better lighting', '2004-11-10 00:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002327, 119033, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not quite sure I consider this an "EXTREME close up".  I do think the shot it ok though.  Focus and clarity seem good, and lighting is alright as well.  The background to the upper right of the cup seems to have something strange going on with it, and I wish the lines were lined up with the photo.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Not quite sure I consider this an "EXTREME close up".  I do think the shot it ok though.  Focus and clarity seem good, and lighting is alright as well.  The background to the upper right of the cup seems to have something strange going on with it, and I wish the lines were lined up with the photo.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002328, 120156, 20774, '<td valign="top">Great photo! love the colors. And yes it gives the feel of a teardrop. nicely done.</td>', 'Great photo! love the colors. And yes it gives the feel of a teardrop. nicely done.', '2004-11-10 00:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
