(1002338, 118979, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately an extremem close up.  I like the focus and clarity. very nice work there.  DOF is perfect in my opinion.  I think that the bottom ''rim'' of the eye being very white though is distracting.  I also wish I could see the tips of the eyelashes.  Seems like the poiny-est part of the photo should be visible.  Personal prefference though, some will definatley prefer it this way.  Good job. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately an extremem close up.  I like the focus and clarity. very nice work there.  DOF is perfect in my opinion.  I think that the bottom ''rim'' of the eye being very white though is distracting.  I also wish I could see the tips of the eyelashes.  Seems like the poiny-est part of the photo should be visible.  Personal prefference though, some will definatley prefer it this way.  Good job. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:17:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002340, 119912, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, but a little static in my opinion. But great dof.</td>', 'Nice picture, but a little static in my opinion. But great dof.', '2004-11-10 00:18:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002341, 120122, 20774, '<td valign="top">Its nice.</td>', 'Its nice.', '2004-11-10 00:18:51.000000', NULL, 1),
