(1002346, 120237, 3080, '<td valign="top">This seems really grainy to me. Not sure if you intended it that way or not, but I don''t think I prefer it this way.  The color is very nice. Love the bright blue.  Focus seems soft, but hard to tell cause I''m not really sure what this even is.  I''m not a huge fan of ''abstract'' type shots.  This is only my personal opinion, however, lots of people love them.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This seems really grainy to me. Not sure if you intended it that way or not, but I don''t think I prefer it this way.  The color is very nice. Love the bright blue.  Focus seems soft, but hard to tell cause I''m not really sure what this even is.  I''m not a huge fan of ''abstract'' type shots.  This is only my personal opinion, however, lots of people love them.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:19:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002348, 120235, 25989, '<td valign="top">Nice framing.</td>', 'Nice framing.', '2004-11-10 00:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
