(1002357, 119983, 3080, '<td valign="top">Wow...this is definately an extreme close up.  Not quite sure of WHAT, but it does look extreme.  I hate to say I really like it, in case it''s something really disturbing. lol.  But I do like it.  I like the angled seperation of the photo.  I like the Green on red, and I like the little hairy things.  That is what makes this appear to be really extreme to me.  Parts of the shot look a little grainy, however, still very nice. ~Heather~</td>', 'Wow...this is definately an extreme close up.  Not quite sure of WHAT, but it does look extreme.  I hate to say I really like it, in case it''s something really disturbing. lol.  But I do like it.  I like the angled seperation of the photo.  I like the Green on red, and I like the little hairy things.  That is what makes this appear to be really extreme to me.  Parts of the shot look a little grainy, however, still very nice. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:22:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002359, 118577, 20774, '<td valign="top">Nice dof. Got the hole flag in focus. good.</td>', 'Nice dof. Got the hole flag in focus. good.', '2004-11-10 00:22:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002360, 119845, 27293, '<td valign="top">Makes zero sense to me, sorry. The focal point is way off and hilights something strange and unrelated.</td>', 'Makes zero sense to me, sorry. The focal point is way off and hilights something strange and unrelated.', '2004-11-10 00:24:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002362, 120200, 9602, '<td valign="top">great idea and execution</td>', 'great idea and execution', '2004-11-10 00:24:23.000000', NULL, 1),
