(1002371, 120285, 20774, '<td valign="top">Just doesn''t seduce me. But it might have a great value to you the artifact. I think you should''ve taken the white dots on the left. but thats just my opinion.</td>', 'Just doesn''t seduce me. But it might have a great value to you the artifact. I think you should''ve taken the white dots on the left. but thats just my opinion.', '2004-11-10 00:26:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002373, 120080, 9602, '<td valign="top">The border really doesn''t work here.</td>', 'The border really doesn''t work here.', '2004-11-10 00:26:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002375, 118656, 3080, '<td valign="top">I like where you have placed the subject within the frame.  I like how the vertical line is toward the right of the photo, and from that come your horizontal lines.  The drops are nice.  Since I''m not really sure what constitutes ''extreme'' close up, I''ll say that in my opinion this comes close enough.  Although some will say that ''extreme'' would be to take a photo of only the little drop of water, I do still think this qualifies for the challenge.  nice focus and clarity and lighting also seems good. ~Heather~</td>', 'I like where you have placed the subject within the frame.  I like how the vertical line is toward the right of the photo, and from that come your horizontal lines.  The drops are nice.  Since I''m not really sure what constitutes ''extreme'' close up, I''ll say that in my opinion this comes close enough.  Although some will say that ''extreme'' would be to take a photo of only the little drop of water, I do still think this qualifies for the challenge.  nice focus and clarity and lighting also seems good. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002381, 118554, 20774, '<td valign="top">Theres to much reflexion on the eyes, i know its diffcult not to have them but you seem to have gotten a lot on it.</td>', 'Theres to much reflexion on the eyes, i know its diffcult not to have them but you seem to have gotten a lot on it.', '2004-11-10 00:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
