(1002399, 119854, 3080, '<td valign="top">I love it!!  You hit the challenge right on the nose.  The lower right of the shot seems a bit bright, and I''m not really finding the sharpest point of focus, seems a tad soft all over, but I still like this shot very much.   I''m not quite sure i''d hang it on my wall, but darn it, it brought a smile to my face for sure. ~Heather~</td>', 'I love it!!  You hit the challenge right on the nose.  The lower right of the shot seems a bit bright, and I''m not really finding the sharpest point of focus, seems a tad soft all over, but I still like this shot very much.   I''m not quite sure i''d hang it on my wall, but darn it, it brought a smile to my face for sure. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 00:31:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1002400, 120293, 18799, '<td valign="top">Good representation of th challenge.  My only nit is I find the shadow at the weld joint on the left side of the link a little distracting.</td>', 'Good representation of th challenge.  My only nit is I find the shadow at the weld joint on the left side of the link a little distracting.', '2004-11-10 00:31:56.000000', NULL, 1),
