(1002639, 119845, 18799, '<td valign="top">The robot is not in focus, and neither a macro, nor is particularly close-up.  The colors are good, and the exposure is spot on.  The background is distracting - if a focal point is the robot, he is lost in the distraction of the space ship right behing his head.</td>', 'The robot is not in focus, and neither a macro, nor is particularly close-up.  The colors are good, and the exposure is spot on.  The background is distracting - if a focal point is the robot, he is lost in the distraction of the space ship right behing his head.', '2004-11-10 01:49:42.000000', NULL, 1),
