(1003128, 119381, 23141, '<td valign="top">A close-up, but not really extreme.  Too much noise, and I don''t think the green tint helps the picture.</td>', 'A close-up, but not really extreme.  Too much noise, and I don''t think the green tint helps the picture.', '2004-11-10 08:41:13.000000', NULL, 1),
