(1003136, 120271, 23141, '<td valign="top">I thought of this idea too, but there was no way I could make it happen.  Haven''t seen any others like it yet - congrats on an unique photo!</td>', 'I thought of this idea too, but there was no way I could make it happen.  Haven''t seen any others like it yet - congrats on an unique photo!', '2004-11-10 08:44:21.000000', NULL, 1),
