(1003278, 118540, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice artsy image, but difficult to tell if it''s macro/in focus or not because I can''t figure out what it is...</td>', 'Nice artsy image, but difficult to tell if it''s macro/in focus or not because I can''t figure out what it is...', '2004-11-10 09:26:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003279, 118541, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and a good simple background. Excellent take on this challenge.</td>', 'Nice lighting and a good simple background. Excellent take on this challenge.', '2004-11-10 09:26:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003280, 119024, 2780, '<td valign="top">A more interesting angle and composition with more interesting lighting would make me vote this a lot higher.</td>', 'A more interesting angle and composition with more interesting lighting would make me vote this a lot higher.', '2004-11-10 09:26:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003282, 118578, 26361, '<td valign="top">Wow, awesome detail on the needle and thread.</td>', 'Wow, awesome detail on the needle and thread.', '2004-11-10 09:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003284, 119748, 10768, '<td valign="top">A little sharpening and tweaking of the brightness might help this shot.  I do like the point of view that you used.  His eyes are so expressive.  It''s a good picture, but I think some minor adjustments would really enhance it.</td>', 'A little sharpening and tweaking of the brightness might help this shot.  I do like the point of view that you used.  His eyes are so expressive.  It''s a good picture, but I think some minor adjustments would really enhance it.', '2004-11-10 09:27:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003285, 120033, 2780, '<td valign="top">A nice abstract photo, but the highlights are a bit distracting.</td>', 'A nice abstract photo, but the highlights are a bit distracting.', '2004-11-10 09:27:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003286, 119073, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, but that kind of works. I think this would be better in B&amp;W, as the colours are all pretty similar and bland.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, but that kind of works. I think this would be better in B&W, as the colours are all pretty similar and bland.', '2004-11-10 09:28:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003287, 120059, 10768, '<td valign="top">Very cool shot.  Love the colors.  I am asuming you used a noise filter to clean this up and it adds to the smoothness of this shot.  Well done!</td>', 'Very cool shot.  Love the colors.  I am asuming you used a noise filter to clean this up and it adds to the smoothness of this shot.  Well done!', '2004-11-10 09:28:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003288, 119947, 23141, '<td valign="top">Seems to be a bit out of focus, could be a better composition in there too.  Nice snapshot feel to the frame  :)</td>', 'Seems to be a bit out of focus, could be a better composition in there too.  Nice snapshot feel to the frame  :)', '2004-11-10 09:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003290, 119649, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the subtle lighting, and the shapes work well in the composition, but the photo seems over sharpened to me.</td>', 'I like the subtle lighting, and the shapes work well in the composition, but the photo seems over sharpened to me.', '2004-11-10 09:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003291, 119874, 17203, '<td valign="top">Hey, it''s Gar Field! Now THERE''S something you don''t see every day. The flat light isn''t particularly flattering (not sure if this is his good side anyway). A late afternoon or early morning sun would make all the difference on this one.</td>', 'Hey, it''s Gar Field! Now THERE''S something you don''t see every day. The flat light isn''t particularly flattering (not sure if this is his good side anyway). A late afternoon or early morning sun would make all the difference on this one.', '2004-11-10 09:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003292, 118638, 26361, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and lovely coloring.</td>', 'Interesting subject and lovely coloring.', '2004-11-10 09:29:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003293, 119983, 22853, '<td valign="top">what the? is that kryptonite? ;).. you''ve got 10 for making me wondering.</td>', 'what the? is that kryptonite? ;).. you''ve got 10 for making me wondering.', '2004-11-10 09:29:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003296, 119845, 16493, '<td valign="top">macro missing</td>', 'macro missing', '2004-11-10 09:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003298, 119992, 2780, '<td valign="top">Since I''m commenting on every photo in this challenge, I thought I''d better comment on this one too. I really like the duotone you''ve used, and the DoF works really well, although a little less shallow I think would look better. The lighting, specially on the drops, is pretty good. Nice shot.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-10 09:31:53.</i></td>', 'Since I''m commenting on every photo in this challenge, I thought I''d better comment on this one too. I really like the duotone you''ve used, and the DoF works really well, although a little less shallow I think would look better. The lighting, specially on the drops, is pretty good. Nice shot.', '2004-11-10 09:31:26.000000', '2004-11-10 09:31:53.000000', 1),
(1003299, 118642, 19952, '<td valign="top">Nice subject and an excellent job with composition and processing. This is a really good shot for this challenge.</td>', 'Nice subject and an excellent job with composition and processing. This is a really good shot for this challenge.', '2004-11-10 09:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003300, 119666, 17203, '<td valign="top">Incredible light quality, color and detail. Reminds me of Moodville''s work. 9</td>', 'Incredible light quality, color and detail. Reminds me of Moodville''s work. 9', '2004-11-10 09:31:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003303, 120113, 26361, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject, good arrangement, and good lighting.</td>', 'Interesting subject, good arrangement, and good lighting.', '2004-11-10 09:32:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003305, 120150, 2780, '<td valign="top">That''s really cool how you did that! The focus is good, and so is the composition. Nice shot.</td>', 'That''s really cool how you did that! The focus is good, and so is the composition. Nice shot.', '2004-11-10 09:33:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003306, 118611, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus is a bit soft here, and the lighting is a bit harsh and over-exposed.</td>', 'The focus is a bit soft here, and the lighting is a bit harsh and over-exposed.', '2004-11-10 09:33:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003307, 120153, 17203, '<td valign="top">Color, composition and DOF- all great. Good title. You''ve made an interesting image out of a mundane subject. Nice work!</td>', 'Color, composition and DOF- all great. Good title. You''ve made an interesting image out of a mundane subject. Nice work!', '2004-11-10 09:33:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003309, 119666, 772, '<td valign="top">This is excellent.  I waded through all these photographs in this challenge and this one is the only one that really stood out for me.  Each time we have a macro challenge, a majority of the photographers go for the ''extreme'' macro and forget everything they know about good photography, including composition.  This is one of the reasons I usually dislike challenges that focus on a technique.  These challenges usually yield a ton of photographs that have no aesthetic appeal.  I love the color, light, and texture in this photo.  It''s very rich in all these aspects, and I find interest in the subject as well.  Phenomenal work.... = 10 = Best of Show...</td>', 'This is excellent.  I waded through all these photographs in this challenge and this one is the only one that really stood out for me.  Each time we have a macro challenge, a majority of the photographers go for the ''extreme'' macro and forget everything they know about good photography, including composition.  This is one of the reasons I usually dislike challenges that focus on a technique.  These challenges usually yield a ton of photographs that have no aesthetic appeal.  I love the color, light, and texture in this photo.  It''s very rich in all these aspects, and I find interest in the subject as well.  Phenomenal work.... = 10 = Best of Show...', '2004-11-10 09:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003310, 118689, 2780, '<td valign="top">This shot looks a bit over-exposed. None of the colours seem as vibrant as I think you intended them to. The focus is a bit soft too. This could all be corrected with the right post-processing.</td>', 'This shot looks a bit over-exposed. None of the colours seem as vibrant as I think you intended them to. The focus is a bit soft too. This could all be corrected with the right post-processing.', '2004-11-10 09:34:51.000000', NULL, 1),
