(1003508, 120021, 3080, '<td valign="top">I saw this in the thumbnail, and thought it was a beautiful photo.  I don''t however think that your main subject would be considered ''extreme close up''.  In a way, you prove my point for me, but getting ''extremely close up'' to the barbed wire, but it''s not in focus.  So I would just like to see the focus reversed.  Focus on the front wire, not the back.  That would change it for me.  Still a stunning photo.  Love the colors and the background is beautiful.  Horizon is horizontal. (one of my pet peeves.)  Overall very impressive. ~Heather~</td>', 'I saw this in the thumbnail, and thought it was a beautiful photo.  I don''t however think that your main subject would be considered ''extreme close up''.  In a way, you prove my point for me, but getting ''extremely close up'' to the barbed wire, but it''s not in focus.  So I would just like to see the focus reversed.  Focus on the front wire, not the back.  That would change it for me.  Still a stunning photo.  Love the colors and the background is beautiful.  Horizon is horizontal. (one of my pet peeves.)  Overall very impressive. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003510, 119635, 23141, '<td valign="top">Oh, wow!  Nice lighting and stop-action shutter speeds.  Needs no improvement, imo!</td>', 'Oh, wow!  Nice lighting and stop-action shutter speeds.  Needs no improvement, imo!', '2004-11-10 11:08:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003511, 120098, 23141, '<td valign="top">Out of focus and too harsh lighting.</td>', 'Out of focus and too harsh lighting.', '2004-11-10 11:08:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003513, 119201, 23141, '<td valign="top">Is this a trivet from Target? :)  Good picture, could be a bit lighter.</td>', 'Is this a trivet from Target? :)  Good picture, could be a bit lighter.', '2004-11-10 11:09:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003514, 119881, 3080, '<td valign="top">This isn''t the best eye pic I''ve seen in the challenge, but it isn''t the worst either.  Which makes this just another eye shot.  Definately a good shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framin/cropping are good.  I do like how in this shot we can see the tips of the eyelashes.  Lighting is also good.  Technically very well done, my only complaint is the originality in this challenge.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This isn''t the best eye pic I''ve seen in the challenge, but it isn''t the worst either.  Which makes this just another eye shot.  Definately a good shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framin/cropping are good.  I do like how in this shot we can see the tips of the eyelashes.  Lighting is also good.  Technically very well done, my only complaint is the originality in this challenge.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:10:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003515, 119621, 23141, '<td valign="top">Good picture for capturing the feeling of kicking back...  But not a macro shot imo, a bit too dark, and skin tones are a bit too bluish.</td>', 'Good picture for capturing the feeling of kicking back...  But not a macro shot imo, a bit too dark, and skin tones are a bit too bluish.', '2004-11-10 11:11:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003517, 119811, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really very appealing.  Definately not a photo I''d hang on my wall.  A close up? Sure.  Lighting seems a bit harsh.  The can seems dark in places, but your bread is blown out.  Way too bright on the bread.  Not sure I like the keyboard in the background, doesn''t seem to add anything to the photo for me.  Focus also seems a bit soft.  Moreso on the bread than the can.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Not really very appealing.  Definately not a photo I''d hang on my wall.  A close up? Sure.  Lighting seems a bit harsh.  The can seems dark in places, but your bread is blown out.  Way too bright on the bread.  Not sure I like the keyboard in the background, doesn''t seem to add anything to the photo for me.  Focus also seems a bit soft.  Moreso on the bread than the can.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003518, 120033, 23141, '<td valign="top">Brilliant, vibrant colors!</td>', 'Brilliant, vibrant colors!', '2004-11-10 11:12:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003519, 120278, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice extreme macro and good detail to the textures.  Good job of creating a place for the eye to rest by using shallow depth of field.</td>', 'Nice extreme macro and good detail to the textures.  Good job of creating a place for the eye to rest by using shallow depth of field.', '2004-11-10 11:13:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003520, 119700, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately an extreme close up.  Focus and clarity seem ok. I like the lighting and color as well.  I''m wondering if you couldnt have found a more interesting angle, like maybe the base of the ''V'' coming out of the corner or something. seems a bit too centered for my personal taste.  Overall though, nice detail. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately an extreme close up.  Focus and clarity seem ok. I like the lighting and color as well.  I''m wondering if you couldnt have found a more interesting angle, like maybe the base of the ''V'' coming out of the corner or something. seems a bit too centered for my personal taste.  Overall though, nice detail. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:14:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003521, 118454, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject and composition, but a bit out of focus.  Could use softer lighting too.</td>', 'Interesting subject and composition, but a bit out of focus.  Could use softer lighting too.', '2004-11-10 11:14:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003522, 118870, 16648, '<td valign="top">not lit well, too dark, low on contrast - the arms blend into the backgrond, the white is more dull gray</td>', 'not lit well, too dark, low on contrast - the arms blend into the backgrond, the white is more dull gray', '2004-11-10 11:15:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003523, 118739, 16648, '<td valign="top">too small - needs to be 600-640 pixels on the long side</td>', 'too small - needs to be 600-640 pixels on the long side', '2004-11-10 11:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003525, 118840, 16648, '<td valign="top">not in focus</td>', 'not in focus', '2004-11-10 11:15:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003526, 119255, 23141, '<td valign="top">Great details and colors!</td>', 'Great details and colors!', '2004-11-10 11:16:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003528, 120162, 3080, '<td valign="top">As this was loading on my computer from top to bottom, I got a little scared that nothing was in focus. lol.  I think you did a good job with DOF.  (or editing) whichever.   The dust spots are a bit of a distraction to me, but nothing major.  Good extreme close up, maybe not my preference of subject, however, still very nicely done. The angle at which you chose to photograph your subject is very nice too.  Not too centered like i''m running across a lot of this challenge. ~Heather~</td>', 'As this was loading on my computer from top to bottom, I got a little scared that nothing was in focus. lol.  I think you did a good job with DOF.  (or editing) whichever.   The dust spots are a bit of a distraction to me, but nothing major.  Good extreme close up, maybe not my preference of subject, however, still very nicely done. The angle at which you chose to photograph your subject is very nice too.  Not too centered like i''m running across a lot of this challenge. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:16:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003531, 119948, 16648, '<td valign="top">this is a macro shot? Does not loo it to me, so does not fit challenge.</td>', 'this is a macro shot? Does not loo it to me, so does not fit challenge.', '2004-11-10 11:17:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003532, 119033, 16648, '<td valign="top">could use more overall lighting - seems a little flat/lifeless</td>', 'could use more overall lighting - seems a little flat/lifeless', '2004-11-10 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003533, 118425, 3080, '<td valign="top">Good sharp crips focus.  Nice DOF as well.  Crisp where it needs to be.  I like the lighting, the light reflections are appealing to me in the little circles.  I like the placement of the subject within the frame.  I don''t really have any complaints about this shot.  Definately extreme close up in my opinion.  Nicely done! ~Heather~</td>', 'Good sharp crips focus.  Nice DOF as well.  Crisp where it needs to be.  I like the lighting, the light reflections are appealing to me in the little circles.  I like the placement of the subject within the frame.  I don''t really have any complaints about this shot.  Definately extreme close up in my opinion.  Nicely done! ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003534, 120109, 11895, '<td valign="top">some fancy dental work there, wish this had more depth of field</td>', 'some fancy dental work there, wish this had more depth of field', '2004-11-10 11:19:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003535, 120031, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute!</td>', 'Cute!', '2004-11-10 11:19:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003536, 119724, 16648, '<td valign="top">tooo small - should be 600 to 640 on the long side.</td>', 'tooo small - should be 600 to 640 on the long side.', '2004-11-10 11:20:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003537, 120263, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice detail and textures!</td>', 'Nice detail and textures!', '2004-11-10 11:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003538, 118520, 23141, '<td valign="top">Could have used a wider depth of field.</td>', 'Could have used a wider depth of field.', '2004-11-10 11:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003539, 118354, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like the idea but way out of focus</td>', 'I like the idea but way out of focus', '2004-11-10 11:21:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003540, 120142, 14773, '<td valign="top">Fantastic macro (love the title) and really like the color choice 8</td>', 'Fantastic macro (love the title) and really like the color choice 8', '2004-11-10 11:21:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003542, 120149, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute, but focus appears to be more on the mouth than on the nose, which seems to be the main subject of the picture.</td>', 'Cute, but focus appears to be more on the mouth than on the nose, which seems to be the main subject of the picture.', '2004-11-10 11:22:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003543, 119883, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, not really macro, but understantable!</td>', 'Nice shot, not really macro, but understantable!', '2004-11-10 11:22:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003544, 120243, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really sure of the purpose of the cross over top of the watch.  Was it made this way?  Strange and definately not my style.  Also not sure why you close the long shutter speed?  Maybe there is a religoius connection that I''m missing by not being of this religion?  I don''t think that the long shutter speed is noticable enough to make a big difference in the photo, however, just noticable enough to be a distraction.  See what it does to the 7?  Makes it look all garbled, but you can''t really see the hand.  Lighting seems like it could have been better.  Check out this tutorial here for some tips on lighting. //www.dpchallenge.com/how.php?HOW_ID=8  I think that might help out a bit in the event of a reshoot on this.  Focus seems good. ~Heather~</td>', 'Not really sure of the purpose of the cross over top of the watch.  Was it made this way?  Strange and definately not my style.  Also not sure why you close the long shutter speed?  Maybe there is a religoius connection that I''m missing by not being of this religion?  I don''t think that the long shutter speed is noticable enough to make a big difference in the photo, however, just noticable enough to be a distraction.  See what it does to the 7?  Makes it look all garbled, but you can''t really see the hand.  Lighting seems like it could have been better.  Check out this tutorial here for some tips on lighting. //www.dpchallenge.com/how.php?HOW_ID=8  I think that might help out a bit in the event of a reshoot on this.  Focus seems good. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:22:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003545, 120288, 14773, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot actually, like the texture..even though it''s a relatively simple composition I think it works.6</td>', 'I like this a lot actually, like the texture..even though it''s a relatively simple composition I think it works.6', '2004-11-10 11:23:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003547, 118354, 23141, '<td valign="top">Excellent, unique idea!  I''ve never seen anything like this.  Would look even better with the details made crisp.</td>', 'Excellent, unique idea!  I''ve never seen anything like this.  Would look even better with the details made crisp.', '2004-11-10 11:23:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003548, 118424, 14773, '<td valign="top">Nice feathers :-) slightly out of focus tho</td>', 'Nice feathers :-) slightly out of focus tho', '2004-11-10 11:23:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003552, 119702, 22479, '<td valign="top">...but not close enough? Nice shot otherwise. Good exposure, nice background blur.</td>', '...but not close enough? Nice shot otherwise. Good exposure, nice background blur.', '2004-11-10 11:24:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003553, 119648, 14773, '<td valign="top">Looks like you sharpened the photo or adjusted the color, it looks a bit unnatural.</td>', 'Looks like you sharpened the photo or adjusted the color, it looks a bit unnatural.', '2004-11-10 11:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003554, 118313, 14773, '<td valign="top">Love the color and texture created by the gas flames...nice - 8</td>', 'Love the color and texture created by the gas flames...nice - 8', '2004-11-10 11:25:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003555, 119777, 3080, '<td valign="top">The nose, the eyes, the head and half the body.  Not sure if i''d personally consider this ''extreme'' close up, but that''s just MY opinion.  I do like the dog, and the focus and clarity on the nose seem ok.  The lighting though is a bit dark on the nose.  Of course, black is hard to photograph in situations like this, but There is not definition of what is his mouth and what is his nose.  Not sure if a fill flash might have helped or not, but worth a try.  Cute dog, I like how his nose is sticking out of the bars.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The nose, the eyes, the head and half the body.  Not sure if i''d personally consider this ''extreme'' close up, but that''s just MY opinion.  I do like the dog, and the focus and clarity on the nose seem ok.  The lighting though is a bit dark on the nose.  Of course, black is hard to photograph in situations like this, but There is not definition of what is his mouth and what is his nose.  Not sure if a fill flash might have helped or not, but worth a try.  Cute dog, I like how his nose is sticking out of the bars.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:25:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003556, 119025, 14773, '<td valign="top">Personally, I wouldn''t really call this a ''macro'' shot so right away it gets demerits from me.</td>', 'Personally, I wouldn''t really call this a ''macro'' shot so right away it gets demerits from me.', '2004-11-10 11:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003557, 120236, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice eye, but not a flattering angle.</td>', 'Nice eye, but not a flattering angle.', '2004-11-10 11:27:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003558, 119756, 28003, '<td valign="top">It''s nice, but it''s not really an extreme closeup/macro, is it?<br/></td>', 'It''s nice, but it''s not really an extreme closeup/macro, is it?', '2004-11-10 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003559, 119902, 14773, '<td valign="top">nice macro, diggin the color and texture..I don''t really mind the dark background</td>', 'nice macro, diggin the color and texture..I don''t really mind the dark background', '2004-11-10 11:27:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003560, 119914, 4747, '<td valign="top">Good concept. Unfortunately not enough of your shot is in focus</td>', 'Good concept. Unfortunately not enough of your shot is in focus', '2004-11-10 11:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003561, 120046, 11895, '<td valign="top">very little of this shot is in focus, the colors are pleaseing</td>', 'very little of this shot is in focus, the colors are pleaseing', '2004-11-10 11:27:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003562, 118975, 3080, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail.  Love the way we can see the little fibers.  This is definately an extreme close up in my opinion.  I like the diagonal lines, and how and where you placed the subject within the frame is great.  I think the border is good too.  I dont usually comment on borders, but yours compliments the image nicely.  Lighting is also nice.  Overall great capture! ~Heather~</td>', 'Very nice detail.  Love the way we can see the little fibers.  This is definately an extreme close up in my opinion.  I like the diagonal lines, and how and where you placed the subject within the frame is great.  I think the border is good too.  I dont usually comment on borders, but yours compliments the image nicely.  Lighting is also nice.  Overall great capture! ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:27:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003563, 118757, 28337, '<td valign="top">I really like the reflection in the eye! Awesome!</td>', 'I really like the reflection in the eye! Awesome!', '2004-11-10 11:28:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003564, 119737, 28003, '<td valign="top">Too blurry up front! Nice tones though.</td>', 'Too blurry up front! Nice tones though.', '2004-11-10 11:28:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003571, 119881, 14773, '<td valign="top">the hair on the skin is a bit yucky..and the bottom lashes are in the best focus.</td>', 'the hair on the skin is a bit yucky..and the bottom lashes are in the best focus.', '2004-11-10 11:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003573, 120192, 26372, '<td valign="top">great optics  ;)</td>', 'great optics  ;)', '2004-11-10 11:30:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003574, 120144, 14773, '<td valign="top">needs more light on the at least part of the image..some nice lighting on the white crystals would make this great.</td>', 'needs more light on the at least part of the image..some nice lighting on the white crystals would make this great.', '2004-11-10 11:30:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003575, 120192, 24363, '<td valign="top">bizzar but it looks like a flower, i like what you did</td>', 'bizzar but it looks like a flower, i like what you did', '2004-11-10 11:31:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003576, 120156, 28003, '<td valign="top">Nice simple composition and juxtaposition of primary colors. A little oversharpened for my taste.</td>', 'Nice simple composition and juxtaposition of primary colors. A little oversharpened for my taste.', '2004-11-10 11:31:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003577, 120123, 11895, '<td valign="top">cool subject and plenty close up but a lot of this shot is not in focus, I think greater depth of field would improve it</td>', 'cool subject and plenty close up but a lot of this shot is not in focus, I think greater depth of field would improve it', '2004-11-10 11:31:30.000000', NULL, 1),
