(1003595, 119392, 3080, '<td valign="top">I guess in my personal opinion, an ''extreme close up'' wouldn''t show the entire subject.  This is a nice photo of your first cannonthough.  Nicly lit and focus and clarity are good as well.  I think that extreme close up would be a photo of one of the buttons, or the mic area or something.  The photo itself is nice though, just maybe not the best for this challenge.  That''s just my opinion. ~Heather~</td>', 'I guess in my personal opinion, an ''extreme close up'' wouldn''t show the entire subject.  This is a nice photo of your first cannonthough.  Nicly lit and focus and clarity are good as well.  I think that extreme close up would be a photo of one of the buttons, or the mic area or something.  The photo itself is nice though, just maybe not the best for this challenge.  That''s just my opinion. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003596, 118692, 14773, '<td valign="top">looks a wee over sharpened to me..</td>', 'looks a wee over sharpened to me..', '2004-11-10 11:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
