(1003601, 119791, 16648, '<td valign="top">does not fit challenge, looks to me to not abide bythe basic editing rules, does not appear to be a macro, unless it is a pic of a pic (which it not in the spirit of the rules and prolly not in the letter of the rules).  what is up with the border? does  not appear legal either.<br/> <br/>does not fit challenge in my opinion as it is not a macro shot</td>', 'does not fit challenge, looks to me to not abide bythe basic editing rules, does not appear to be a macro, unless it is a pic of a pic (which it not in the spirit of the rules and prolly not in the letter of the rules).  what is up with the border? does  not appear legal either. does not fit challenge in my opinion as it is not a macro shot', '2004-11-10 11:37:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003602, 120189, 19010, '<td valign="top">Bahumbug. not only were the a lot of watch pictures in this challenge. I even like yours better than mine : ) Great job one of my top 3 picks..</td>', 'Bahumbug. not only were the a lot of watch pictures in this challenge. I even like yours better than mine : ) Great job one of my top 3 picks..', '2004-11-10 11:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003603, 120156, 14773, '<td valign="top">nice clarity and focus, like the red too.  The square reflection right of center is a bit off, but really, I don''t think it makes a difference.7</td>', 'nice clarity and focus, like the red too.  The square reflection right of center is a bit off, but really, I don''t think it makes a difference.7', '2004-11-10 11:37:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003606, 119326, 3080, '<td valign="top">Not really sure what this is, but it''s interesting. I like the color and the placement of the bubble things.  My only complaint would be the focus/texture on the top section of the large bubble thing.  Looks blurred or out of focus.  Kind of appears strange and doesn''t go with the rest of the shot.  Still fascinating though.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Not really sure what this is, but it''s interesting. I like the color and the placement of the bubble things.  My only complaint would be the focus/texture on the top section of the large bubble thing.  Looks blurred or out of focus.  Kind of appears strange and doesn''t go with the rest of the shot.  Still fascinating though.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 11:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
