(1003873, 119996, 25218, '<td valign="top">Intriguing abstract. I could gaze for a long time. I fear that most voters will breeze past due to the gihugent number of entries. Good luck!</td>', 'Intriguing abstract. I could gaze for a long time. I fear that most voters will breeze past due to the gihugent number of entries. Good luck!', '2004-11-10 13:15:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003874, 118361, 3080, '<td valign="top">The color seems dull.  I wonder if you played with the saturation a bit if that would make this punch some.  DOF is good.  Focus is right where my eyes want to put it.  Not an overly exciting photo, however, decently done.  Lighting is good, no bright spots or distracting shadows.  ~Heather~</td>', 'The color seems dull.  I wonder if you played with the saturation a bit if that would make this punch some.  DOF is good.  Focus is right where my eyes want to put it.  Not an overly exciting photo, however, decently done.  Lighting is good, no bright spots or distracting shadows.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:15:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003878, 118440, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the sharpness and the abstract qualities in this shot. I think a dark keyline around the photo before the border would stop the white bits merging into the border. Other than that it''s great.</td>', 'I really like the sharpness and the abstract qualities in this shot. I think a dark keyline around the photo before the border would stop the white bits merging into the border. Other than that it''s great.', '2004-11-10 13:15:48.000000', NULL, 1),
