(1003884, 119716, 2780, '<td valign="top">If the marble was the other way round it would be the french flag. That would be ironic :) The photo seems too soft to me and the whites are actually more of a yellow, suggesting you used the wrong white balance.</td>', 'If the marble was the other way round it would be the french flag. That would be ironic :) The photo seems too soft to me and the whites are actually more of a yellow, suggesting you used the wrong white balance.', '2004-11-10 13:16:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003885, 120194, 3080, '<td valign="top">I think what I would like to see for THIS challenge "Extreme" close up is an extreme close up of this leaf.  Get right in on the ''veins''.  That would be some amazing details.  Showing the entire subject doesn''t really feel like extreme close up to me.  I do like the subject, focus seems ok and lighting is alright, maybe a little dark in places but for the most part pretty good. ~Heather~</td>', 'I think what I would like to see for THIS challenge "Extreme" close up is an extreme close up of this leaf.  Get right in on the ''veins''.  That would be some amazing details.  Showing the entire subject doesn''t really feel like extreme close up to me.  I do like the subject, focus seems ok and lighting is alright, maybe a little dark in places but for the most part pretty good. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:17:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003886, 119942, 2780, '<td valign="top">Photos of figurines don''t interest me much, and the background in this photo doesnt help the shot''s appeal.</td>', 'Photos of figurines don''t interest me much, and the background in this photo doesnt help the shot''s appeal.', '2004-11-10 13:17:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003887, 119896, 25218, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is - a pomegranate? I''m not sure I like it as an abstract, because the shapes are somewhat disturbing, for some reason. Too fleshy &amp; veiny or something. That''s probably just me, though.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is - a pomegranate? I''m not sure I like it as an abstract, because the shapes are somewhat disturbing, for some reason. Too fleshy & veiny or something. That''s probably just me, though.', '2004-11-10 13:18:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003888, 120153, 29079, '<td valign="top">Absolutly love it, colour, detail, the whole image, NICE!!! My favourite</td>', 'Absolutly love it, colour, detail, the whole image, NICE!!! My favourite', '2004-11-10 13:18:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003890, 118572, 3080, '<td valign="top">These sure are cute.  I love the color.  makes it that more interesting.  I like the softness of the photo.  Not really sure why, but it does work.  Lighting is great. and I think that putting them right in the center of the photo works here.  I don''t usually like that, but it really does work here, proving there''s always exceptions.  Nice background, nothing distracting about that.  Simple and lovely.  I like it! ~Heather~</td>', 'These sure are cute.  I love the color.  makes it that more interesting.  I like the softness of the photo.  Not really sure why, but it does work.  Lighting is great. and I think that putting them right in the center of the photo works here.  I don''t usually like that, but it really does work here, proving there''s always exceptions.  Nice background, nothing distracting about that.  Simple and lovely.  I like it! ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:19:21.000000', NULL, 1),
