(1003900, 119845, 25218, '<td valign="top">I think it would have been better if all the objects were in focus. You captured a  nice color tone that underscores the nostalgia of the subject.</td>', 'I think it would have been better if all the objects were in focus. You captured a  nice color tone that underscores the nostalgia of the subject.', '2004-11-10 13:24:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003901, 119647, 7743, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of macro.  To me there are too many parts just chopped off.  For me it would work better if this were a closeup of the cockpit, chopping off the landing gear, wings and tail section.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of macro.  To me there are too many parts just chopped off.  For me it would work better if this were a closeup of the cockpit, chopping off the landing gear, wings and tail section.', '2004-11-10 13:24:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003902, 120243, 2780, '<td valign="top">Whats the shimmer on the left side of the image? The specks in the black on the right are a little distracting.</td>', 'Whats the shimmer on the left side of the image? The specks in the black on the right are a little distracting.', '2004-11-10 13:24:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003903, 119796, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good use of DoF and a double link to the challenge. A more interesting background would give the shot more impact.</td>', 'Good use of DoF and a double link to the challenge. A more interesting background would give the shot more impact.', '2004-11-10 13:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003904, 120050, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice choice of colours and DoF. I like it a lot.</td>', 'Really nice choice of colours and DoF. I like it a lot.', '2004-11-10 13:25:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003905, 118240, 2780, '<td valign="top">The background looks in better focus than the subject. Need to bring the focal plain forward a bit.</td>', 'The background looks in better focus than the subject. Need to bring the focal plain forward a bit.', '2004-11-10 13:26:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003906, 119888, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great image, but this frame really distracts me. With a plane frame or no frame this would have been an 8 from me, as is 6</td>', 'Great image, but this frame really distracts me. With a plane frame or no frame this would have been an 8 from me, as is 6', '2004-11-10 13:26:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003908, 119734, 29009, '<td valign="top">Color is good.  I wish the entire image was in focus.</td>', 'Color is good.  I wish the entire image was in focus.', '2004-11-10 13:26:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003909, 118254, 24846, '<td valign="top">Like the b/w and shadow. Great use of angle</td>', 'Like the b/w and shadow. Great use of angle', '2004-11-10 13:26:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003910, 119488, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting use of lighting to get the Red White and Blue element into the shot. Good sharp focus too.</td>', 'Interesting use of lighting to get the Red White and Blue element into the shot. Good sharp focus too.', '2004-11-10 13:27:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003911, 120109, 11518, '<td valign="top">Verrry original!  Well done.  Highlight somewhat blown on the left but still a great concept.</td>', 'Verrry original!  Well done.  Highlight somewhat blown on the left but still a great concept.', '2004-11-10 13:27:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003913, 118351, 24846, '<td valign="top">Love the dof, and perspective</td>', 'Love the dof, and perspective', '2004-11-10 13:27:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003914, 120200, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good creative concept - well executed.</td>', 'Good creative concept - well executed.', '2004-11-10 13:28:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003916, 118867, 19807, '<td valign="top">I was going to do a gem or rock picture for this challenge.  And then I realized how boring they looked.</td>', 'I was going to do a gem or rock picture for this challenge.  And then I realized how boring they looked.', '2004-11-10 13:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003917, 119883, 3569, '<td valign="top">IMO not a macro, but telephoto</td>', 'IMO not a macro, but telephoto', '2004-11-10 13:28:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003918, 120234, 3080, '<td valign="top">I''m not getting any feeling of ''scent'' from this shot.  Unless of course it still smells of new leather.  I guess that could be a scent.  I like the close up.  From the thumbnail, you really couldn''t tell what it is, but when you see the larger version and the body hairs, you can then tell it''s a piece of jewlery.  The texture is nice, and I like the patterns.  Lighting is good as well.  DOF is appropriate and focus and clarity are right where they should be.  Interesting shot.   At least it''s not an eye. lol ~Heather~</td>', 'I''m not getting any feeling of ''scent'' from this shot.  Unless of course it still smells of new leather.  I guess that could be a scent.  I like the close up.  From the thumbnail, you really couldn''t tell what it is, but when you see the larger version and the body hairs, you can then tell it''s a piece of jewlery.  The texture is nice, and I like the patterns.  Lighting is good as well.  DOF is appropriate and focus and clarity are right where they should be.  Interesting shot.   At least it''s not an eye. lol ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:28:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003919, 119920, 7485, '<td valign="top">Great idea and superb use of color and DOF. My only complaint is the composition, but I can''t put my finger on why it isn''t working for me. 7</td>', 'Great idea and superb use of color and DOF. My only complaint is the composition, but I can''t put my finger on why it isn''t working for me. 7', '2004-11-10 13:28:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003920, 119920, 3569, '<td valign="top">Macro?</td>', 'Macro?', '2004-11-10 13:29:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003922, 119637, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea but the cube blends into the background too much in my opinion, and the composition is a bit centered.</td>', 'Interesting idea but the cube blends into the background too much in my opinion, and the composition is a bit centered.', '2004-11-10 13:29:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003923, 118572, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like the shot - I wish the screws were more in focus.</td>', 'I like the shot - I wish the screws were more in focus.', '2004-11-10 13:29:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003925, 118462, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus here is off and the photo seems pixelated. Also the composition is a bit too centered for my taste.</td>', 'The focus here is off and the photo seems pixelated. Also the composition is a bit too centered for my taste.', '2004-11-10 13:30:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003927, 119301, 669, '<td valign="top">Think I''d have prefered to see the whole medal.</td>', 'Think I''d have prefered to see the whole medal.', '2004-11-10 13:30:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003928, 120191, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately colorful.  I appreciate your attempt to be original and make this ''burst''.  Different.  Lighting appears to be good, gets a little dark in the lower right hand corner.  Focus is good.  I wonder though if you could have placed the subject somewhere other than directly in the center of the photo.  Put a little angle on it, could boost the visual appeal some. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately colorful.  I appreciate your attempt to be original and make this ''burst''.  Different.  Lighting appears to be good, gets a little dark in the lower right hand corner.  Focus is good.  I wonder though if you could have placed the subject somewhere other than directly in the center of the photo.  Put a little angle on it, could boost the visual appeal some. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:31:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003929, 120163, 669, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t give a very good impression of how big/small this is.  Nice colours although slightly glarey lighting.  Good effort.</td>', 'Doesn''t give a very good impression of how big/small this is.  Nice colours although slightly glarey lighting.  Good effort.', '2004-11-10 13:31:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003933, 120284, 24841, '<td valign="top">Lovely! Great color in his eyes and the catch light is positioned perfect!  Bumping to a 10!</td>', 'Lovely! Great color in his eyes and the catch light is positioned perfect!  Bumping to a 10!', '2004-11-10 13:32:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003934, 119768, 669, '<td valign="top">Fantastic tones, although focus is slightly off.  Nevertheless, very good effort.  Think you may get marked down for not being macro-y enough.</td>', 'Fantastic tones, although focus is slightly off.  Nevertheless, very good effort.  Think you may get marked down for not being macro-y enough.', '2004-11-10 13:32:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003935, 118688, 24911, '<td valign="top">Simple but nice. A great shot. One of my favorite in this challenge. 7</td>', 'Simple but nice. A great shot. One of my favorite in this challenge. 7', '2004-11-10 13:32:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003936, 119647, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is a great close-up shot of an airplane, but for this challenge I might have attempted a close-up shot of one of the elements of the plane.</td>', 'This is a great close-up shot of an airplane, but for this challenge I might have attempted a close-up shot of one of the elements of the plane.', '2004-11-10 13:32:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003937, 119976, 669, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition.  Slightly noisy and speckly, but I don''t think this detracts from the shot.  Excellent capture of the moment.</td>', 'Very interesting composition.  Slightly noisy and speckly, but I don''t think this detracts from the shot.  Excellent capture of the moment.', '2004-11-10 13:32:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003938, 119666, 1368, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot of a fish! the lighting and colors are just perfect, my first 10 in this challenge, hope it does well :D</td>', 'Amazing shot of a fish! the lighting and colors are just perfect, my first 10 in this challenge, hope it does well :D', '2004-11-10 13:33:06.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1003939, 120027, 669, '<td valign="top">Hehe, you can''t beat oversharpening. :-D  Good composition and nice choice of B&amp;W.  Slightly more interesting than other eye shots I''ve seen so far, well done.</td>', 'Hehe, you can''t beat oversharpening. :-D  Good composition and nice choice of B&W.  Slightly more interesting than other eye shots I''ve seen so far, well done.', '2004-11-10 13:33:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003940, 119182, 24841, '<td valign="top">Nice!  Looks like a calendar..would have liked the focus on the berries more and not so much on the green but even so I''m bumping to an 8...very nice :)</td>', 'Nice!  Looks like a calendar..would have liked the focus on the berries more and not so much on the green but even so I''m bumping to an 8...very nice :)', '2004-11-10 13:33:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003941, 118988, 24911, '<td valign="top">A black background, or a colorful one aould have been INHO.Also, I am not sure I like it that you cut the bottom...</td>', 'A black background, or a colorful one aould have been INHO.Also, I am not sure I like it that you cut the bottom...', '2004-11-10 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003942, 119975, 3569, '<td valign="top">focus appear to be off a bit</td>', 'focus appear to be off a bit', '2004-11-10 13:34:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003943, 120274, 2780, '<td valign="top">The over-exposed highlights are distracting and hide a lot of the detail.</td>', 'The over-exposed highlights are distracting and hide a lot of the detail.', '2004-11-10 13:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003944, 119855, 669, '<td valign="top">Not keen on such a shallow DOF, although otherwise nicely done.  Think I''d have tried a thin black border to ''hold'' in the shot.</td>', 'Not keen on such a shallow DOF, although otherwise nicely done.  Think I''d have tried a thin black border to ''hold'' in the shot.', '2004-11-10 13:34:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003947, 119996, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a cool shot. Adding more contrast to have brighter highlights would make it better in my opinion.</td>', 'This is a cool shot. Adding more contrast to have brighter highlights would make it better in my opinion.', '2004-11-10 13:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003948, 118679, 24841, '<td valign="top">Ouch!  Very sharp, color idea is unique, the boarder is a nice addition really adds to the shot...a perfect 8 in my book!</td>', 'Ouch!  Very sharp, color idea is unique, the boarder is a nice addition really adds to the shot...a perfect 8 in my book!', '2004-11-10 13:35:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003949, 119075, 669, '<td valign="top">Took me a sec there to figure out what it was, which I think may hurt you with speed voters.  I see your idea but not keen on the shallow DOF and browny background.</td>', 'Took me a sec there to figure out what it was, which I think may hurt you with speed voters.  I see your idea but not keen on the shallow DOF and browny background.', '2004-11-10 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003950, 120133, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity and toning of this shot. 10</td>', 'I really like the simplicity and toning of this shot. 10', '2004-11-10 13:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003953, 118593, 2780, '<td valign="top">Overall I think this is too dark. Also, try to make use of the full 640 pixel limit.</td>', 'Overall I think this is too dark. Also, try to make use of the full 640 pixel limit.', '2004-11-10 13:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003955, 120059, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent shot. The colours, focus, DoF, are all perfect. 10</td>', 'Excellent shot. The colours, focus, DoF, are all perfect. 10', '2004-11-10 13:36:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003956, 118462, 3569, '<td valign="top">from experience, the voters will had your grain</td>', 'from experience, the voters will had your grain', '2004-11-10 13:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003957, 120118, 10432, '<td valign="top">This is terrific! Love the color and smoothness of the "globe".</td>', 'This is terrific! Love the color and smoothness of the "globe".', '2004-11-10 13:36:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003958, 119011, 25218, '<td valign="top">the reflected colors give an urban, graffiti-vibe to the photo, and I''m not sure it works with the subject/title. But I like them, so well done!</td>', 'the reflected colors give an urban, graffiti-vibe to the photo, and I''m not sure it works with the subject/title. But I like them, so well done!', '2004-11-10 13:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003959, 120281, 2780, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred this if the sand didnt disappear at the bottom.</td>', 'I would have preferred this if the sand didnt disappear at the bottom.', '2004-11-10 13:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003960, 120118, 24841, '<td valign="top">Beautiful balance and lighting.  Nice idea bumping to a 9</td>', 'Beautiful balance and lighting.  Nice idea bumping to a 9', '2004-11-10 13:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003961, 119942, 19807, '<td valign="top">oh god.....</td>', 'oh god.....', '2004-11-10 13:36:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003962, 120232, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting and composition are a bit dull here.</td>', 'The lighting and composition are a bit dull here.', '2004-11-10 13:36:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003963, 118577, 669, '<td valign="top">Pretty crispy image, although slightly faded.  I''d have tried to increase the contrast a little to make the red of the flag stick out more.  Good lighting and replication of the foreground as the background.  Shot could do with being a little bigger if possible.</td>', 'Pretty crispy image, although slightly faded.  I''d have tried to increase the contrast a little to make the red of the flag stick out more.  Good lighting and replication of the foreground as the background.  Shot could do with being a little bigger if possible.', '2004-11-10 13:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003964, 119022, 3569, '<td valign="top">quite nice</td>', 'quite nice', '2004-11-10 13:37:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003966, 119853, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent. The DoF, sharpness, lighting, are all perfect.</td>', 'Excellent. The DoF, sharpness, lighting, are all perfect.', '2004-11-10 13:37:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003967, 120077, 29009, '<td valign="top">Arresting image.  I wonder if it would have been stronger if the pupil was more in focus than the lid.  The vein detail on the inner eye is lost with your lighting choice.  Eye shots can be tricky, good effort.</td>', 'Arresting image.  I wonder if it would have been stronger if the pupil was more in focus than the lid.  The vein detail on the inner eye is lost with your lighting choice.  Eye shots can be tricky, good effort.', '2004-11-10 13:37:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003968, 120210, 19807, '<td valign="top">interesting subject.  poor exposures... the highlights are blown out.  Next time, stick a needle in the doll and photograph that.</td>', 'interesting subject.  poor exposures... the highlights are blown out.  Next time, stick a needle in the doll and photograph that.', '2004-11-10 13:37:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003969, 120238, 19807, '<td valign="top">poorly lit</td>', 'poorly lit', '2004-11-10 13:37:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003970, 119879, 10432, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and DoF.<br/>Seems just a bit dark, though.</td>', 'I like the composition and DoF.Seems just a bit dark, though.', '2004-11-10 13:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003971, 119850, 2780, '<td valign="top">The contrast is far too low here. Always try to have some pure black and some pure white in a photo to give it more impact.</td>', 'The contrast is far too low here. Always try to have some pure black and some pure white in a photo to give it more impact.', '2004-11-10 13:38:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003972, 118741, 24911, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Love the colors. Good composition. Would have prefer larger DOF. 7.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Love the colors. Good composition. Would have prefer larger DOF. 7.', '2004-11-10 13:38:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003973, 119888, 24841, '<td valign="top">Not only is this a nice photo it really took me back to the 80s :)  I think everything about it is perfect, but the boarder got in the way (I''m a fan of boarders too) I''m giving it a 9</td>', 'Not only is this a nice photo it really took me back to the 80s :)  I think everything about it is perfect, but the boarder got in the way (I''m a fan of boarders too) I''m giving it a 9', '2004-11-10 13:38:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003974, 118462, 3080, '<td valign="top">Guessing by the title, you were going for the frost?  However, you can''t really tell that the photo even has frost if that''s what you were going for.  Honestly, I''m thinking that this will look too much like a flower to most people and you will be scored very lowly.  It looks like a leafy lettuce type vegetation to me, but I could be wrong too.  I don''t like the use of black and white here.  I think it adds nothing to the photo.  Focus seems ok, but it''s still hard to tell what we''re looking at. ~Heather~</td>', 'Guessing by the title, you were going for the frost?  However, you can''t really tell that the photo even has frost if that''s what you were going for.  Honestly, I''m thinking that this will look too much like a flower to most people and you will be scored very lowly.  It looks like a leafy lettuce type vegetation to me, but I could be wrong too.  I don''t like the use of black and white here.  I think it adds nothing to the photo.  Focus seems ok, but it''s still hard to tell what we''re looking at. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:38:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003976, 119912, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good choice using B&amp;W but the contrast needs to be higher I feel. Try adding some in post processing.</td>', 'Good choice using B&W but the contrast needs to be higher I feel. Try adding some in post processing.', '2004-11-10 13:38:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003978, 119912, 669, '<td valign="top">You had a good opportunity with lighting, but it''s slightly lacking I think.  I like the blow-out on the LHS, but the shot is too dark on the RHS.  DOF is a nightmare of course, but I''d like more of the lens and dials in focus.  Maybe it would be worth taking the shot more face-on, if you could avoid a reflection..</td>', 'You had a good opportunity with lighting, but it''s slightly lacking I think.  I like the blow-out on the LHS, but the shot is too dark on the RHS.  DOF is a nightmare of course, but I''d like more of the lens and dials in focus.  Maybe it would be worth taking the shot more face-on, if you could avoid a reflection..', '2004-11-10 13:38:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003979, 120118, 29009, '<td valign="top">Creative concept and well executed.</td>', 'Creative concept and well executed.', '2004-11-10 13:38:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003981, 119064, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, making a macro into a landscape shot. I like it :)</td>', 'Nice idea, making a macro into a landscape shot. I like it :)', '2004-11-10 13:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003982, 119075, 10432, '<td valign="top">I could almost see the moisture sliding down the glass.  Very nice!<br/>A bit of noise on the background.</td>', 'I could almost see the moisture sliding down the glass.  Very nice!A bit of noise on the background.', '2004-11-10 13:39:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003986, 119647, 24074, '<td valign="top">not to "macro" but great shot 8</td>', 'not to "macro" but great shot 8', '2004-11-10 13:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003987, 118674, 669, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  I think I''d have increased the contrast a little.  Good composition and DOF.  There''s a slight blue halo on the very edge of the head on the RHS.  You could try to get rid of this using Hue/Saturation in your editor.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  I think I''d have increased the contrast a little.  Good composition and DOF.  There''s a slight blue halo on the very edge of the head on the RHS.  You could try to get rid of this using Hue/Saturation in your editor.', '2004-11-10 13:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003989, 120191, 24841, '<td valign="top">The blue background with the reflection is nice, texture of the different size and share of the sticks makes it work it does look like fireworks...bumping to a 9</td>', 'The blue background with the reflection is nice, texture of the different size and share of the sticks makes it work it does look like fireworks...bumping to a 9', '2004-11-10 13:41:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003990, 118860, 2780, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what this is. Using the full 640 pixels will improve you score.</td>', 'I can''t tell what this is. Using the full 640 pixels will improve you score.', '2004-11-10 13:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003991, 118523, 669, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and DOF.  I don''t voters will fully appreciate how macro this is, but it stands up on its own merits.  Well done.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and DOF.  I don''t voters will fully appreciate how macro this is, but it stands up on its own merits.  Well done.', '2004-11-10 13:41:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003992, 120027, 29009, '<td valign="top">Dramatic.  I can see the reflection of the window in the pupil.  Overall, the image seems a bit grainy/noisy and not as well focused as it could be.  Nice effort.</td>', 'Dramatic.  I can see the reflection of the window in the pupil.  Overall, the image seems a bit grainy/noisy and not as well focused as it could be.  Nice effort.', '2004-11-10 13:42:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003993, 120172, 3569, '<td valign="top">wow a mickeyfinn with eyes and flashabou, cool.  A black background would have been better IMO</td>', 'wow a mickeyfinn with eyes and flashabou, cool.  A black background would have been better IMO', '2004-11-10 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003994, 119990, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great contrast and a pretty cool creation with some boring props :)</td>', 'Great contrast and a pretty cool creation with some boring props :)', '2004-11-10 13:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003997, 119855, 24074, '<td valign="top">lol but no bugs or flowers</td>', 'lol but no bugs or flowers', '2004-11-10 13:42:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1003999, 119015, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot more than other blue flame shots because I can actually see some detail on the metal, rather than just blue on a black background. Nice work. A little more contrast would give it something extra.</td>', 'I like this a lot more than other blue flame shots because I can actually see some detail on the metal, rather than just blue on a black background. Nice work. A little more contrast would give it something extra.', '2004-11-10 13:43:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004001, 119746, 24911, '<td valign="top">I love this shot, but I think a black background would have been better.</td>', 'I love this shot, but I think a black background would have been better.', '2004-11-10 13:44:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004002, 119655, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is almost identical to another shot I have already commented on.  Really, the same goes for this shot as the other one.  I think the the focus and clarity are really good, and the lighting is nice.  Beautiful color.  I wonder though if it might add some visual appeal had the ''V'' of the veins been coming out of a corner or something.  Maybe just a bit too centered? ~Heather~</td>', 'This is almost identical to another shot I have already commented on.  Really, the same goes for this shot as the other one.  I think the the focus and clarity are really good, and the lighting is nice.  Beautiful color.  I wonder though if it might add some visual appeal had the ''V'' of the veins been coming out of a corner or something.  Maybe just a bit too centered? ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 13:44:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004003, 120161, 3569, '<td valign="top">and hollow points, that''ll knock some socks off.</td>', 'and hollow points, that''ll knock some socks off.', '2004-11-10 13:44:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004006, 118734, 669, '<td valign="top">Well, this has certainly stood out with my voting so far.  I think macro actions shots will do well, so good luck.</td>', 'Well, this has certainly stood out with my voting so far.  I think macro actions shots will do well, so good luck.', '2004-11-10 13:44:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004007, 120276, 25218, '<td valign="top">simply beautiful. the reflections in the kernels are unfortunate - I don''t have a suggestion on how to avoid them, so I''m not taking off much.. 9</td>', 'simply beautiful. the reflections in the kernels are unfortunate - I don''t have a suggestion on how to avoid them, so I''m not taking off much.. 9', '2004-11-10 13:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004008, 118237, 29009, '<td valign="top">Nice.  I''m wondering how you lit the ring so that there are no shadows?  I''ve tried to photograph one of my own with no success - a few words of advice would help me greatly.</td>', 'Nice.  I''m wondering how you lit the ring so that there are no shadows?  I''ve tried to photograph one of my own with no success - a few words of advice would help me greatly.', '2004-11-10 13:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
