(1004176, 119778, 2780, '<td valign="top">The big out of focus thing at the front is a bit distracting, but otherwise the DoF works quite well.</td>', 'The big out of focus thing at the front is a bit distracting, but otherwise the DoF works quite well.', '2004-11-10 14:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004177, 120032, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would be great if it wasnt for all the scratches and stuff.</td>', 'This would be great if it wasnt for all the scratches and stuff.', '2004-11-10 14:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004179, 119456, 2780, '<td valign="top">The soft focus works well, and the image is appealing overall, but it''s not really a macro or closeup.</td>', 'The soft focus works well, and the image is appealing overall, but it''s not really a macro or closeup.', '2004-11-10 14:42:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004180, 120104, 24715, '<td valign="top">Don''t you wish it was advanced editing? The light from the left spoils otherwise well done photo. The subject with the blured baground subject is well placed.</td>', 'Don''t you wish it was advanced editing? The light from the left spoils otherwise well done photo. The subject with the blured baground subject is well placed.', '2004-11-10 14:42:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004181, 118572, 27293, '<td valign="top">Likely. Can hardly see anything... and it doesn''t tend to seem an abstract picture so the blur is not justified.</td>', 'Likely. Can hardly see anything... and it doesn''t tend to seem an abstract picture so the blur is not justified.', '2004-11-10 14:42:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004182, 118975, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really like this composition and detail in it, but I do think that this image could be processed better. The greenish colour in the shadow area does not look too appealing to me. I think a subtle approach to the colours would work better. Also, the border does not work and I think it looks horrible. But I am scoring on the photograph you created, not how you have presented it.  Overall, nice job.</td>', 'I really like this composition and detail in it, but I do think that this image could be processed better. The greenish colour in the shadow area does not look too appealing to me. I think a subtle approach to the colours would work better. Also, the border does not work and I think it looks horrible. But I am scoring on the photograph you created, not how you have presented it.  Overall, nice job.', '2004-11-10 14:42:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004183, 118984, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the detail on the glass, it makes a change from seeing nice shiney clean bulbs.</td>', 'I like the detail on the glass, it makes a change from seeing nice shiney clean bulbs.', '2004-11-10 14:42:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004184, 119991, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love these things, they are so simple yet so much fun :) I think a shallower DoF if possible would enhance this photo, making the standing pins stand out more.</td>', 'I love these things, they are so simple yet so much fun :) I think a shallower DoF if possible would enhance this photo, making the standing pins stand out more.', '2004-11-10 14:43:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004185, 120247, 28875, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, needle not sharpe.</td>', 'I like the idea, needle not sharpe.', '2004-11-10 14:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004186, 119706, 21714, '<td valign="top">I really really like this one. Love those reds and the depth created by the shadows. Lighting  works really well and your composition with the black border enhances it all. Excellent work.</td>', 'I really really like this one. Love those reds and the depth created by the shadows. Lighting  works really well and your composition with the black border enhances it all. Excellent work.', '2004-11-10 14:44:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004187, 118578, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think a black background would work better here, giving more contrast against the white thread and silver metal.</td>', 'I think a black background would work better here, giving more contrast against the white thread and silver metal.', '2004-11-10 14:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004189, 118361, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the focal area is too far towards the back of the image.</td>', 'I think the focal area is too far towards the back of the image.', '2004-11-10 14:44:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004192, 119627, 2780, '<td valign="top">The highlights look too blown out to me, and there is no real focal point to look at.</td>', 'The highlights look too blown out to me, and there is no real focal point to look at.', '2004-11-10 14:47:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004194, 120050, 21714, '<td valign="top">Beautifully photographed. Colours work well with the lines and shaped on this one. Presented really well too. I somehow do feel like moving my view point slightly to the left.  Not sure if it would look better, but when I look at it for a while, I do feel like doing it. <br/>Very nice job.</td>', 'Beautifully photographed. Colours work well with the lines and shaped on this one. Presented really well too. I somehow do feel like moving my view point slightly to the left.  Not sure if it would look better, but when I look at it for a while, I do feel like doing it. Very nice job.', '2004-11-10 14:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004195, 119880, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure about the top heavy composition... I think with something like this a more centered composition would look better.</td>', 'I''m not sure about the top heavy composition... I think with something like this a more centered composition would look better.', '2004-11-10 14:49:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004199, 118629, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great shot. if it wasnt for a grainy streak going down from the eye, and on the eye lid, This would have definately got a 9 or better. But hey it still one of my top picks.</td>', 'Great shot. if it wasnt for a grainy streak going down from the eye, and on the eye lid, This would have definately got a 9 or better. But hey it still one of my top picks.', '2004-11-10 14:51:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004200, 118365, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good detailed macro but looks too over sharpened and compressed to me.</td>', 'Good detailed macro but looks too over sharpened and compressed to me.', '2004-11-10 14:51:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004205, 119890, 28875, '<td valign="top">Sorry, I don''t know what the subject is?</td>', 'Sorry, I don''t know what the subject is?', '2004-11-10 14:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004206, 120227, 21714, '<td valign="top">The lighting in this one in great. I really like it. And the vibrant colours and detail are amazing. Beautiful work.  My only suggestion would be to try a different crop. I have a feeling that a square crop or 5x4 will work better on this.  Well done.</td>', 'The lighting in this one in great. I really like it. And the vibrant colours and detail are amazing. Beautiful work.  My only suggestion would be to try a different crop. I have a feeling that a square crop or 5x4 will work better on this.  Well done.', '2004-11-10 14:52:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004207, 120267, 11895, '<td valign="top">love the colors but there isn''t much clear detail</td>', 'love the colors but there isn''t much clear detail', '2004-11-10 14:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004209, 119647, 28875, '<td valign="top">Is this macro?</td>', 'Is this macro?', '2004-11-10 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004210, 119986, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo. The lighting and colour and DoF is perfect. It''s a shame you didnt use the full 640 pixel limit though. 9</td>', 'Great photo. The lighting and colour and DoF is perfect. It''s a shame you didnt use the full 640 pixel limit though. 9', '2004-11-10 14:53:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004211, 118638, 19010, '<td valign="top">I did a simular shot for this challenge. I feel you managed to get a  richer feild of color and and shadows. I realy liked this shot even if it was better than mine :) 8</td>', 'I did a simular shot for this challenge. I feel you managed to get a  richer feild of color and and shadows. I realy liked this shot even if it was better than mine :) 8', '2004-11-10 14:53:52.000000', NULL, 1),
