(1004254, 119914, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the shallow DoF, but it think it''s slightly *too* shallow in this case.</td>', 'I like the shallow DoF, but it think it''s slightly *too* shallow in this case.', '2004-11-10 15:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
