(1004300, 120278, 6999, '<td valign="top">The shininess speaks of a plastic texture, which I find unappealing. Some sense of the complexity of the knot achieved, but I can''t see that greater depth of field wouldn''t have helped.</td>', 'The shininess speaks of a plastic texture, which I find unappealing. Some sense of the complexity of the knot achieved, but I can''t see that greater depth of field wouldn''t have helped.', '2004-11-10 15:27:34.000000', NULL, 1),
