(1004458, 119734, 25742, '<td valign="top">tres right, but n''est pas very interesting either. You should have used a black table for the creature to stand on, there is an nasty cast to the eyes.</td>', 'tres right, but n''est pas very interesting either. You should have used a black table for the creature to stand on, there is an nasty cast to the eyes.', '2004-11-10 16:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
