(1004462, 120192, 25742, '<td valign="top">It will be interesting to see how long this exposure took. I think this is the best eye shot, at least so far (I think I''m at about 157/538). Good luck</td>', 'It will be interesting to see how long this exposure took. I think this is the best eye shot, at least so far (I think I''m at about 157/538). Good luck', '2004-11-10 16:20:24.000000', NULL, 1),
