(1004492, 119888, 26827, '<td valign="top">Really like the colors.  Border is good.  Great capture.</td>', 'Really like the colors.  Border is good.  Great capture.', '2004-11-10 16:29:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004495, 120180, 26827, '<td valign="top">The depth of field you chose really accentuates the repeated pattern.  I like it.</td>', 'The depth of field you chose really accentuates the repeated pattern.  I like it.', '2004-11-10 16:29:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004496, 118860, 25873, '<td valign="top">I can''t really make out what all the stuff to the left of the pearls is.  Some kind of garment?  If its meant to be part of the picture, some lighting adjustment would help, otherwise just focus in on the necklace/bracelet.</td>', 'I can''t really make out what all the stuff to the left of the pearls is.  Some kind of garment?  If its meant to be part of the picture, some lighting adjustment would help, otherwise just focus in on the necklace/bracelet.', '2004-11-10 16:30:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004498, 119492, 26827, '<td valign="top">Incredibly beautiful shot.  The only thing I might want to see different is slightly more space on the right side of the image, just so the shell edge is clear.</td>', 'Incredibly beautiful shot.  The only thing I might want to see different is slightly more space on the right side of the image, just so the shell edge is clear.', '2004-11-10 16:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004500, 118609, 26827, '<td valign="top">I like the high-key shot.  Good angle.  Did you buy a new chain just for this?  Mine are never that clean.</td>', 'I like the high-key shot.  Good angle.  Did you buy a new chain just for this?  Mine are never that clean.', '2004-11-10 16:32:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004502, 120287, 7364, '<td valign="top">needs a slightly larger DOF and more sharpness.  Light is interesting enough, may be too sharp of a contrast between the warm and cool colors.</td>', 'needs a slightly larger DOF and more sharpness.  Light is interesting enough, may be too sharp of a contrast between the warm and cool colors.', '2004-11-10 16:33:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004503, 119753, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  The anlel of the "horizon" is distracting, but not too distracting.</td>', 'Good shot.  The anlel of the "horizon" is distracting, but not too distracting.', '2004-11-10 16:33:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004504, 120238, 25873, '<td valign="top">Better focus would be an improvement.</td>', 'Better focus would be an improvement.', '2004-11-10 16:33:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004508, 118888, 7364, '<td valign="top">would have benefitted form a bounce so the shadow waasn''t completely washed out.  Good DOF, color, sharpness, composition.</td>', 'would have benefitted form a bounce so the shadow waasn''t completely washed out.  Good DOF, color, sharpness, composition.', '2004-11-10 16:33:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004510, 120293, 25742, '<td valign="top">strange how it seem to be in focus on top and bottom but not in middle. ok, I understand now, the plan of focus is behind the front of the closest link. Deeper DOF is my recommendation.</td>', 'strange how it seem to be in focus on top and bottom but not in middle. ok, I understand now, the plan of focus is behind the front of the closest link. Deeper DOF is my recommendation.', '2004-11-10 16:34:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004512, 119864, 26476, '<td valign="top">I like this one allot.  Cropping maybe a bit close on top and bottom.  Still gave a 7.</td>', 'I like this one allot.  Cropping maybe a bit close on top and bottom.  Still gave a 7.', '2004-11-10 16:34:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004515, 118951, 25742, '<td valign="top">is this guy alive? how were you able to get this close? or do you have a arm-long lens?</td>', 'is this guy alive? how were you able to get this close? or do you have a arm-long lens?', '2004-11-10 16:35:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004516, 118570, 26476, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Good lighting; I like the blue.</td>', 'Nice.  Good lighting; I like the blue.', '2004-11-10 16:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004517, 118532, 7364, '<td valign="top">good comp, elements, and light.  would only have liked to see larger DOF, or possibly th efocal point on the tip of the stylus.  That''s a pretty subjetive critique :-)</td>', 'good comp, elements, and light.  would only have liked to see larger DOF, or possibly th efocal point on the tip of the stylus.  That''s a pretty subjetive critique :-)', '2004-11-10 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004518, 120142, 26827, '<td valign="top">Definitely one of the best "eye shots" in this challenge.  Love the color, love the reflection in the eye, love the title.</td>', 'Definitely one of the best "eye shots" in this challenge.  Love the color, love the reflection in the eye, love the title.', '2004-11-10 16:36:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004522, 119883, 25873, '<td valign="top">Guess you didn''t want to get much closer than this shot!</td>', 'Guess you didn''t want to get much closer than this shot!', '2004-11-10 16:37:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004523, 118540, 7364, '<td valign="top">while this may very well be a macro, that is not apparent.  And while I think this is an awesome photo, I wouldn''t say that it fits this challenge very well, it''s more of an abstract or motion photo.</td>', 'while this may very well be a macro, that is not apparent.  And while I think this is an awesome photo, I wouldn''t say that it fits this challenge very well, it''s more of an abstract or motion photo.', '2004-11-10 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004524, 119647, 25873, '<td valign="top">I don''t see how this qualifies as a macro.  I wouldn''t call this close-up.  Zoomed in from far away maybe, but not close-up.</td>', 'I don''t see how this qualifies as a macro.  I wouldn''t call this close-up.  Zoomed in from far away maybe, but not close-up.', '2004-11-10 16:37:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004526, 120109, 26476, '<td valign="top">Great idea.</td>', 'Great idea.', '2004-11-10 16:38:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004527, 120266, 25742, '<td valign="top">look painful to slide on :)</td>', 'look painful to slide on :)', '2004-11-10 16:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004533, 119257, 26476, '<td valign="top">Nice one.  Love the red and grey contrast and the movement is captured perfectly.  8</td>', 'Nice one.  Love the red and grey contrast and the movement is captured perfectly.  8', '2004-11-10 16:39:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004534, 120194, 7364, '<td valign="top">The composition of the photo is pretty good.  But the harshness of the rocks and the similarityies in color make it difficult to distinguish the leaf as your subject.  Too "busy" you might say.  The harshness and angle of the light add to that problem.  Suggestion: forget the rocks, get a super macro of the leaf weins, the light angle accentuates the texture of the veins and would make a good photo wihtout the surrounding distractions.</td>', 'The composition of the photo is pretty good.  But the harshness of the rocks and the similarityies in color make it difficult to distinguish the leaf as your subject.  Too "busy" you might say.  The harshness and angle of the light add to that problem.  Suggestion: forget the rocks, get a super macro of the leaf weins, the light angle accentuates the texture of the veins and would make a good photo wihtout the surrounding distractions.', '2004-11-10 16:40:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004535, 120004, 25873, '<td valign="top">A lot of distracting elements here.  Too bad you couldn''t get in a little tighter on the frog/salmander/newt/UAO  (Unidentified Amphibious Object).<br/> <br/></td>', 'A lot of distracting elements here.  Too bad you couldn''t get in a little tighter on the frog/salmander/newt/UAO  (Unidentified Amphibious Object). ', '2004-11-10 16:41:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004536, 119488, 25742, '<td valign="top">I almost entered something like this. Glad I didn''t because your is MUCH better. Good luck.</td>', 'I almost entered something like this. Glad I didn''t because your is MUCH better. Good luck.', '2004-11-10 16:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004538, 118988, 7364, '<td valign="top">A toothpick flower - this is a plant!  DISQUALIFY! just kidding.  nice shot.  I like how you can see the shadows between the toothpicks in the center.  I also like to compositionand crop.  There''s almost an exposure problem at the outer rim, but not quite.  Good job.</td>', 'A toothpick flower - this is a plant!  DISQUALIFY! just kidding.  nice shot.  I like how you can see the shadows between the toothpicks in the center.  I also like to compositionand crop.  There''s almost an exposure problem at the outer rim, but not quite.  Good job.', '2004-11-10 16:42:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004539, 118547, 7364, '<td valign="top">very nice!  crispness might be the only negative issue here, good everything else! :-)</td>', 'very nice!  crispness might be the only negative issue here, good everything else! :-)', '2004-11-10 16:43:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004540, 119351, 25873, '<td valign="top">Great take on a shot that''s been done before on this site.   This one would do well too if it was in focus and not so grainy.</td>', 'Great take on a shot that''s been done before on this site.   This one would do well too if it was in focus and not so grainy.', '2004-11-10 16:43:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004541, 118609, 25742, '<td valign="top">an old and worn chain would probably have more texture and interest. the very plain BG does not help either. But most definately a macro shot.</td>', 'an old and worn chain would probably have more texture and interest. the very plain BG does not help either. But most definately a macro shot.', '2004-11-10 16:43:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004542, 119909, 25873, '<td valign="top">Great setup, focus and colours!</td>', 'Great setup, focus and colours!', '2004-11-10 16:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004543, 120172, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good detail on the fly.  Like the color contrast, it feels very energetic.</td>', 'Good detail on the fly.  Like the color contrast, it feels very energetic.', '2004-11-10 16:44:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004544, 119635, 25742, '<td valign="top">ok.this is the best wet apple in the competition<br/>Good luck.</td>', 'ok.this is the best wet apple in the competitionGood luck.', '2004-11-10 16:44:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004546, 118417, 25873, '<td valign="top">I keep thinking a different angle on the handle would have looked better.  Also, a shallower DOF might could be used to blur the background to lessen the distracting elements of the door and door frame.</td>', 'I keep thinking a different angle on the handle would have looked better.  Also, a shallower DOF might could be used to blur the background to lessen the distracting elements of the door and door frame.', '2004-11-10 16:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004547, 118524, 7364, '<td valign="top">wow, that''s nice!  Awesome lighting and textire. It''s like a giant stone sculpture.  The side lighting accross the upper lip is bright enough to achieve a stark contrast for texture whil enot loosing anything in the shadows.  And how hard is it to take a respectable up the nose shot without too much embarassment!?  Wonderful!</td>', 'wow, that''s nice!  Awesome lighting and textire. It''s like a giant stone sculpture.  The side lighting accross the upper lip is bright enough to achieve a stark contrast for texture whil enot loosing anything in the shadows.  And how hard is it to take a respectable up the nose shot without too much embarassment!?  Wonderful!', '2004-11-10 16:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004549, 118313, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good detail, good color, good shape.  I wonder if this may have looked better landscape?</td>', 'Good detail, good color, good shape.  I wonder if this may have looked better landscape?', '2004-11-10 16:46:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004552, 119965, 26827, '<td valign="top">Very nice, clean shot.  I like the composition you''ve created.</td>', 'Very nice, clean shot.  I like the composition you''ve created.', '2004-11-10 16:47:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004554, 118826, 25742, '<td valign="top">LOL</td>', 'LOL', '2004-11-10 16:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004556, 119774, 27524, '<td valign="top">Very nice capture of glittering of chain.</td>', 'Very nice capture of glittering of chain.', '2004-11-10 16:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004557, 120247, 25873, '<td valign="top">Needle needs better focus.  Great idea anyway.</td>', 'Needle needs better focus.  Great idea anyway.', '2004-11-10 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004558, 120092, 7364, '<td valign="top">lighting way too strong here.  The glare off the resistor and shadow created underneath give it a snapshot feel and not a photograph.  While the eye is clarly drawn to teh subject - the resistor - the surrounding elelments to not progress in any particular order and the void in the foregound leave me to coclude that the composition is weak here.  Soften the lighting , even out the composition, and keep shooting.  Even try a few different colors of light instead of your flash.</td>', 'lighting way too strong here.  The glare off the resistor and shadow created underneath give it a snapshot feel and not a photograph.  While the eye is clarly drawn to teh subject - the resistor - the surrounding elelments to not progress in any particular order and the void in the foregound leave me to coclude that the composition is weak here.  Soften the lighting , even out the composition, and keep shooting.  Even try a few different colors of light instead of your flash.', '2004-11-10 16:48:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1004560, 118462, 26827, '<td valign="top">I like it, but it feels a little unbalanced, heavier on the left side.</td>', 'I like it, but it feels a little unbalanced, heavier on the left side.', '2004-11-10 16:48:57.000000', NULL, 1),
