(1004580, 120133, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good shot, clearly a macro.  I like the industrial feel of the subject and I think the exposure and post-processing subtly reinforces that.  Good!</td>', 'Good shot, clearly a macro.  I like the industrial feel of the subject and I think the exposure and post-processing subtly reinforces that.  Good!', '2004-11-10 16:52:36.000000', NULL, 1),
