(1004593, 120276, 26827, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the reflection on the corn distracts.  Either a straight light relection, or no reflection would be better.  This reflection just has too much detail.</td>', 'Good shot, but the reflection on the corn distracts.  Either a straight light relection, or no reflection would be better.  This reflection just has too much detail.', '2004-11-10 16:56:22.000000', NULL, 1),
