(1004815, 118379, 6999, '<td valign="top">good detail, and I like the fact that you''ve used just the barest hint of light to show the shape of the bottle here. - gives it a warmth and subtlety that appeals.</td>', 'good detail, and I like the fact that you''ve used just the barest hint of light to show the shape of the bottle here. - gives it a warmth and subtlety that appeals.', '2004-11-10 18:32:06.000000', NULL, 1),
