(1005013, 120238, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice and close, unique idea, but not enough depth of field to see details clearly.  I bet lighting was tricky, but better lighting would have improved the picture too.</td>', 'Nice and close, unique idea, but not enough depth of field to see details clearly.  I bet lighting was tricky, but better lighting would have improved the picture too.', '2004-11-10 19:52:43.000000', NULL, 1),
