(1005042, 119351, 29009, '<td valign="top">I thought the colors were good.  The overall shot was blurry.  I wonder if you had considered the use of aligning the crayons in a pattern (all in a straight line, fanned out, etc.) whether you would have more pleased with your final product.</td>', 'I thought the colors were good.  The overall shot was blurry.  I wonder if you had considered the use of aligning the crayons in a pattern (all in a straight line, fanned out, etc.) whether you would have more pleased with your final product.', '2004-11-10 20:09:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005046, 120098, 29009, '<td valign="top">I like that the eye is looking directly at the lens, and your creative decision to go for just the pupil instead of the entire eye.  The eyelids are distracting because they are in so much better focus than the eye lens.  Very pretty eye color!</td>', 'I like that the eye is looking directly at the lens, and your creative decision to go for just the pupil instead of the entire eye.  The eyelids are distracting because they are in so much better focus than the eye lens.  Very pretty eye color!', '2004-11-10 20:14:24.000000', NULL, 1),
