(1005051, 120269, 29009, '<td valign="top">I really liked your subject.  I found myself wishing that the entire key was in focus.  It''s clear that you worked hard to isolate the subject.</td>', 'I really liked your subject.  I found myself wishing that the entire key was in focus.  It''s clear that you worked hard to isolate the subject.', '2004-11-10 20:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
