(1005053, 120144, 29009, '<td valign="top">Perhaps it''s just my monitor (which I did try to adjust before commenting) but I thought the overall shot was too dark.  You''ve picked an interesting subject, and I would have liked to have seen more contrast between the subject and the background.</td>', 'Perhaps it''s just my monitor (which I did try to adjust before commenting) but I thought the overall shot was too dark.  You''ve picked an interesting subject, and I would have liked to have seen more contrast between the subject and the background.', '2004-11-10 20:22:01.000000', NULL, 1),
