(1005059, 120059, 29009, '<td valign="top">Muted colors were in line with your candelight choice.  Your use of focus did not allow me to immediately pick out the focal point - was it the flame, or the pool of wax, or something else?</td>', 'Muted colors were in line with your candelight choice.  Your use of focus did not allow me to immediately pick out the focal point - was it the flame, or the pool of wax, or something else?', '2004-11-10 20:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
