(1005072, 120021, 29009, '<td valign="top">Good color - good focus on the top line of barbed wire.  Without the title, I might not have known your intent.  I like the way you triangulated the lines of the fence with the horizon.</td>', 'Good color - good focus on the top line of barbed wire.  Without the title, I might not have known your intent.  I like the way you triangulated the lines of the fence with the horizon.', '2004-11-10 20:35:06.000000', NULL, 1),
