(1005078, 120283, 4585, '<td valign="top">Excellent concept!....I love the idea.....but...and a big BUT....colors are off....and too high key for this....i am still giving you a 7....GL!</td>', 'Excellent concept!....I love the idea.....but...and a big BUT....colors are off....and too high key for this....i am still giving you a 7....GL!', '2004-11-10 20:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005079, 119697, 29009, '<td valign="top">This is certainly a beautiful necklace, and I admire that you wanted to immortalize it.  I would, too, if I owned it!  It seems your background is more in focus than the necklace - or perhaps it''s the noise in the background that is distracting.  The position of the subject shows as much of the setting as the stones.  Perhaps if you had taken the shot from above the necklace you might have been more pleased with the result.</td>', 'This is certainly a beautiful necklace, and I admire that you wanted to immortalize it.  I would, too, if I owned it!  It seems your background is more in focus than the necklace - or perhaps it''s the noise in the background that is distracting.  The position of the subject shows as much of the setting as the stones.  Perhaps if you had taken the shot from above the necklace you might have been more pleased with the result.', '2004-11-10 20:41:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005080, 120261, 29009, '<td valign="top">You''ve certainly captured the feeling of heat.  If the background provided more contrast to the flame, this might have been an outstanding shot.</td>', 'You''ve certainly captured the feeling of heat.  If the background provided more contrast to the flame, this might have been an outstanding shot.', '2004-11-10 20:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005083, 118613, 29009, '<td valign="top">The expression in the eye is good.  I wonder if you would have been more pleased if you had focused on the lens/pupil area rather than the brow/lid.  Overall, the shot is overexposed.  Perhaps you did this on purpose for detail, but it might have been more powerful if you had gotten a bit closer.</td>', 'The expression in the eye is good.  I wonder if you would have been more pleased if you had focused on the lens/pupil area rather than the brow/lid.  Overall, the shot is overexposed.  Perhaps you did this on purpose for detail, but it might have been more powerful if you had gotten a bit closer.', '2004-11-10 20:45:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005085, 118870, 27842, '<td valign="top">Would be nicer if it did not have the green color cast.  Very creative though.</td>', 'Would be nicer if it did not have the green color cast.  Very creative though.', '2004-11-10 20:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
