(1005340, 118632, 27496, '<td valign="top">Of all the eye photos this was my winner.  You captured a lot of detail along with that catch light. Nice Job!</td>', 'Of all the eye photos this was my winner.  You captured a lot of detail along with that catch light. Nice Job!', '2004-11-10 23:46:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005342, 119351, 3080, '<td valign="top">I could say this is close up.  Grainy and out of focus too, but close up.  I like how you have arranged the crayons, and the colors are ok.  Lighting seems harsh though, which could be a reason for the grain and out of focusness.  I think had this been in focus it could have been a nice photo, but as is, it doesn''t appeal to me at all. ~Heather~</td>', 'I could say this is close up.  Grainy and out of focus too, but close up.  I like how you have arranged the crayons, and the colors are ok.  Lighting seems harsh though, which could be a reason for the grain and out of focusness.  I think had this been in focus it could have been a nice photo, but as is, it doesn''t appeal to me at all. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005344, 118780, 3080, '<td valign="top">DOF is awesome!  I really like this.  Lack of color is good.  Texture is very nice.  Focus and clarity are really good.  Lighting is perfect.  I see no reason this should not receive a 10 from me.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.  ~Heather~</td>', 'DOF is awesome!  I really like this.  Lack of color is good.  Texture is very nice.  Focus and clarity are really good.  Lighting is perfect.  I see no reason this should not receive a 10 from me.  Great shot and good luck in the challenge.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:50:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005348, 119853, 3080, '<td valign="top">Focus and clarity are very nice!  I like the small hints of color.  Lighting is really great, and DOF is right where it should be.  Solid color background is good, nothing distracting there, although there is a dark colored smear in the lower right hand corner.  Not sure if that''s from editing or something else, but it is not a huge deal.  Because of the size of the object I would consider this an extreme close up.  ~Heather~</td>', 'Focus and clarity are very nice!  I like the small hints of color.  Lighting is really great, and DOF is right where it should be.  Solid color background is good, nothing distracting there, although there is a dark colored smear in the lower right hand corner.  Not sure if that''s from editing or something else, but it is not a huge deal.  Because of the size of the object I would consider this an extreme close up.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005352, 119290, 3080, '<td valign="top">Definately an extreme close up.  Good texture.  Lighting seems good.  No distracting shadows or hot spots.  Focus seems a little soft to me, but it could just be the texture playing tricks on me.  I like how the subject fills the frame.  Overall a fun pic. ~Heather~</td>', 'Definately an extreme close up.  Good texture.  Lighting seems good.  No distracting shadows or hot spots.  Focus seems a little soft to me, but it could just be the texture playing tricks on me.  I like how the subject fills the frame.  Overall a fun pic. ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:54:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005355, 118887, 3080, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot.  My only preference would be to see more of the shot in focus.  While I appreciate DOF, I think this is slightly too narrow for my personal taste.  I like the lighting though.  Not quite sure why, cause it does seem dark, but it gives the photo a mood.  I like that.  ~Heather~</td>', 'This is a nice shot.  My only preference would be to see more of the shot in focus.  While I appreciate DOF, I think this is slightly too narrow for my personal taste.  I like the lighting though.  Not quite sure why, cause it does seem dark, but it gives the photo a mood.  I like that.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:56:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005357, 120280, 3080, '<td valign="top">this is the 3rd shot almost exactly the same that I have come across so far.  This one though is ''upside down'' which is a bit different than the other 2, but I can pretty much say the same thing for all 3 shots.  Lighting is good, focus is good, I love the texture.  My only preference would be if the ''V'' of the veins were coming out of a corner or somewhere other than dead center.  I can''t believe how almost identical these shots are.  ~Heather~</td>', 'this is the 3rd shot almost exactly the same that I have come across so far.  This one though is ''upside down'' which is a bit different than the other 2, but I can pretty much say the same thing for all 3 shots.  Lighting is good, focus is good, I love the texture.  My only preference would be if the ''V'' of the veins were coming out of a corner or somewhere other than dead center.  I can''t believe how almost identical these shots are.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-10 23:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005362, 119028, 3080, '<td valign="top">Fun shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping are great too.  I really like the shadow for some reason.  Background is perfect, nothing distracting there.  And DOF is right where I like to see it.  I don''t see anything that I''d like changed here.  Could be more ''extreme'' close up, but this is cute non the less. ~Heather~</td>', 'Fun shot.  Great focus and clarity.  The angle and framing/cropping are great too.  I really like the shadow for some reason.  Background is perfect, nothing distracting there.  And DOF is right where I like to see it.  I don''t see anything that I''d like changed here.  Could be more ''extreme'' close up, but this is cute non the less. ~Heather~', '2004-11-11 00:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005366, 120053, 3080, '<td valign="top">Maybe I''m missing something, but this does''t give the appearance of an extreme close up to me.  It looks like a huge piece of machinery.  And I''m not getting the title reference either.  That being said, I think it''s a nice photo.  I like the color and the focus and clarity are good, lighting really makes the photo.  Even though I don''t know what this is, it still appeals to me in some odd way. ~Heather~</td>', 'Maybe I''m missing something, but this does''t give the appearance of an extreme close up to me.  It looks like a huge piece of machinery.  And I''m not getting the title reference either.  That being said, I think it''s a nice photo.  I like the color and the focus and clarity are good, lighting really makes the photo.  Even though I don''t know what this is, it still appeals to me in some odd way. ~Heather~', '2004-11-11 00:03:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005368, 118679, 3080, '<td valign="top">You''re missing a shade of purple.  lol oh well.  I like the shot.  I do have 2 nit picks though.  First, the lighting on the blue pencil is way brighter than on the rest of them, making it stand out as a distraction.  Second, the spot where the purple color meets the wood on the purple pencil is rough, where the rest are smooth.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Good focus, great background, nothing distracting there.  And mostly lighting is good as well.  It''s a fun shot too, which is nice.  ~Heather~</td>', 'You''re missing a shade of purple.  lol oh well.  I like the shot.  I do have 2 nit picks though.  First, the lighting on the blue pencil is way brighter than on the rest of them, making it stand out as a distraction.  Second, the spot where the purple color meets the wood on the purple pencil is rough, where the rest are smooth.  Otherwise, a very nice shot.  Good focus, great background, nothing distracting there.  And mostly lighting is good as well.  It''s a fun shot too, which is nice.  ~Heather~', '2004-11-11 00:06:46.000000', NULL, 1),
