(1005638, 120161, 10768, '<td valign="top">I like the way this photo was set up.  Also like the gold cast and DOF.  Good work.</td>', 'I like the way this photo was set up.  Also like the gold cast and DOF.  Good work.', '2004-11-11 07:37:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005641, 119844, 10768, '<td valign="top">This shot is very cool.  It looks like you''re floating inside the orange.</td>', 'This shot is very cool.  It looks like you''re floating inside the orange.', '2004-11-11 07:38:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005642, 119959, 26487, '<td valign="top">Great, I wanna touch it.</td>', 'Great, I wanna touch it.', '2004-11-11 07:39:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005645, 118776, 26487, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2004-11-11 07:42:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005661, 119032, 24065, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and color.  I would have scored it higher if it had been cropped more at the top so the table wasn''t showing.</td>', 'Nice focus and color.  I would have scored it higher if it had been cropped more at the top so the table wasn''t showing.', '2004-11-11 07:56:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005665, 119007, 24065, '<td valign="top">In my humble opinion a closer crop on the left, cropping out all that overexposed sky, would greatly improve this photograph.  I applaud the focus and color and subject choice, but am distracted by the line pulling me into the part of the photo you probably didn''t want us to go.  Hope this is helpful.  :)</td>', 'In my humble opinion a closer crop on the left, cropping out all that overexposed sky, would greatly improve this photograph.  I applaud the focus and color and subject choice, but am distracted by the line pulling me into the part of the photo you probably didn''t want us to go.  Hope this is helpful.  :)', '2004-11-11 08:04:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005667, 118261, 22479, '<td valign="top">Good shot, but the focus is a bit soft on the foreground. Would have rated it higher if you had shot this with an increased DOF.</td>', 'Good shot, but the focus is a bit soft on the foreground. Would have rated it higher if you had shot this with an increased DOF.', '2004-11-11 08:05:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005668, 119984, 27482, '<td valign="top">The terrible quality of the image really ruins it, you got too much iso noise and artefacts and the colours look all smudgy so this pretty much sucks as far as I am concerned, no offense intended.  Keep it up though.</td>', 'The terrible quality of the image really ruins it, you got too much iso noise and artefacts and the colours look all smudgy so this pretty much sucks as far as I am concerned, no offense intended.  Keep it up though.', '2004-11-11 08:12:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005669, 120229, 22479, '<td valign="top">Cute, M&amp;M wars...<br/> <br/>Well exposed, a little loss of focus on the dead M&amp;M''s but overall a good shot.</td>', 'Cute, M&M wars... Well exposed, a little loss of focus on the dead M&M''s but overall a good shot.', '2004-11-11 08:12:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005670, 120236, 27482, '<td valign="top">Frame definately doesn´t help, I have never been fond of these kind of frames that go over the image itself.  Other than that a good shot.</td>', 'Frame definately doesn´t help, I have never been fond of these kind of frames that go over the image itself.  Other than that a good shot.', '2004-11-11 08:13:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005673, 119777, 27482, '<td valign="top">Hardly what I would call a Macro, this is more of a portrait...</td>', 'Hardly what I would call a Macro, this is more of a portrait...', '2004-11-11 08:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005674, 118555, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite of the shells in the bunch. Nice composition, good shot!</td>', 'I think this is my favorite of the shells in the bunch. Nice composition, good shot!', '2004-11-11 08:18:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005675, 118281, 27482, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea and good lighting on a tricky subject, too bad the shape itself isn´t more interesting or this would have been a guaranteed 10 from me.</td>', 'Excellent idea and good lighting on a tricky subject, too bad the shape itself isn´t more interesting or this would have been a guaranteed 10 from me.', '2004-11-11 08:18:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005676, 119706, 27482, '<td valign="top">Great shot, one of my favorites in this challenge, love the colour and shape and composition, 10 from me!</td>', 'Great shot, one of my favorites in this challenge, love the colour and shape and composition, 10 from me!', '2004-11-11 08:19:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005681, 120288, 22479, '<td valign="top">I think this shot works well. You used a good variety of shapes, sizes and colors. Overall a good shot!</td>', 'I think this shot works well. You used a good variety of shapes, sizes and colors. Overall a good shot!', '2004-11-11 08:21:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005686, 119814, 27482, '<td valign="top">The thumbnail looked VERY promising, with those small lights in the reflectionin the eye but then when I opened it the poor quality of the shot (the noise, softness, bad colours) became apparent and I got a bit dissapointed.  Still, a real good effort so keep it up!</td>', 'The thumbnail looked VERY promising, with those small lights in the reflectionin the eye but then when I opened it the poor quality of the shot (the noise, softness, bad colours) became apparent and I got a bit dissapointed.  Still, a real good effort so keep it up!', '2004-11-11 08:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005691, 118547, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, sharp, not over-processed. I think this is one of the best of the bunch, great shot!</td>', 'Nice colors, sharp, not over-processed. I think this is one of the best of the bunch, great shot!', '2004-11-11 08:23:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005692, 120178, 22479, '<td valign="top">Quite an amazing shot. Loss of focus on the handle of the brush, but perhaps that is unavoidable...One of the best of the bunch. Great shot!</td>', 'Quite an amazing shot. Loss of focus on the handle of the brush, but perhaps that is unavoidable...One of the best of the bunch. Great shot!', '2004-11-11 08:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005694, 119931, 22479, '<td valign="top">Very unique shot. Not a clue what it is though.</td>', 'Very unique shot. Not a clue what it is though.', '2004-11-11 08:23:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005695, 120280, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite of the leaf shots in the bunch. I think you cropped this one well and the focus, sharpness is excellent. Great shot!</td>', 'This is my favorite of the leaf shots in the bunch. I think you cropped this one well and the focus, sharpness is excellent. Great shot!', '2004-11-11 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005697, 120077, 27482, '<td valign="top">Whoha, too much coffee?  Anyway, the bloody veins (and I mean this litterally) really put me off this shot, good effort but this shot is just plain unflattering IMO, no offense intended...</td>', 'Whoha, too much coffee?  Anyway, the bloody veins (and I mean this litterally) really put me off this shot, good effort but this shot is just plain unflattering IMO, no offense intended...', '2004-11-11 08:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005698, 118531, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice picture, looks like a painting rather than a photograph.</td>', 'Nice picture, looks like a painting rather than a photograph.', '2004-11-11 08:24:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005702, 120267, 23921, '<td valign="top">Need little sharpness, its a good macro.</td>', 'Need little sharpness, its a good macro.', '2004-11-11 08:26:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005703, 120031, 27482, '<td valign="top">Very original, too bad you don´t get a sense of scale here because even though I don´t doubt for a second this bike is very very small since it is in this challenge, if I were to see this image in a magazine I would have no clue on how big the size of the bike is, it could just as easily be a real motorcycle.  Anyway, good shot, excellent lighting and good layout of the "road", it makes this image very interesting.</td>', 'Very original, too bad you don´t get a sense of scale here because even though I don´t doubt for a second this bike is very very small since it is in this challenge, if I were to see this image in a magazine I would have no clue on how big the size of the bike is, it could just as easily be a real motorcycle.  Anyway, good shot, excellent lighting and good layout of the "road", it makes this image very interesting.', '2004-11-11 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005704, 118776, 22479, '<td valign="top">Nice shot. Like the colors and the DOF. Good job!</td>', 'Nice shot. Like the colors and the DOF. Good job!', '2004-11-11 08:27:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005706, 120248, 22479, '<td valign="top">This is my favorite creature shot. Title goes well with the picture. Nice shot!</td>', 'This is my favorite creature shot. Title goes well with the picture. Nice shot!', '2004-11-11 08:28:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1005710, 119888, 27482, '<td valign="top">Awesome shot!  Love the monocolour in it but if you care at alla bout my advice it is to lose that frame, or at least to change it, I have never cared for frames that go over the image itself.  9</td>', 'Awesome shot!  Love the monocolour in it but if you care at alla bout my advice it is to lose that frame, or at least to change it, I have never cared for frames that go over the image itself.  9', '2004-11-11 08:32:32.000000', NULL, 1),
