(1005781, 119057, 22970, '<td valign="top">What can I say; its been done over and over and over again. But should I penalize your shot for that, NO. Next time maybe a more original shot or angle. With that said I think you have a good micro here. I wish the focal area could have included the entire RJ45 connector not just the front bottom and the yellow cable. There were more colors you could of captured in this shot with a different composition such as the green, red, and black wire that I think would of added to your photo. Good micro and good luck.</td>', 'What can I say; its been done over and over and over again. But should I penalize your shot for that, NO. Next time maybe a more original shot or angle. With that said I think you have a good micro here. I wish the focal area could have included the entire RJ45 connector not just the front bottom and the yellow cable. There were more colors you could of captured in this shot with a different composition such as the green, red, and black wire that I think would of added to your photo. Good micro and good luck.', '2004-11-11 09:24:17.000000', NULL, 1),
