(1005991, 119856, 19010, '<td valign="top">I was initialy amazed at this shot the colors. the bubbles. I was in rapture... well not quite but I liked it. Then I notced the desk top icons on the ball. slowly the process came together. and I realized it was just the reflection from a monitor. It was not some brilliant lighting schem as I had originaly thought. Then I was sad. T put it simply this went from a 9 to an 7 just because of the icons. This is a great shot I would definatly have to reshoot. and add to my portfolio. Not trying to be harsh but i feel that honesty is the only way to improve.. keep up the good work</td>', 'I was initialy amazed at this shot the colors. the bubbles. I was in rapture... well not quite but I liked it. Then I notced the desk top icons on the ball. slowly the process came together. and I realized it was just the reflection from a monitor. It was not some brilliant lighting schem as I had originaly thought. Then I was sad. T put it simply this went from a 9 to an 7 just because of the icons. This is a great shot I would definatly have to reshoot. and add to my portfolio. Not trying to be harsh but i feel that honesty is the only way to improve.. keep up the good work', '2004-11-11 11:15:52.000000', NULL, 1),
