(1006000, 120236, 29285, '<td valign="top">hahahahh</td>', 'hahahahh', '2004-11-11 11:21:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006005, 119716, 22970, '<td valign="top">Nice micro w/ good color and focus</td>', 'Nice micro w/ good color and focus', '2004-11-11 11:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006006, 120228, 19010, '<td valign="top">It seems like a pretty average shot to me. Its is definately a good macro. Just not vey interesting except maybe to a botanist. I did however go to a 6 instead of my average 5 because I liked the colors, it is a very clear and sharp image, and as for a close ups of a leaf it is a bit moreinteresting than most.</td>', 'It seems like a pretty average shot to me. Its is definately a good macro. Just not vey interesting except maybe to a botanist. I did however go to a 6 instead of my average 5 because I liked the colors, it is a very clear and sharp image, and as for a close ups of a leaf it is a bit moreinteresting than most.', '2004-11-11 11:25:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006010, 118988, 19807, '<td valign="top">hmmmm  I''ve seen this somwhere in this challenge before....</td>', 'hmmmm  I''ve seen this somwhere in this challenge before....', '2004-11-11 11:29:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006015, 120109, 19807, '<td valign="top">ewwwww now that''s just weird!</td>', 'ewwwww now that''s just weird!', '2004-11-11 11:36:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006016, 119619, 19807, '<td valign="top">nice detail</td>', 'nice detail', '2004-11-11 11:37:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006020, 118424, 28347, '<td valign="top">Are those nylon feathers clustered like rose petals? Or do birds actually grow like that?</td>', 'Are those nylon feathers clustered like rose petals? Or do birds actually grow like that?', '2004-11-11 11:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006021, 119069, 19807, '<td valign="top">too busy; where is the focus?</td>', 'too busy; where is the focus?', '2004-11-11 11:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006022, 119852, 19010, '<td valign="top">gold bar? 500 what? are the #''s pressed in or sticking out of the object? Why are they mirrored? So many questions to vey anser in this shot. I like the colors. I even line the shodws with the exeption of the shadow looking like the reflection of the photographer. I feel that this was not detailed  enough shot to allow the viewer to feel and see what it was that drew you to taking this shot. But still above the average in this challenge.</td>', 'gold bar? 500 what? are the #''s pressed in or sticking out of the object? Why are they mirrored? So many questions to vey anser in this shot. I like the colors. I even line the shodws with the exeption of the shadow looking like the reflection of the photographer. I feel that this was not detailed  enough shot to allow the viewer to feel and see what it was that drew you to taking this shot. But still above the average in this challenge.', '2004-11-11 11:42:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006023, 119945, 19807, '<td valign="top">if only the sky was blue.....</td>', 'if only the sky was blue.....', '2004-11-11 11:43:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006024, 119290, 19807, '<td valign="top">great use of an "everyday" subject.  nice detail and great sharpness.</td>', 'great use of an "everyday" subject.  nice detail and great sharpness.', '2004-11-11 11:44:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006027, 119492, 26679, '<td valign="top">This is one of those that you will quote in the future.<br/>"This image is both too dark and too light at the same time"<br/>I like the subject matter as it is certainly different, the image is made a little distracting because of the darkness of the left hand side and the over exposed lightness of the right hand side.</td>', 'This is one of those that you will quote in the future."This image is both too dark and too light at the same time"I like the subject matter as it is certainly different, the image is made a little distracting because of the darkness of the left hand side and the over exposed lightness of the right hand side.', '2004-11-11 11:45:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006028, 120200, 19807, '<td valign="top">should have cropped it into a vertical</td>', 'should have cropped it into a vertical', '2004-11-11 11:46:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006030, 118570, 26827, '<td valign="top">Took me a moment to realize what "stair-walker" meant.  Would like to know how you shot this.  Good shot!</td>', 'Took me a moment to realize what "stair-walker" meant.  Would like to know how you shot this.  Good shot!', '2004-11-11 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006031, 118613, 26679, '<td valign="top">The eye is an interesting subject for photography as it does strange things with light. You have captured a beautiful brown image here. I wish it were not as central on the picture as this gives a rather static feeling to the shot.</td>', 'The eye is an interesting subject for photography as it does strange things with light. You have captured a beautiful brown image here. I wish it were not as central on the picture as this gives a rather static feeling to the shot.', '2004-11-11 11:48:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006033, 119165, 19807, '<td valign="top">too dark</td>', 'too dark', '2004-11-11 11:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006034, 118609, 19807, '<td valign="top">nice lighting and crisp focus</td>', 'nice lighting and crisp focus', '2004-11-11 11:49:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006036, 120244, 19807, '<td valign="top">nice lighting</td>', 'nice lighting', '2004-11-11 11:50:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006038, 118238, 19807, '<td valign="top">focus!</td>', 'focus!', '2004-11-11 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006039, 119647, 19010, '<td valign="top">I feel that a macro could best be desribed as taking a photo of somthing in such a manner that you would get the feeling that you were an inch tall. Everything around you that was before so insignificant is not dazzling in it intricacy. The hairs on a leaf, the way sand apears as boulders, or the way an an''t has somehow become larger than you. This I don''t feel fits what I would consider a macro.</td>', 'I feel that a macro could best be desribed as taking a photo of somthing in such a manner that you would get the feeling that you were an inch tall. Everything around you that was before so insignificant is not dazzling in it intricacy. The hairs on a leaf, the way sand apears as boulders, or the way an an''t has somehow become larger than you. This I don''t feel fits what I would consider a macro.', '2004-11-11 11:50:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006043, 118217, 19807, '<td valign="top">is your dog really small?  No? then it''s not a macro</td>', 'is your dog really small?  No? then it''s not a macro', '2004-11-11 11:57:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006047, 120189, 19807, '<td valign="top">one of the better "innards-of-a-watch" shots</td>', 'one of the better "innards-of-a-watch" shots', '2004-11-11 11:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006048, 119488, 19807, '<td valign="top">one of the better coin shots</td>', 'one of the better coin shots', '2004-11-11 11:59:16.000000', NULL, 1);
