(1006151, 119889, 23921, '<td valign="top">I like this one, beautiful</td>', 'I like this one, beautiful', '2004-11-11 13:01:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006152, 119724, 29309, '<td valign="top">i like the colors</td>', 'i like the colors', '2004-11-11 13:02:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006159, 120282, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very nicely focused and the color is good, too. The light reflection on the apple is kind of distracting, it looks like you might have used a flash to take your picture. If this isn''t a flash reflection then your light source was too directly on the apple causing the reflection and hard shadow.</td>', 'Very nicely focused and the color is good, too. The light reflection on the apple is kind of distracting, it looks like you might have used a flash to take your picture. If this isn''t a flash reflection then your light source was too directly on the apple causing the reflection and hard shadow.', '2004-11-11 13:06:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006160, 118739, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cool photo. Bumping the score up. When I first voted on it, I gave it a very low score because it is far too small and hard to see. But it looks like a great image, too bad it''s not a better size.</td>', 'Cool photo. Bumping the score up. When I first voted on it, I gave it a very low score because it is far too small and hard to see. But it looks like a great image, too bad it''s not a better size.', '2004-11-11 13:07:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006164, 119776, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome photo! I love the reflections in the water.</td>', 'Awesome photo! I love the reflections in the water.', '2004-11-11 13:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006166, 119977, 18552, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject. I really like the texture visible in your picture and the color is lovely as well. I''m not really keen on the lighting, since it''s coming from the back it obscures the front part of this interesting jade bead. Also the shadow in the lower right corner is odd. I think this centered composition would work better if it were cropped in closer on the sides making the picture square.</td>', 'Very interesting subject. I really like the texture visible in your picture and the color is lovely as well. I''m not really keen on the lighting, since it''s coming from the back it obscures the front part of this interesting jade bead. Also the shadow in the lower right corner is odd. I think this centered composition would work better if it were cropped in closer on the sides making the picture square.', '2004-11-11 13:11:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006167, 120156, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome! I love the detail in this image. Is that corn syrup? It doesn''t look like water. :-)<br/> <br/>Great color tool! My only criticism would be that there are some JPEG artifacts i n the upper leftish corner, on the bottom side of the left edge. And the other edge of the leat has some sharpening/JPEG artifacts as well. But I''ll try not to let that distract me from this great, simple composition! <br/> <br/>This should get in the top 20, though that might be hard because of the sheer number of entries...</td>', 'Awesome! I love the detail in this image. Is that corn syrup? It doesn''t look like water. :-) Great color tool! My only criticism would be that there are some JPEG artifacts i n the upper leftish corner, on the bottom side of the left edge. And the other edge of the leat has some sharpening/JPEG artifacts as well. But I''ll try not to let that distract me from this great, simple composition!  This should get in the top 20, though that might be hard because of the sheer number of entries...', '2004-11-11 13:13:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006172, 120200, 22748, '<td valign="top">Awesome! A great, clean, attractive image! Brilliant concept. Smooth color. I have absolutely nothing bad to say about this image. <br/> <br/>The only thing is, I thought it was a pint glass at first, and thought there was some kind of weird perspective distortion going on to make it look squatty. Then I thought, that''s not even close to macro in my eyes. But this actually seems to be a shot glass, eh? In that case, it''s cool.  MY PICK for #1</td>', 'Awesome! A great, clean, attractive image! Brilliant concept. Smooth color. I have absolutely nothing bad to say about this image.  The only thing is, I thought it was a pint glass at first, and thought there was some kind of weird perspective distortion going on to make it look squatty. Then I thought, that''s not even close to macro in my eyes. But this actually seems to be a shot glass, eh? In that case, it''s cool.  MY PICK for #1', '2004-11-11 13:17:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006175, 120282, 22748, '<td valign="top">The simple, clean composition is good, but the flash ruins it. Try using some more interesting lighting, such as window light, or indandescent lamps. Then the shadows will be smoother and the texture and color of the apple will be vastly improved.</td>', 'The simple, clean composition is good, but the flash ruins it. Try using some more interesting lighting, such as window light, or indandescent lamps. Then the shadows will be smoother and the texture and color of the apple will be vastly improved.', '2004-11-11 13:18:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006178, 120195, 22748, '<td valign="top">Not a macro by any means, but it''s a gorgeous picture! I''m going to give it a fairly good score just for being beautiful. (cool title too!)</td>', 'Not a macro by any means, but it''s a gorgeous picture! I''m going to give it a fairly good score just for being beautiful. (cool title too!)', '2004-11-11 13:19:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006181, 119872, 22748, '<td valign="top">Cute title! LOL. Interesting composition, I''m glad you didn''t just center the cotton in the frame.</td>', 'Cute title! LOL. Interesting composition, I''m glad you didn''t just center the cotton in the frame.', '2004-11-11 13:20:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1006183, 120263, 22748, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting, great colors. Pushing the limit of macro, this isn''t that close to the subject, but it''s beautiful, so I''ll give it a good score.</td>', 'Nice lighting, great colors. Pushing the limit of macro, this isn''t that close to the subject, but it''s beautiful, so I''ll give it a good score.', '2004-11-11 13:21:40.000000', NULL, 1),
