(1007170, 120021, 26564, '<td valign="top">Nice capture but a little to birght on the left hand side.</td>', 'Nice capture but a little to birght on the left hand side.', '2004-11-12 06:08:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007171, 120123, 29111, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition with excellent definition. I like the blur on the lowest dart, it appears to be still shivering after the impact of landing.</td>', 'Very strong composition with excellent definition. I like the blur on the lowest dart, it appears to be still shivering after the impact of landing.', '2004-11-12 06:09:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007174, 120150, 29111, '<td valign="top">Still smiling, and still scratching head wondering how this one was done...<br/>Impressive level of magnification and an eye-catching idea.</td>', 'Still smiling, and still scratching head wondering how this one was done...Impressive level of magnification and an eye-catching idea.', '2004-11-12 06:17:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007177, 119371, 2780, '<td valign="top">The black and white looks very effective, but the drip seems to defy gravity. I would have rotated it to make it vertical.</td>', 'The black and white looks very effective, but the drip seems to defy gravity. I would have rotated it to make it vertical.', '2004-11-12 06:34:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007181, 119290, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is ok for the challenge.  i''ll give it a 6.  i''ll also tell you that if you go back and really work on the lighting, you''d have a shot you could sell.</td>', 'this is ok for the challenge.  i''ll give it a 6.  i''ll also tell you that if you go back and really work on the lighting, you''d have a shot you could sell.', '2004-11-12 06:36:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007182, 118371, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice warm lighting - empasizes the fact that this is a shot of inner workings. Detailed mechanism is often quite fetching if all in focus, but you have made a good coice of the hands as centre for your DOF.</td>', 'Nice warm lighting - empasizes the fact that this is a shot of inner workings. Detailed mechanism is often quite fetching if all in focus, but you have made a good coice of the hands as centre for your DOF.', '2004-11-12 06:36:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007183, 120093, 2780, '<td valign="top">The macro is in focus which is good, but there isnt really a focal point for me to look at.</td>', 'The macro is in focus which is good, but there isnt really a focal point for me to look at.', '2004-11-12 06:36:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007184, 120195, 23394, '<td valign="top">while you have an interesting composition, this isn''t a macro shot.  a macro shot basically fills the frame with the subject, or offers no other distracting elements to take attention away from the subject.</td>', 'while you have an interesting composition, this isn''t a macro shot.  a macro shot basically fills the frame with the subject, or offers no other distracting elements to take attention away from the subject.', '2004-11-12 06:40:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007186, 118717, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think the lighting kills this for me.  if you go back and reshoot this, consider taking 5 of them, gluing them together, and bending them to be legs and antenna.  something like that, shot from the right angle, would have rocked in this challenge.</td>', 'i think the lighting kills this for me.  if you go back and reshoot this, consider taking 5 of them, gluing them together, and bending them to be legs and antenna.  something like that, shot from the right angle, would have rocked in this challenge.', '2004-11-12 06:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007189, 120098, 23394, '<td valign="top">quit staring at me.  i mean it.  quit staring at me.  mommmm.  he won''t quit staring at me.  mom said if you don''t quit staring at me, i should poke you in the eye!<br/> <br/>you know, this is really a creepy image.  i don''t know if i wish it was a little sharper.</td>', 'quit staring at me.  i mean it.  quit staring at me.  mommmm.  he won''t quit staring at me.  mom said if you don''t quit staring at me, i should poke you in the eye! you know, this is really a creepy image.  i don''t know if i wish it was a little sharper.', '2004-11-12 06:45:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007191, 118547, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is the first ''wow'' shot i''ve hit!  great job.  this is a great idea, and i would encourage you to reshoot it, working on the lighting.  for the challenge, i''ll give it a 9, but as is, i wouldn''t buy it.</td>', 'this is the first ''wow'' shot i''ve hit!  great job.  this is a great idea, and i would encourage you to reshoot it, working on the lighting.  for the challenge, i''ll give it a 9, but as is, i wouldn''t buy it.', '2004-11-12 06:49:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007192, 120288, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the mixture of sizes, DoF, and muted colours. Great shot. 9</td>', 'I really like the mixture of sizes, DoF, and muted colours. Great shot. 9', '2004-11-12 06:50:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007194, 120001, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the little star flares look quite good, but overall this photo lacks a certain clarity which I would expect to see in a product shot. The background is too cluttered and distracts from the diamond.</td>', 'I think the little star flares look quite good, but overall this photo lacks a certain clarity which I would expect to see in a product shot. The background is too cluttered and distracts from the diamond.', '2004-11-12 06:51:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007195, 120037, 23394, '<td valign="top">this looks like a great subject, well lit, with a very bad background.</td>', 'this looks like a great subject, well lit, with a very bad background.', '2004-11-12 06:51:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007196, 119854, 2780, '<td valign="top">It looks as if the focus is off in the whole photo. Also, the subject matter isnt the most interesting or pleasant to look at.</td>', 'It looks as if the focus is off in the whole photo. Also, the subject matter isnt the most interesting or pleasant to look at.', '2004-11-12 06:52:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007197, 119392, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good product shot. The high key background is done well. The only problem is that definition is lost at the bottom of the rotating screen where the highlights merge with the background.</td>', 'Good product shot. The high key background is done well. The only problem is that definition is lost at the bottom of the rotating screen where the highlights merge with the background.', '2004-11-12 06:53:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007198, 118975, 2780, '<td valign="top">The photo is nice and had a good ''old timey'' feel and texture. The border spoils this in my opinion by looking too flat and bright.</td>', 'The photo is nice and had a good ''old timey'' feel and texture. The border spoils this in my opinion by looking too flat and bright.', '2004-11-12 06:53:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007199, 119130, 2780, '<td valign="top">This isn''t in focus, and the highlights are too blown out. Also, try using different angles and compositions to make the shot more interesting.</td>', 'This isn''t in focus, and the highlights are too blown out. Also, try using different angles and compositions to make the shot more interesting.', '2004-11-12 06:54:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007200, 119948, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really crowded and I dont really know what to look at. I think it needs a focal point.</td>', 'This is really crowded and I dont really know what to look at. I think it needs a focal point.', '2004-11-12 06:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007201, 119754, 27482, '<td valign="top">It´s a bit flat, this shot would improve a lot of you boosted the contrast by about +10 or 15 in photoshop.</td>', 'It´s a bit flat, this shot would improve a lot of you boosted the contrast by about +10 or 15 in photoshop.', '2004-11-12 06:56:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007202, 119920, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF is great, so we can still get a sense of scale from recognising the house, but it doesnt distract from the subject. I''m not a fan of the grey border though. It flattens the contrast.</td>', 'The DoF is great, so we can still get a sense of scale from recognising the house, but it doesnt distract from the subject. I''m not a fan of the grey border though. It flattens the contrast.', '2004-11-12 06:57:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007203, 120220, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice macro. I like the lighting and the DoF a lot. Very effective.</td>', 'Really nice macro. I like the lighting and the DoF a lot. Very effective.', '2004-11-12 06:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007204, 120177, 2780, '<td valign="top">A nice flowing abstract, but lacks anywhere for me to rest my eyes on. I think it needs a focal point.</td>', 'A nice flowing abstract, but lacks anywhere for me to rest my eyes on. I think it needs a focal point.', '2004-11-12 06:57:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007205, 120180, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like this. The DoF is perfect to make it a very appealing photo.</td>', 'I really like this. The DoF is perfect to make it a very appealing photo.', '2004-11-12 06:58:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007206, 119697, 2780, '<td valign="top">The whole photo looks very pixelated. Did you increase the size? It''s also rather centered. Try experimenting with more interesting compositions.</td>', 'The whole photo looks very pixelated. Did you increase the size? It''s also rather centered. Try experimenting with more interesting compositions.', '2004-11-12 06:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007207, 119071, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot. If the balls were cleaner it would be better but I know how hard they are to get shiney :)</td>', 'This is a nice shot. If the balls were cleaner it would be better but I know how hard they are to get shiney :)', '2004-11-12 06:59:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007208, 120285, 2780, '<td valign="top">Photos of other artwork/engravings dont really interest me. I might like it more with more dramatic lighting.</td>', 'Photos of other artwork/engravings dont really interest me. I might like it more with more dramatic lighting.', '2004-11-12 06:59:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007209, 119915, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the colours here, they are very appealing. The composition is a bit boring though, and theborder is far too think for my tastes.</td>', 'I like the colours here, they are very appealing. The composition is a bit boring though, and theborder is far too think for my tastes.', '2004-11-12 07:00:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007210, 118547, 29111, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition with terrific textures!</td>', 'Very strong composition with terrific textures!', '2004-11-12 07:00:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007211, 120053, 2780, '<td valign="top">Woah a bit over the top on the border, which is a shame cos the photo looks great! I just cant stop being distracted by the border though so I''ll have to knock off a few points.</td>', 'Woah a bit over the top on the border, which is a shame cos the photo looks great! I just cant stop being distracted by the border though so I''ll have to knock off a few points.', '2004-11-12 07:01:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007212, 119994, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the high key approach and the DoF. The crop is a bit tight on the right statue though.</td>', 'I like the high key approach and the DoF. The crop is a bit tight on the right statue though.', '2004-11-12 07:01:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007213, 119755, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think a border would have helped contain this photo. Boosting the contrast would stop it looking so washed out too.</td>', 'I think a border would have helped contain this photo. Boosting the contrast would stop it looking so washed out too.', '2004-11-12 07:02:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007214, 120248, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice contrast and colours. I wish the DoF was wider so the teeth were in focus though :)</td>', 'Really nice contrast and colours. I wish the DoF was wider so the teeth were in focus though :)', '2004-11-12 07:02:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007216, 119392, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting with a few hot areas.  While technically probably close to the 1:1 ratio, not as "macro" as it could have been.  Would like to have seen the picture focus on a small piece of your first Canon.</td>', 'Nice lighting with a few hot areas.  While technically probably close to the 1:1 ratio, not as "macro" as it could have been.  Would like to have seen the picture focus on a small piece of your first Canon.', '2004-11-12 07:04:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007217, 118365, 29111, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition and good choice to keep all the intricate parts in focus. The grain is a bit distracting though.</td>', 'Interesting composition and good choice to keep all the intricate parts in focus. The grain is a bit distracting though.', '2004-11-12 07:04:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007219, 120156, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very sharp detail, but the lighting is a bit harsh on the right of the drop. Try diffusing the light source a bit.</td>', 'Very sharp detail, but the lighting is a bit harsh on the right of the drop. Try diffusing the light source a bit.', '2004-11-12 07:05:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007220, 120144, 2780, '<td valign="top">Overall I feel the photo is too dark and lacks contrast.</td>', 'Overall I feel the photo is too dark and lacks contrast.', '2004-11-12 07:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007221, 118870, 23141, '<td valign="top">Cute subject with good focusing, but lighting is too dark/blue in this picture and it looks as though you''ve used jeans for the backdrop.</td>', 'Cute subject with good focusing, but lighting is too dark/blue in this picture and it looks as though you''ve used jeans for the backdrop.', '2004-11-12 07:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007222, 118763, 2780, '<td valign="top">This may have some underlying message which I don''t understand, but to me it''s just text and isnt very interesting.</td>', 'This may have some underlying message which I don''t understand, but to me it''s just text and isnt very interesting.', '2004-11-12 07:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007223, 118371, 2780, '<td valign="top">Some contrast would help this image ''pop'' more, and also USM would stop it looking too soft as it does now.</td>', 'Some contrast would help this image ''pop'' more, and also USM would stop it looking too soft as it does now.', '2004-11-12 07:06:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007224, 120210, 2780, '<td valign="top">The highlights are a bit over exposed and the compression looks a bit high.</td>', 'The highlights are a bit over exposed and the compression looks a bit high.', '2004-11-12 07:07:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007226, 119946, 29111, '<td valign="top">good low key, could be cropped a bit closer. The frame seems to have varying border widths for the inner black line.</td>', 'good low key, could be cropped a bit closer. The frame seems to have varying border widths for the inner black line.', '2004-11-12 07:07:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007230, 119635, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. The DoF is perfect, as it the exposure and everything. 10 out of 10.</td>', 'Excellent photo. The DoF is perfect, as it the exposure and everything. 10 out of 10.', '2004-11-12 07:08:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007231, 120105, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think with a B&amp;W photo you really need to boost the contrast a bit higher than this to give it more impact.</td>', 'I think with a B&W photo you really need to boost the contrast a bit higher than this to give it more impact.', '2004-11-12 07:09:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007232, 118953, 23141, '<td valign="top">Good!  A picture that not everyone else did :)  Nice use of depth of field...  Picture might be improved if the medal portion of the badge was completely in focus.</td>', 'Good!  A picture that not everyone else did :)  Nice use of depth of field...  Picture might be improved if the medal portion of the badge was completely in focus.', '2004-11-12 07:09:41.000000', NULL, 1),
