(1007234, 120264, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the DoF, it acts well to focus us on the main element but still allow the other details to be seen. The lighting is good too.</td>', 'I like the DoF, it acts well to focus us on the main element but still allow the other details to be seen. The lighting is good too.', '2004-11-12 07:10:28.000000', NULL, 1),
