(1007239, 120095, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF and lighting is great, but the photo is a bit small. Try using the whole 640px next time.</td>', 'The DoF and lighting is great, but the photo is a bit small. Try using the whole 640px next time.', '2004-11-12 07:12:18.000000', NULL, 1),
