(1007242, 120060, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice contrast and subtle colours. Is the candle actually lit? It looks like it is but I dont think it is... clever trick.</td>', 'Very nice contrast and subtle colours. Is the candle actually lit? It looks like it is but I dont think it is... clever trick.', '2004-11-12 07:13:47.000000', NULL, 1),
