(1007246, 119862, 23141, '<td valign="top">I''ve always liked cats'' feet too (and dogs'', for that matter, as long as they''re not muddy!)...  Good job of showing the details on this paw.  I would like to see this in plain black and white as the blue tint makes me think that Buster''s sleeping on someone''s work shirt :)</td>', 'I''ve always liked cats'' feet too (and dogs'', for that matter, as long as they''re not muddy!)...  Good job of showing the details on this paw.  I would like to see this in plain black and white as the blue tint makes me think that Buster''s sleeping on someone''s work shirt :)', '2004-11-12 07:14:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007248, 120077, 2780, '<td valign="top">The blown out highlight is a bit distracting and it seems to also be the only thing in focus, which is a shame.</td>', 'The blown out highlight is a bit distracting and it seems to also be the only thing in focus, which is a shame.', '2004-11-12 07:14:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007249, 119064, 11895, '<td valign="top">refreshingly different approach to the theme but suffers from too shallow depth of field</td>', 'refreshingly different approach to the theme but suffers from too shallow depth of field', '2004-11-12 07:15:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007250, 119981, 2780, '<td valign="top">If this was sharper and I could see the texture better it would be good, but as it is the photo holds no interest for me.</td>', 'If this was sharper and I could see the texture better it would be good, but as it is the photo holds no interest for me.', '2004-11-12 07:15:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007251, 118236, 27482, '<td valign="top">Do not get me wrong, I like this shot and it is better than 90% of other shots in the challenge but it´s very dark and there is no one spot that really draws you in, my eye at least wanders all over the frame. 8</td>', 'Do not get me wrong, I like this shot and it is better than 90% of other shots in the challenge but it´s very dark and there is no one spot that really draws you in, my eye at least wanders all over the frame. 8', '2004-11-12 07:15:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007254, 119007, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF and repetition are good, but the blown out sky is distracting. Try cropping it out by having a vertical photo with a bit less of the right side too.</td>', 'The DoF and repetition are good, but the blown out sky is distracting. Try cropping it out by having a vertical photo with a bit less of the right side too.', '2004-11-12 07:16:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007255, 119992, 27482, '<td valign="top">Normally I love shots with shallow DOF but here I feel that you used an aperture 2-3 stops bigger than would have worked to get all of the droplets in focus.  Still way better than most shots in the challenge, keep it up.</td>', 'Normally I love shots with shallow DOF but here I feel that you used an aperture 2-3 stops bigger than would have worked to get all of the droplets in focus.  Still way better than most shots in the challenge, keep it up.', '2004-11-12 07:17:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007256, 120156, 23141, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s amazingly close!  Nice lighting of details.  This picture could be improved a bit by working around the reflections from your softbox.  And there''s just a wee bit of dust on the upper right.  Overall, good job.</td>', 'Wow, that''s amazingly close!  Nice lighting of details.  This picture could be improved a bit by working around the reflections from your softbox.  And there''s just a wee bit of dust on the upper right.  Overall, good job.', '2004-11-12 07:17:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007258, 119795, 23141, '<td valign="top">Neat idea and lighting...  Love the gradient of your background, but focus is off.</td>', 'Neat idea and lighting...  Love the gradient of your background, but focus is off.', '2004-11-12 07:18:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007262, 119941, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the contrast is too high here, its far too busy to be able to look at for very long.</td>', 'I think the contrast is too high here, its far too busy to be able to look at for very long.', '2004-11-12 07:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007263, 119890, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness, but I would like it more if it were in focus.</td>', 'I like the abstractness, but I would like it more if it were in focus.', '2004-11-12 07:21:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007264, 118214, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the abstract shapes and colour variations here. It looks a little flat tho, try boosting contrast.</td>', 'I like the abstract shapes and colour variations here. It looks a little flat tho, try boosting contrast.', '2004-11-12 07:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007266, 119492, 2780, '<td valign="top">The whites look a bit over exposed but the contrast is good and works well with the B&amp;W.</td>', 'The whites look a bit over exposed but the contrast is good and works well with the B&W.', '2004-11-12 07:21:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007268, 119977, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice pick of an unusual subject.  Lighting (one light source, it looks like) is a bit bland and the angle doesn''t let us really see the carving.  Maybe next time use a white piece of paper to bounce light onto the dark side.  Interesting details could be better seen with a wider depth of field.</td>', 'Nice pick of an unusual subject.  Lighting (one light source, it looks like) is a bit bland and the angle doesn''t let us really see the carving.  Maybe next time use a white piece of paper to bounce light onto the dark side.  Interesting details could be better seen with a wider depth of field.', '2004-11-12 07:22:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007269, 120222, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t find photos of plain text very interesting, sorry.</td>', 'I don''t find photos of plain text very interesting, sorry.', '2004-11-12 07:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007270, 118261, 29111, '<td valign="top">Contrast is a little high, but this is very nicely detailed and composed</td>', 'Contrast is a little high, but this is very nicely detailed and composed', '2004-11-12 07:22:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007271, 120257, 2780, '<td valign="top">Great photo with brilliant contrast and vibrant colours. The border looks too thick to me though.</td>', 'Great photo with brilliant contrast and vibrant colours. The border looks too thick to me though.', '2004-11-12 07:22:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007272, 120022, 2780, '<td valign="top">Try using the full 640 pixels so we can see the detail better.</td>', 'Try using the full 640 pixels so we can see the detail better.', '2004-11-12 07:23:09.000000', NULL, 1),
