(1007292, 118674, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  Nice detail in the eyes (I never knew turtles had striped eyes!!  How strange!).  Focus is a bit off.</td>', 'Interesting subject.  Nice detail in the eyes (I never knew turtles had striped eyes!!  How strange!).  Focus is a bit off.', '2004-11-12 07:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
