(1007305, 118465, 25024, '<td valign="top">This is intended as constructive criticism, I like this a lot but its such a shame that the words ''FATAL ERROR'' themselves weren''t in sharp focus. The foreground is a little distracting as well - this could have been a potential ribboner.</td>', 'This is intended as constructive criticism, I like this a lot but its such a shame that the words ''FATAL ERROR'' themselves weren''t in sharp focus. The foreground is a little distracting as well - this could have been a potential ribboner.', '2004-11-12 07:40:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007306, 118440, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract areas of vivid colour. Good lighting brings out the shallow texture of the paint.</td>', 'Nice abstract areas of vivid colour. Good lighting brings out the shallow texture of the paint.', '2004-11-12 07:40:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007307, 118216, 2780, '<td valign="top">The highlights are a bit blown out and there arent really any dark areas so the contrast looks a bit flat. Try underexposing the photo more and then boosting the contrast. That should make it more ''dramatic''</td>', 'The highlights are a bit blown out and there arent really any dark areas so the contrast looks a bit flat. Try underexposing the photo more and then boosting the contrast. That should make it more ''dramatic''', '2004-11-12 07:40:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007309, 119627, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting pattern you''ve got here.  Tighter cropping would keep eyes in the picture.  Adding an element to give a sense of scale would give viewers something to focus on as well.</td>', 'Interesting pattern you''ve got here.  Tighter cropping would keep eyes in the picture.  Adding an element to give a sense of scale would give viewers something to focus on as well.', '2004-11-12 07:40:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007310, 118423, 2780, '<td valign="top">A soft focus filter and black and white would make this much more appealing and emotive. The purple and yellow bits on the face aren''t very nice to look at.</td>', 'A soft focus filter and black and white would make this much more appealing and emotive. The purple and yellow bits on the face aren''t very nice to look at.', '2004-11-12 07:41:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007311, 119701, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice macro.  More light would show the details better.</td>', 'Nice macro.  More light would show the details better.', '2004-11-12 07:41:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007312, 119131, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good use of shallow DoF. The cropping on the bottom is a bit tight though.</td>', 'Good use of shallow DoF. The cropping on the bottom is a bit tight though.', '2004-11-12 07:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007313, 118570, 29111, '<td valign="top">There is a good wallpaer quality about this shot. Nice lighting and shadows.</td>', 'There is a good wallpaer quality about this shot. Nice lighting and shadows.', '2004-11-12 07:42:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007314, 118238, 19010, '<td valign="top">well it''s not pleasnt to look at. While the re are some greatl lines and curves around the ashtray. There is also alot of good contrast. The picture is however badly out of focus. I personally  would like to have seen A more ineresting and pleasing subject for this challenge.</td>', 'well it''s not pleasnt to look at. While the re are some greatl lines and curves around the ashtray. There is also alot of good contrast. The picture is however badly out of focus. I personally  would like to have seen A more ineresting and pleasing subject for this challenge.', '2004-11-12 07:42:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007315, 119882, 2780, '<td valign="top">The contrast and lighting is good, but there is nothing to hold my interest, like an interesting angle or DoF.</td>', 'The contrast and lighting is good, but there is nothing to hold my interest, like an interesting angle or DoF.', '2004-11-12 07:42:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007317, 120120, 2780, '<td valign="top">This technique would work well in the impressionism masters challenge if you are qualified to enter. It makes it look like a painting.</td>', 'This technique would work well in the impressionism masters challenge if you are qualified to enter. It makes it look like a painting.', '2004-11-12 07:43:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007318, 119027, 2780, '<td valign="top">Ohhh so that''s what I''ve been doing wrong all these years!</td>', 'Ohhh so that''s what I''ve been doing wrong all these years!', '2004-11-12 07:43:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007319, 120253, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF to isolate the marble from the textured surface.</td>', 'Nice DoF to isolate the marble from the textured surface.', '2004-11-12 07:43:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007320, 119924, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting, did you do it through painting with light?</td>', 'Interesting lighting, did you do it through painting with light?', '2004-11-12 07:44:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007322, 118609, 19010, '<td valign="top">A very good almost textbook example of macro photography. Great shadows, perfect focus, good color, Its just not exciting to me.</td>', 'A very good almost textbook example of macro photography. Great shadows, perfect focus, good color, Its just not exciting to me.', '2004-11-12 07:45:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007324, 120281, 23141, '<td valign="top">Unique image and nice composition.   picture could be improved with softened light, or light from more than one angle.</td>', 'Unique image and nice composition.   picture could be improved with softened light, or light from more than one angle.', '2004-11-12 07:47:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007329, 120003, 23141, '<td valign="top">Neat drop, but it looks like it''s coming from an eyedropper, which ruins all the fun :)  Since you were able to get so close, it would have been great to see something interesting in your inverted horizon as well.</td>', 'Neat drop, but it looks like it''s coming from an eyedropper, which ruins all the fun :)  Since you were able to get so close, it would have been great to see something interesting in your inverted horizon as well.', '2004-11-12 07:49:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007330, 120132, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice macro, but berries are out of focus.</td>', 'Nice macro, but berries are out of focus.', '2004-11-12 07:49:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007331, 120157, 19010, '<td valign="top">wow what colors, I realy like the colors on this one. I don''t get the title but that didn''t effect my score. I like the lighting, the shadows, and how crisp this image is. The only thing I have negative with this shot is it too "studio" for my personall taste. I think I would have prefered to see this sitting on a sandy background. Giving it a more natural feeling. Nice job.. keep up these great shots comming.</td>', 'wow what colors, I realy like the colors on this one. I don''t get the title but that didn''t effect my score. I like the lighting, the shadows, and how crisp this image is. The only thing I have negative with this shot is it too "studio" for my personall taste. I think I would have prefered to see this sitting on a sandy background. Giving it a more natural feeling. Nice job.. keep up these great shots comming.', '2004-11-12 07:50:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007333, 118776, 23141, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Nice colors too...  Took me a second to figure out what you have here.</td>', 'Very cool!  Nice colors too...  Took me a second to figure out what you have here.', '2004-11-12 07:52:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007336, 118393, 19010, '<td valign="top">While I do like this shot. It has great contrast with the brass on black. I like the DOF and the color. I just don''t feel it is a macro. Perhaps a hero shot. But Just can''t see it aa a macro.</td>', 'While I do like this shot. It has great contrast with the brass on black. I like the DOF and the color. I just don''t feel it is a macro. Perhaps a hero shot. But Just can''t see it aa a macro.', '2004-11-12 07:53:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007337, 119975, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject but could be more of a macro.  Needs better focusing.</td>', 'Interesting subject but could be more of a macro.  Needs better focusing.', '2004-11-12 07:53:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007338, 119755, 23141, '<td valign="top">All that sugar makes me not want to eat Froot Loops :)  Nice capture of details!</td>', 'All that sugar makes me not want to eat Froot Loops :)  Nice capture of details!', '2004-11-12 07:53:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007339, 120235, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, good lighting.</td>', 'Nice and simple, good lighting.', '2004-11-12 07:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007342, 120006, 19010, '<td valign="top">Yup it''s most definately a macro. Lots of lines and details. I think you should have used a bit more on the satration. It would have brought out the rainbow like colors in the dark areas better.</td>', 'Yup it''s most definately a macro. Lots of lines and details. I think you should have used a bit more on the satration. It would have brought out the rainbow like colors in the dark areas better.', '2004-11-12 07:56:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007343, 118361, 23141, '<td valign="top">Interesting angle.  Nice depth of field, but picture needs somewhere solid for eye to land, maybe the red button if it were compositionally more prominent in the picture?</td>', 'Interesting angle.  Nice depth of field, but picture needs somewhere solid for eye to land, maybe the red button if it were compositionally more prominent in the picture?', '2004-11-12 07:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007346, 119989, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice macro and great lighting!</td>', 'Nice macro and great lighting!', '2004-11-12 07:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007348, 119845, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice setup, but not a true macro and main subject (robot) is distractingly out of focus.</td>', 'Nice setup, but not a true macro and main subject (robot) is distractingly out of focus.', '2004-11-12 08:00:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007350, 120021, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice scenic view and beautiful colors.  Barbed wire in the foreground is distractingly out of focus.</td>', 'Nice scenic view and beautiful colors.  Barbed wire in the foreground is distractingly out of focus.', '2004-11-12 08:01:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007353, 120245, 23141, '<td valign="top">Nice details!</td>', 'Nice details!', '2004-11-12 08:06:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007354, 119697, 23141, '<td valign="top">Pretty, but picture is pixellated/over-sharpened.</td>', 'Pretty, but picture is pixellated/over-sharpened.', '2004-11-12 08:07:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007355, 118775, 29111, '<td valign="top">Charming subject and nicely framed. Wasn''t sure about the high contrast when I first saw it, but the effect is actually growing on me...</td>', 'Charming subject and nicely framed. Wasn''t sure about the high contrast when I first saw it, but the effect is actually growing on me...', '2004-11-12 08:10:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007357, 118643, 25355, '<td valign="top">Ah, Palekh.</td>', 'Ah, Palekh.', '2004-11-12 08:19:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007367, 119800, 29111, '<td valign="top">Slight camera shake, but otherwise well lit.</td>', 'Slight camera shake, but otherwise well lit.', '2004-11-12 08:39:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007375, 120276, 28599, '<td valign="top">Nice Color. I can see the camera reflection in the kernels</td>', 'Nice Color. I can see the camera reflection in the kernels', '2004-11-12 08:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007380, 119695, 28599, '<td valign="top">I like the reflection of the chess board in the Pawn. Nice</td>', 'I like the reflection of the chess board in the Pawn. Nice', '2004-11-12 08:50:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007381, 118780, 28599, '<td valign="top">I like the B&amp;W.</td>', 'I like the B&W.', '2004-11-12 08:52:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007383, 120220, 4380, '<td valign="top">i like the sepia colour, the great composition ,textures... exceptional image, one of my favorite to win the ribbon...its a 10! for me</td>', 'i like the sepia colour, the great composition ,textures... exceptional image, one of my favorite to win the ribbon...its a 10! for me', '2004-11-12 08:54:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007384, 118593, 28599, '<td valign="top">Very eery. Nice color on the eye</td>', 'Very eery. Nice color on the eye', '2004-11-12 08:55:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007385, 119009, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great macro. I like the reflection in the eye. But is it you on the left? I would have cropped a little tighter on the left to avoid the person''s reflection. Otherwise, color, focus are very good.</td>', 'Great macro. I like the reflection in the eye. But is it you on the left? I would have cropped a little tighter on the left to avoid the person''s reflection. Otherwise, color, focus are very good.', '2004-11-12 08:55:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007387, 119959, 24715, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting and the detail of the nose. Very peaceful.</td>', 'Nice lighting and the detail of the nose. Very peaceful.', '2004-11-12 08:57:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007391, 119990, 28599, '<td valign="top">Very hipnotic. Nice contrast</td>', 'Very hipnotic. Nice contrast', '2004-11-12 08:59:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007392, 120084, 24715, '<td valign="top">Very cool. Good backlighting, detail. I have some amber with bugs in it, but I thought DPCers would complain. Good shot!</td>', 'Very cool. Good backlighting, detail. I have some amber with bugs in it, but I thought DPCers would complain. Good shot!', '2004-11-12 09:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007395, 120236, 28599, '<td valign="top">The border should have been shaded in.</td>', 'The border should have been shaded in.', '2004-11-12 09:02:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007397, 118524, 28599, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast and texture.</td>', 'Nice contrast and texture.', '2004-11-12 09:03:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007416, 118839, 27605, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting.  A real contender, I believe.</td>', 'I really like the lighting.  A real contender, I believe.', '2004-11-12 09:28:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007421, 119855, 27605, '<td valign="top">Like the almost "shadow" image of the lefthand page. Funny entry!</td>', 'Like the almost "shadow" image of the lefthand page. Funny entry!', '2004-11-12 09:31:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007426, 118314, 19010, '<td valign="top">Its just a glow in the middle of a dark screen. Perhaps I''m missing somthing but it''s just not very imaginative.</td>', 'Its just a glow in the middle of a dark screen. Perhaps I''m missing somthing but it''s just not very imaginative.', '2004-11-12 09:35:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007429, 118644, 19010, '<td valign="top">It has some nice curves for the eyes to follow. The lighting on the bottom left is a bit harsh. I feel this is just to simple. perhaps a cloudy sky,  or reflection in a pool of water, or possible try to get the reflection, xshadow nad the object in 1 shot would have been very nice.</td>', 'It has some nice curves for the eyes to follow. The lighting on the bottom left is a bit harsh. I feel this is just to simple. perhaps a cloudy sky,  or reflection in a pool of water, or possible try to get the reflection, xshadow nad the object in 1 shot would have been very nice.', '2004-11-12 09:39:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007431, 119888, 3569, '<td valign="top">the frame doesn''t work for me, otherwise nice</td>', 'the frame doesn''t work for me, otherwise nice', '2004-11-12 09:41:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007434, 118547, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice colors and textures</td>', 'nice colors and textures', '2004-11-12 09:42:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007436, 119940, 19010, '<td valign="top">great color contrast, wonderfull definition, I really like this shot with only one small complaint. I dont like the tiney yellow dots on the bottom of the lime.  One of my top picks. Keep up the great work.</td>', 'great color contrast, wonderfull definition, I really like this shot with only one small complaint. I dont like the tiney yellow dots on the bottom of the lime.  One of my top picks. Keep up the great work.', '2004-11-12 09:44:09.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1007437, 119953, 24715, '<td valign="top">Great contrast, lighting and texture.</td>', 'Great contrast, lighting and texture.', '2004-11-12 09:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007438, 120000, 3569, '<td valign="top">nice little cockateal</td>', 'nice little cockateal', '2004-11-12 09:44:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007442, 120292, 3569, '<td valign="top">Nice blue jay feathers</td>', 'Nice blue jay feathers', '2004-11-12 09:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007443, 120118, 19010, '<td valign="top">The fire is a little out of focus, but I don''t necessarily see anything wrong with that. I like the concept behind this shot and the color. The globe as the center of intrest is also very well defined. I don''t think I care for wht apears to be a golf tee holding up the little globe. But without it I don''t think I could tell this was a macro.  All around good shot...</td>', 'The fire is a little out of focus, but I don''t necessarily see anything wrong with that. I like the concept behind this shot and the color. The globe as the center of intrest is also very well defined. I don''t think I care for wht apears to be a golf tee holding up the little globe. But without it I don''t think I could tell this was a macro.  All around good shot...', '2004-11-12 09:49:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007453, 118526, 19010, '<td valign="top">Ok I realy like the color and feel of this one. I even like the shadows and the lighting.  I can''t however see "Oak" at all... But thats part of the fun of macro photography is fooling the person looking at the photo. I also would have a hard time calling this a macro.. not because it dosn''t fit the definition , but because I cant tell what it is or its scale in the theme of things, For all I know the red blobs of paint (not likely but hey I''m guessing) could be rather large. But other than that I like this shot.</td>', 'Ok I realy like the color and feel of this one. I even like the shadows and the lighting.  I can''t however see "Oak" at all... But thats part of the fun of macro photography is fooling the person looking at the photo. I also would have a hard time calling this a macro.. not because it dosn''t fit the definition , but because I cant tell what it is or its scale in the theme of things, For all I know the red blobs of paint (not likely but hey I''m guessing) could be rather large. But other than that I like this shot.', '2004-11-12 09:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007481, 119794, 24546, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea. I like the way you have positioned the lines in a diagonal.  Good focus on all the details.  To the left of the 4''s you have a hot spot that draws my eye.</td>', 'Excellent idea. I like the way you have positioned the lines in a diagonal.  Good focus on all the details.  To the left of the 4''s you have a hot spot that draws my eye.', '2004-11-12 10:13:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007491, 118680, 24546, '<td valign="top">I certainly like your theme here.  The different sizes and colors on the screws keep my eye exploring the image.  And your placement - while random - they are placed parallel to each other which keeps they eye moving well through the frame.  The focus isn''t sharp on any of them - which detracts from an otherwise excellent entry.</td>', 'I certainly like your theme here.  The different sizes and colors on the screws keep my eye exploring the image.  And your placement - while random - they are placed parallel to each other which keeps they eye moving well through the frame.  The focus isn''t sharp on any of them - which detracts from an otherwise excellent entry.', '2004-11-12 10:18:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007505, 120053, 7485, '<td valign="top">A photo this good does not need four frames - 7</td>', 'A photo this good does not need four frames - 7', '2004-11-12 10:26:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007519, 118767, 13709, '<td valign="top">nice graffitti! "angst" means "fear" in my language by the way, so I guess you''re from germany, too?<br/>6/10.</td>', 'nice graffitti! "angst" means "fear" in my language by the way, so I guess you''re from germany, too?6/10.', '2004-11-12 10:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007521, 118440, 13709, '<td valign="top">the contrast of the two colours is very good IMO!<br/>Nice detail also! 7/10</td>', 'the contrast of the two colours is very good IMO!Nice detail also! 7/10', '2004-11-12 10:40:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007522, 118960, 24546, '<td valign="top">I think you had a great idea here - those rusty - rich texture nut, bolt and strap are very interesting. And I like how you have using depth of field with the right area sharp fading off into the background on the left. Compositionally this one would have been better if you had placed the right vertical threads more in the thirds position - leaving a little bit of "breathing" room on the right.</td>', 'I think you had a great idea here - those rusty - rich texture nut, bolt and strap are very interesting. And I like how you have using depth of field with the right area sharp fading off into the background on the left. Compositionally this one would have been better if you had placed the right vertical threads more in the thirds position - leaving a little bit of "breathing" room on the right.', '2004-11-12 10:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007523, 120014, 13709, '<td valign="top">reminds me of terminator2. I like the reflections in the liquid metal! 7/10</td>', 'reminds me of terminator2. I like the reflections in the liquid metal! 7/10', '2004-11-12 10:41:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007525, 119972, 24546, '<td valign="top">Nice use of line.</td>', 'Nice use of line.', '2004-11-12 10:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007527, 119768, 24546, '<td valign="top">Strong entry - Wish the depth of field had been a little bigger - the lower part of the photo isn''t sharp.</td>', 'Strong entry - Wish the depth of field had been a little bigger - the lower part of the photo isn''t sharp.', '2004-11-12 10:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007532, 119947, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro very clear and interesting. I really enjoy the colors.  Its just not somthing I would buy to hang on my wall.  That would be the only negative I have on this photo. great job..</td>', 'Great macro very clear and interesting. I really enjoy the colors.  Its just not somthing I would buy to hang on my wall.  That would be the only negative I have on this photo. great job..', '2004-11-12 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007535, 119894, 24546, '<td valign="top">This is a great shot -nice use of color and good composition, but it is more of a still life than a macro.</td>', 'This is a great shot -nice use of color and good composition, but it is more of a still life than a macro.', '2004-11-12 10:49:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007537, 118803, 24546, '<td valign="top">This would hve been stronger if you had placed it better in the thirds position - it feels too far to the left to me.  Otherwise - good idea great sharpness and rich color.</td>', 'This would hve been stronger if you had placed it better in the thirds position - it feels too far to the left to me.  Otherwise - good idea great sharpness and rich color.', '2004-11-12 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007538, 119755, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the minor scatches on the spoon.  While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work</td>', 'Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the minor scatches on the spoon.  While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work', '2004-11-12 10:51:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007539, 120197, 3569, '<td valign="top">beautiful peacock</td>', 'beautiful peacock', '2004-11-12 10:51:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007540, 119730, 3569, '<td valign="top">pheasant feathers.. nice</td>', 'pheasant feathers.. nice', '2004-11-12 10:51:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007542, 119737, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like how the DoF plays with the lines and creates good different sections of the photo. I would have liked to see a bit more contrast added though</td>', 'I like how the DoF plays with the lines and creates good different sections of the photo. I would have liked to see a bit more contrast added though', '2004-11-12 10:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007543, 120263, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work</td>', 'Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work', '2004-11-12 10:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007544, 119022, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice detail, did you try this in a duotone?</td>', 'Really nice detail, did you try this in a duotone?', '2004-11-12 10:52:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007545, 120178, 27023, '<td valign="top">Great shot!</td>', 'Great shot!', '2004-11-12 10:53:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007546, 120115, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would be better if the background was a more uniform black, and with a more interesting composition.</td>', 'This would be better if the background was a more uniform black, and with a more interesting composition.', '2004-11-12 10:53:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007548, 120101, 24546, '<td valign="top">Excellent idea.  Nice use of line and color.  It would have been a stronger entry if your depth of field had been deeper so that most of those lines were sharply focused. It would have been a stronger composition if you had the point of the dart positioned at one of the intersections of the thirds lines.</td>', 'Excellent idea.  Nice use of line and color.  It would have been a stronger entry if your depth of field had been deeper so that most of those lines were sharply focused. It would have been a stronger composition if you had the point of the dart positioned at one of the intersections of the thirds lines.', '2004-11-12 10:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007549, 118757, 27023, '<td valign="top">Beautiful.</td>', 'Beautiful.', '2004-11-12 10:53:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007550, 120276, 2780, '<td valign="top">Putting this in a softbox would help reduce the distracting shadows and create more even lighting</td>', 'Putting this in a softbox would help reduce the distracting shadows and create more even lighting', '2004-11-12 10:53:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007551, 118674, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the many variations of colorn the turtles skin.  While impressive from a photo graphic stand point.  Keep Up the great work</td>', 'Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the many variations of colorn the turtles skin.  While impressive from a photo graphic stand point.  Keep Up the great work', '2004-11-12 10:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007552, 120009, 24546, '<td valign="top">Nice rich colors, good depth of field, sharp focus - nice use of both horizontal and vertical lines.</td>', 'Nice rich colors, good depth of field, sharp focus - nice use of both horizontal and vertical lines.', '2004-11-12 10:54:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007553, 119915, 7291, '<td valign="top">Funny title.  The warm sunset lighting is nice as well.</td>', 'Funny title.  The warm sunset lighting is nice as well.', '2004-11-12 10:54:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007554, 119256, 2780, '<td valign="top">Try applying USM to this after resizing to sharpen it and bring out the details better. Its too blurry at the moment.</td>', 'Try applying USM to this after resizing to sharpen it and bring out the details better. Its too blurry at the moment.', '2004-11-12 10:54:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007555, 118934, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a very unusual photo in the way it''s composed, but I think it''s very effective. Nice shot.</td>', 'This is a very unusual photo in the way it''s composed, but I think it''s very effective. Nice shot.', '2004-11-12 10:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007556, 119845, 2780, '<td valign="top">Having the robot at the front out of focus is rather distracting, as it blocks off other areas which are in focus.</td>', 'Having the robot at the front out of focus is rather distracting, as it blocks off other areas which are in focus.', '2004-11-12 10:55:17.000000', NULL, 1),
