(1007566, 118569, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the abstractness of this photo. The composition and DoF work well. The title is a bit long though. I also think a touch more contrast in PP would do wonders.</td>', 'I like the abstractness of this photo. The composition and DoF work well. The title is a bit long though. I also think a touch more contrast in PP would do wonders.', '2004-11-12 10:57:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007568, 120116, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good composition and DoF. I think the lighting is a bit harsh. Some fill-lighting would help stop the shadow being so dark.</td>', 'Good composition and DoF. I think the lighting is a bit harsh. Some fill-lighting would help stop the shadow being so dark.', '2004-11-12 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007569, 120053, 19010, '<td valign="top">I feel that a macro could best be desribed as taking a photo of somthing in such a manner that you would get the feeling that you were an inch tall. Everything around you that was before so insignificant is not dazzling in it intricacy. The hairs on a leaf, the way sand apears as boulders, or the way an an''t has somehow become larger than you. This I don''t feel fits what I would consider a macro. I do however absolutaly love This shot It has great color and tones. My eyes wander from one lace to another making this a very exciting photo. Keep up the great work.</td>', 'I feel that a macro could best be desribed as taking a photo of somthing in such a manner that you would get the feeling that you were an inch tall. Everything around you that was before so insignificant is not dazzling in it intricacy. The hairs on a leaf, the way sand apears as boulders, or the way an an''t has somehow become larger than you. This I don''t feel fits what I would consider a macro. I do however absolutaly love This shot It has great color and tones. My eyes wander from one lace to another making this a very exciting photo. Keep up the great work.', '2004-11-12 10:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007570, 118803, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is really good, I like the colours and the idea. I think it''s cropped a bit too tight on the top and the bottom though.</td>', 'This is really good, I like the colours and the idea. I think it''s cropped a bit too tight on the top and the bottom though.', '2004-11-12 10:58:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007571, 120034, 2780, '<td valign="top">I love shots like this, showing abstract shapes and movement. 10</td>', 'I love shots like this, showing abstract shapes and movement. 10', '2004-11-12 10:59:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007573, 118340, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting and colouring really suit the subject with the cobwebs and stuff. Really nice shot. 10</td>', 'The lighting and colouring really suit the subject with the cobwebs and stuff. Really nice shot. 10', '2004-11-12 10:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
