(1007575, 118960, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the rust and peeling paint. even managed to get the wood grain well defined and in focus.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work</td>', 'Great macro good color and sharpness. You cartured everything including the rust and peeling paint. even managed to get the wood grain well defined and in focus.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work', '2004-11-12 11:00:34.000000', NULL, 1),
