(1007673, 120142, 27161, '<td valign="top">The eye reflections I''ve tried to make haven''t come out any where near as clear.  Good job.  The blue coloring works well.</td>', 'The eye reflections I''ve tried to make haven''t come out any where near as clear.  Good job.  The blue coloring works well.', '2004-11-12 11:29:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007676, 119944, 27161, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Works much better than the flaming matches in the competition.</td>', 'Great shot.  Works much better than the flaming matches in the competition.', '2004-11-12 11:30:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007677, 120153, 27161, '<td valign="top">Good color.  Looks like some glittery gel.</td>', 'Good color.  Looks like some glittery gel.', '2004-11-12 11:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007680, 119953, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really like the simplicity of the colours and the overall photo. Very nice work.</td>', 'I really like the simplicity of the colours and the overall photo. Very nice work.', '2004-11-12 11:33:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007681, 118757, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice DoF and good detail captured.</td>', 'Nice DoF and good detail captured.', '2004-11-12 11:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007682, 118373, 2780, '<td valign="top">There is not really anywhere for me to focus on. I think it needs a more obvious focal point.</td>', 'There is not really anywhere for me to focus on. I think it needs a more obvious focal point.', '2004-11-12 11:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007683, 120118, 27161, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition and color.  Good DOF on the flame.  It looks like there are some specs of light reflecting off the US, which are distracting, but otherwise great job.</td>', 'Beautiful composition and color.  Good DOF on the flame.  It looks like there are some specs of light reflecting off the US, which are distracting, but otherwise great job.', '2004-11-12 11:34:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007684, 119103, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF is good, but I would make it shallowed so the back berries are just becoming out of focus a bit. The pic looks a bit oversharpened too.</td>', 'The DoF is good, but I would make it shallowed so the back berries are just becoming out of focus a bit. The pic looks a bit oversharpened too.', '2004-11-12 11:34:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007685, 120175, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. The white balance looks wrong too.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. The white balance looks wrong too.', '2004-11-12 11:35:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007686, 120196, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing or not trying to focus so close.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing or not trying to focus so close.', '2004-11-12 11:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007688, 118281, 27161, '<td valign="top">I really like this picture, but I don''t understand how it relates to the title.</td>', 'I really like this picture, but I don''t understand how it relates to the title.', '2004-11-12 11:35:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007689, 120139, 2780, '<td valign="top">That would hurt your teeth I think! Interesting idea :)</td>', 'That would hurt your teeth I think! Interesting idea :)', '2004-11-12 11:35:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007690, 118384, 2780, '<td valign="top">The contrast is great, as your title suggests :) I would have liked the focus to be close to the front of the photo rather than the back.</td>', 'The contrast is great, as your title suggests :) I would have liked the focus to be close to the front of the photo rather than the back.', '2004-11-12 11:36:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007692, 118870, 2780, '<td valign="top">Photos of figurines don''t really interest me, and in this one it also looks like you have the wrong WB set. The lighting is a bit flat and uninteresting too. I like the background though.</td>', 'Photos of figurines don''t really interest me, and in this one it also looks like you have the wrong WB set. The lighting is a bit flat and uninteresting too. I like the background though.', '2004-11-12 11:37:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007693, 119339, 2780, '<td valign="top">The holes are a good focal point. I think this ''wood'' look better in a high contrast B&amp;W shot.</td>', 'The holes are a good focal point. I think this ''wood'' look better in a high contrast B&W shot.', '2004-11-12 11:37:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007695, 119985, 2780, '<td valign="top">I dont like that the border is only around 2 edges. I think it distracts from the photo.</td>', 'I dont like that the border is only around 2 edges. I think it distracts from the photo.', '2004-11-12 11:38:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007697, 119064, 27161, '<td valign="top">I think the twig in the middle and the stick in front of the little tree on the right hurt the pic. I''m more interested in the little bushy things on the left and in the back next to the little tree.  But good color and light.</td>', 'I think the twig in the middle and the stick in front of the little tree on the right hurt the pic. I''m more interested in the little bushy things on the left and in the back next to the little tree.  But good color and light.', '2004-11-12 11:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007698, 118986, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent lighting and detail, but I think it''s too over-sharpened.</td>', 'Excellent lighting and detail, but I think it''s too over-sharpened.', '2004-11-12 11:38:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007699, 120109, 20115, '<td valign="top">This is crazy--it stopped me dead in my tracks of voting from one to the next.  How the hell did you do this--with a mini camera at the back of your throat?--Doubtful.  Am I missing the obvious.  This is incredible--looking forward to finding out how.  It is amazing, however, I am not sure I like it--it might fall into the category of "pictures I really don''t need to see".</td>', 'This is crazy--it stopped me dead in my tracks of voting from one to the next.  How the hell did you do this--with a mini camera at the back of your throat?--Doubtful.  Am I missing the obvious.  This is incredible--looking forward to finding out how.  It is amazing, however, I am not sure I like it--it might fall into the category of "pictures I really don''t need to see".', '2004-11-12 11:38:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007700, 118887, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. The lighting is effective though.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. The lighting is effective though.', '2004-11-12 11:38:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007701, 120009, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing.', '2004-11-12 11:39:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007702, 119984, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. There are also compression artifacts all over the photo which spoil it in my opinion.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. There are also compression artifacts all over the photo which spoil it in my opinion.', '2004-11-12 11:39:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007704, 118468, 2780, '<td valign="top">A bit more contrast would give this shot the extra ''pop'' that it needs. It has great potential with the right post-processing :)</td>', 'A bit more contrast would give this shot the extra ''pop'' that it needs. It has great potential with the right post-processing :)', '2004-11-12 11:40:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007705, 120166, 27161, '<td valign="top">This is my third I don''t know what it is, but I like it comment.  I guess they''re baby clams.</td>', 'This is my third I don''t know what it is, but I like it comment.  I guess they''re baby clams.', '2004-11-12 11:40:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007707, 118673, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit over-exposed and the blurred edges are somewhat distracting.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit over-exposed and the blurred edges are somewhat distracting.', '2004-11-12 11:41:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007708, 118803, 27161, '<td valign="top">Good subject, good color. - 8</td>', 'Good subject, good color. - 8', '2004-11-12 11:41:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007709, 118532, 2780, '<td valign="top">On a black surface this shot would be twice as good as it is now, and it''s pretty good now! Give it a go :)</td>', 'On a black surface this shot would be twice as good as it is now, and it''s pretty good now! Give it a go :)', '2004-11-12 11:41:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007710, 120148, 27161, '<td valign="top">I like this picture a lot.  Good subject and light.</td>', 'I like this picture a lot.  Good subject and light.', '2004-11-12 11:42:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007711, 120291, 2780, '<td valign="top">The crop is a bit too close on the left, it looks awkward. The lighting is good, but I''m not keen on the border. A white one would have worked better I think.</td>', 'The crop is a bit too close on the left, it looks awkward. The lighting is good, but I''m not keen on the border. A white one would have worked better I think.', '2004-11-12 11:42:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007712, 118295, 2780, '<td valign="top">I can see lots of compression artifacts, and your shot is only 19kb. Try saving it at 150kb to see the improvements in quality :)</td>', 'I can see lots of compression artifacts, and your shot is only 19kb. Try saving it at 150kb to see the improvements in quality :)', '2004-11-12 11:42:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007713, 119656, 27161, '<td valign="top">I wish more of them were in focus, but I like the concept.  Good color and light.</td>', 'I wish more of them were in focus, but I like the concept.  Good color and light.', '2004-11-12 11:43:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007715, 119449, 2780, '<td valign="top">Thats a wide pupil... must have been quite a long exposure to let enough light in? A good shot but could do with a bit more contrast, and a different colour other than "pukey green" would be much nicer too.</td>', 'Thats a wide pupil... must have been quite a long exposure to let enough light in? A good shot but could do with a bit more contrast, and a different colour other than "pukey green" would be much nicer too.', '2004-11-12 11:44:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007716, 120233, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing.', '2004-11-12 11:44:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007717, 119874, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. Contrast is a bit low too, try adding more in PP.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. Contrast is a bit low too, try adding more in PP.', '2004-11-12 11:44:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007720, 119857, 2780, '<td valign="top">The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. You could desaturate the magenta channel too, to get rid of the purple fringing.</td>', 'The focus seems a bit soft, try applying USM in post processing. You could desaturate the magenta channel too, to get rid of the purple fringing.', '2004-11-12 11:45:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007722, 120091, 27161, '<td valign="top">Good shot.  It doesn''t look like the car''s front wheel is moving so I''m guessing the car wasn''t driving around.</td>', 'Good shot.  It doesn''t look like the car''s front wheel is moving so I''m guessing the car wasn''t driving around.', '2004-11-12 11:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007723, 120037, 20115, '<td valign="top">beautiful vase.  eliminate the background--chairs are distracting and take away the focus from the vase.</td>', 'beautiful vase.  eliminate the background--chairs are distracting and take away the focus from the vase.', '2004-11-12 11:46:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007726, 118629, 27161, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and light.  Good eye lashes too.  Border complements it nicely.</td>', 'Very nice color and light.  Good eye lashes too.  Border complements it nicely.', '2004-11-12 11:47:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1007728, 118547, 27161, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I''m curious where you got these feathers from.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I''m curious where you got these feathers from.', '2004-11-12 11:48:37.000000', NULL, 1),
