(1007810, 118756, 19010, '<td valign="top">Great macro good shadow and sharpness. You cartured everything including the scratches in the paint. even managed to get the metal grains well defined and in focus.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work</td>', 'Great macro good shadow and sharpness. You cartured everything including the scratches in the paint. even managed to get the metal grains well defined and in focus.   While impressive from a photo graphic stand point. Its just not very interesting as a poster to hang on a wall.  Keep Up the great work', '2004-11-12 12:40:08.000000', NULL, 1);
