(1008386, 118217, 24454, '<td valign="top">Awwww. . . he sure is beautiful!!!!!!    I''m voting him very high because the picture really appeals to me.  I like his expression,  the cepia tone, and it most definitely is an extrememe close-up.   I have a feeling you may be getting a lot of "not a macro" comments (I got a lot of those in the last macro challenge, and my score was humiliating).  I hope they are not doing that to you.   I wonder if you would have cropped this to be more of a "head shot only" if it would have made the picture better.  He is so pretty, it almost detracts to have anything in the picture but HIM!   Anyway, I hope it does well.  I really like it a lot!</td>', 'Awwww. . . he sure is beautiful!!!!!!    I''m voting him very high because the picture really appeals to me.  I like his expression,  the cepia tone, and it most definitely is an extrememe close-up.   I have a feeling you may be getting a lot of "not a macro" comments (I got a lot of those in the last macro challenge, and my score was humiliating).  I hope they are not doing that to you.   I wonder if you would have cropped this to be more of a "head shot only" if it would have made the picture better.  He is so pretty, it almost detracts to have anything in the picture but HIM!   Anyway, I hope it does well.  I really like it a lot!', '2004-11-12 18:11:34.000000', NULL, 1),
