(1008532, 118613, 25468, '<td valign="top">I have a few comments.<br/>1. I really didn''t feel the light in the eye, I personally would have cloned it out and gave a lower score because of less personal appeal.<br/>2. I am a big fan of PS but think this goes a bit overboard, at least for my tastes. The reason for this is you still see the correct color of skin within the eye brows and around the eyes.<br/>3. I do like the cropping because it''s not just an eye, this gives you something to imagine with. It gives you some structure.<br/> <br/>I gave a 5 based on composition and meeting the challenge.</td>', 'I have a few comments.1. I really didn''t feel the light in the eye, I personally would have cloned it out and gave a lower score because of less personal appeal.2. I am a big fan of PS but think this goes a bit overboard, at least for my tastes. The reason for this is you still see the correct color of skin within the eye brows and around the eyes.3. I do like the cropping because it''s not just an eye, this gives you something to imagine with. It gives you some structure. I gave a 5 based on composition and meeting the challenge.', '2004-11-12 19:53:49.000000', NULL, 1),
