(1008683, 119257, 25921, '<td valign="top">This is similar to the picture in the time challenge i saw with the second hand action.  Adds interest, but...  I don''t know, something is missing.  For some reason, the composition does not seem balanced to me.  The red works well though.</td>', 'This is similar to the picture in the time challenge i saw with the second hand action.  Adds interest, but...  I don''t know, something is missing.  For some reason, the composition does not seem balanced to me.  The red works well though.', '2004-11-12 21:56:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008686, 118841, 25921, '<td valign="top">Good closeup, but the circuit board is uninspiring.  Shadows are too strong in the places you couldn''t make the light reach.  Fair effort though.</td>', 'Good closeup, but the circuit board is uninspiring.  Shadows are too strong in the places you couldn''t make the light reach.  Fair effort though.', '2004-11-12 21:57:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008687, 120135, 25921, '<td valign="top">Good idea.  This would have been so much nicer if the surface was black instead of light gray.  The gleam in the water drops would be so dramatic if that was all there was to balacne the red leaves.</td>', 'Good idea.  This would have been so much nicer if the surface was black instead of light gray.  The gleam in the water drops would be so dramatic if that was all there was to balacne the red leaves.', '2004-11-12 21:59:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008688, 119714, 7485, '<td valign="top">Good idea, but you need to be able to see the outline of the pin. I tried it both ways, with gamma 2.2 (like most Windows) you can''t see the outline at all, with gamma 1.8 it''s just visible.</td>', 'Good idea, but you need to be able to see the outline of the pin. I tried it both ways, with gamma 2.2 (like most Windows) you can''t see the outline at all, with gamma 1.8 it''s just visible.', '2004-11-12 21:59:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008689, 118756, 25921, '<td valign="top">I like this shot.  Did you give any thought to wiping off the fingerprints?  I can''t decide whether I think they are distracting or not.  Also, there is a visible smudge on the top half of the stapler.  Good composition.</td>', 'I like this shot.  Did you give any thought to wiping off the fingerprints?  I can''t decide whether I think they are distracting or not.  Also, there is a visible smudge on the top half of the stapler.  Good composition.', '2004-11-12 22:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008690, 118867, 25921, '<td valign="top">The beauty here is lost by the dull wirey background.  Also, there seems to be vains of dullness in the opal itself.  Not bad, but I wonder how it would look with a different background and a greater DOF.</td>', 'The beauty here is lost by the dull wirey background.  Also, there seems to be vains of dullness in the opal itself.  Not bad, but I wonder how it would look with a different background and a greater DOF.', '2004-11-12 22:01:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008691, 120173, 25921, '<td valign="top">Balance lacks in this photo for me.  I think I would like to see a different angle where the wood chips don''t look like they have been carefully placed.  I''m not sure what it is that bothers me about the balance, it just doesn''t seem like I''m seeing the most interesting angle, or a complete picture of the shavings.  Nice contrasting curls though.</td>', 'Balance lacks in this photo for me.  I think I would like to see a different angle where the wood chips don''t look like they have been carefully placed.  I''m not sure what it is that bothers me about the balance, it just doesn''t seem like I''m seeing the most interesting angle, or a complete picture of the shavings.  Nice contrasting curls though.', '2004-11-12 22:03:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008692, 120293, 25921, '<td valign="top">A slightly greater DOF bringing the front of the links into focus would have been nice.  But if I had to have such a shallow DOF, I would have put it right where ou did.  I like this shot.</td>', 'A slightly greater DOF bringing the front of the links into focus would have been nice.  But if I had to have such a shallow DOF, I would have put it right where ou did.  I like this shot.', '2004-11-12 22:04:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008693, 118768, 25921, '<td valign="top">I can''t tell what I''m looking at here.  And it seems to o dark.  I think I might like it better if I understood how this relates to "Dexterity"</td>', 'I can''t tell what I''m looking at here.  And it seems to o dark.  I think I might like it better if I understood how this relates to "Dexterity"', '2004-11-12 22:05:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008695, 118379, 25921, '<td valign="top">Not bad at all.  I think of Jack Daniels as a square shaped bottle, so the upper left corner feels like it should be the corner of a bottle instead of more glass.  Also the different colored highlight that appears there is distracting.  However, this is a good photo to me still.</td>', 'Not bad at all.  I think of Jack Daniels as a square shaped bottle, so the upper left corner feels like it should be the corner of a bottle instead of more glass.  Also the different colored highlight that appears there is distracting.  However, this is a good photo to me still.', '2004-11-12 22:07:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008698, 118261, 25921, '<td valign="top">Focus is soft, and color saturation seems weak.  Or perhaps it is overexposed.  Good imagery though.  I probably would have made an effort to hide the chain/link/clasp in the upper right too.</td>', 'Focus is soft, and color saturation seems weak.  Or perhaps it is overexposed.  Good imagery though.  I probably would have made an effort to hide the chain/link/clasp in the upper right too.', '2004-11-12 22:09:12.000000', NULL, 1),
