(1008962, 119774, 18194, '<td valign="top">I think the focus could have be sharper on the ring</td>', 'I think the focus could have be sharper on the ring', '2004-11-13 01:44:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008963, 119953, 25921, '<td valign="top">This looks more like a leathery paper than a balcony.  What am I not seeing?  Great abstract composition.  I really like this one.</td>', 'This looks more like a leathery paper than a balcony.  What am I not seeing?  Great abstract composition.  I really like this one.', '2004-11-13 01:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008964, 118755, 25921, '<td valign="top">Good idea.</td>', 'Good idea.', '2004-11-13 01:45:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008965, 119028, 25921, '<td valign="top">Ha!  I like this one.  GReat composition and lighting.</td>', 'Ha!  I like this one.  GReat composition and lighting.', '2004-11-13 01:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008966, 118696, 25921, '<td valign="top">I can only imagine how long it took to get this shot.  I like it.</td>', 'I can only imagine how long it took to get this shot.  I like it.', '2004-11-13 01:46:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008967, 118392, 25921, '<td valign="top">I like what you are going for here, but the candle takes away a little too much attention from the bells? for my taste.</td>', 'I like what you are going for here, but the candle takes away a little too much attention from the bells? for my taste.', '2004-11-13 01:47:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008969, 119381, 25921, '<td valign="top">Ummm.  Kiss me?</td>', 'Ummm.  Kiss me?', '2004-11-13 01:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008970, 118520, 25921, '<td valign="top">Not clear enough.  The reflections are distracting and the DOF is too shallow.  I do like how the band is in focus in the lower right corner though.</td>', 'Not clear enough.  The reflections are distracting and the DOF is too shallow.  I do like how the band is in focus in the lower right corner though.', '2004-11-13 01:49:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008972, 120192, 25921, '<td valign="top">Now that is a closeup of an eye!  Very nice.... and strange.  Makes me want to go get a lens that can do the same thing to see what mine looks like.  I looks like space nebula.  Eerie.</td>', 'Now that is a closeup of an eye!  Very nice.... and strange.  Makes me want to go get a lens that can do the same thing to see what mine looks like.  I looks like space nebula.  Eerie.', '2004-11-13 01:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008973, 119951, 25921, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed.  Lighting is a tad harsh, but barely.  Very good shot.</td>', 'Nicely composed.  Lighting is a tad harsh, but barely.  Very good shot.', '2004-11-13 01:50:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008974, 120101, 25921, '<td valign="top">Too bad the DOF isn''t as centered as the dart.  I would like to have seen the closer arc of the outer bullseye in focus too.  The place where the dart hits the board is the near edge of the DOF.  The lighting is a bit harsh, but this shot is nice despite these "problems" (meaning, this is just my opinion)</td>', 'Too bad the DOF isn''t as centered as the dart.  I would like to have seen the closer arc of the outer bullseye in focus too.  The place where the dart hits the board is the near edge of the DOF.  The lighting is a bit harsh, but this shot is nice despite these "problems" (meaning, this is just my opinion)', '2004-11-13 01:53:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008975, 118934, 25921, '<td valign="top">These types of shots are starting to pile up, but I like your composition here.</td>', 'These types of shots are starting to pile up, but I like your composition here.', '2004-11-13 01:53:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008976, 120077, 25921, '<td valign="top">Too fleshy to be attractive.  The light must have been quite bright.  Oh, and get some sleep man!!</td>', 'Too fleshy to be attractive.  The light must have been quite bright.  Oh, and get some sleep man!!', '2004-11-13 01:55:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008977, 120015, 25921, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  I like the lines of interest pulling your eyes down the hole.</td>', 'Great shot.  I like the lines of interest pulling your eyes down the hole.', '2004-11-13 01:56:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008978, 120249, 25921, '<td valign="top">Fleshy fleshy fleshy.</td>', 'Fleshy fleshy fleshy.', '2004-11-13 01:56:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008981, 119940, 25095, '<td valign="top">absolutly beautiful, i wish I could have come up with this type of idea.  Wonderful colors and positioning not to mention lighting.  Best I''ve seen so far.</td>', 'absolutly beautiful, i wish I could have come up with this type of idea.  Wonderful colors and positioning not to mention lighting.  Best I''ve seen so far.', '2004-11-13 02:26:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008982, 119817, 25095, '<td valign="top">very dramatic.  Talk about saying 1000 words.  Great shot.</td>', 'very dramatic.  Talk about saying 1000 words.  Great shot.', '2004-11-13 02:27:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008986, 118680, 25095, '<td valign="top">Love the uniqueness of this.  Great job.  I tried a macro of a screw but couldn''t get the DOF right.  Maybe next time I''ll try this technique.</td>', 'Love the uniqueness of this.  Great job.  I tried a macro of a screw but couldn''t get the DOF right.  Maybe next time I''ll try this technique.', '2004-11-13 02:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008991, 119456, 29111, '<td valign="top">Soft focus gives this a nice wistful look and is in keeping with the subject.</td>', 'Soft focus gives this a nice wistful look and is in keeping with the subject.', '2004-11-13 02:59:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008992, 120144, 29111, '<td valign="top">Interesting detail but a bit underexposed or dimly lit.</td>', 'Interesting detail but a bit underexposed or dimly lit.', '2004-11-13 03:03:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008993, 118454, 29111, '<td valign="top">Clever composition - Peruvian pottery? Could be a bit sharper though.</td>', 'Clever composition - Peruvian pottery? Could be a bit sharper though.', '2004-11-13 03:11:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008994, 119255, 29111, '<td valign="top">Nicely detailed, even the motes in the water are showing up!</td>', 'Nicely detailed, even the motes in the water are showing up!', '2004-11-13 03:15:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1008997, 119844, 29111, '<td valign="top">Clever concept. A little more contrast and shadow detail would be good .</td>', 'Clever concept. A little more contrast and shadow detail would be good .', '2004-11-13 03:17:48.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1009016, 120060, 23251, '<td valign="top">Very smart, I also ike the way the candle appears to move toward you when you scroll down, try it!</td>', 'Very smart, I also ike the way the candle appears to move toward you when you scroll down, try it!', '2004-11-13 03:45:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009026, 119862, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the blue hues that dominate the shot. Good DOF too.</td>', 'I like the blue hues that dominate the shot. Good DOF too.', '2004-11-13 05:12:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009027, 120153, 27767, '<td valign="top">Ooo, I like this a lot.  Great blues and lighting. Great interpretation of the sparkles of light.</td>', 'Ooo, I like this a lot.  Great blues and lighting. Great interpretation of the sparkles of light.', '2004-11-13 05:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009030, 119747, 27767, '<td valign="top">I find the processor as a keychain to be the main point of interest for me, and can''t help wonder, "what kind of processor is (was?) that?</td>', 'I find the processor as a keychain to be the main point of interest for me, and can''t help wonder, "what kind of processor is (was?) that?', '2004-11-13 05:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009031, 120229, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very creative, but doesn''t capture my imagination much.</td>', 'Very creative, but doesn''t capture my imagination much.', '2004-11-13 05:17:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009032, 120144, 23478, '<td valign="top">NIce photo, just too dark to see the detail.</td>', 'NIce photo, just too dark to see the detail.', '2004-11-13 05:20:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009034, 118567, 27767, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, though I think I would like the shot more if the sharp depth of field ran from the front of the pile to just behind the top brown M&amp;M, though I know on these small scales that can be hard.</td>', 'Creative idea, though I think I would like the shot more if the sharp depth of field ran from the front of the pile to just behind the top brown M&M, though I know on these small scales that can be hard.', '2004-11-13 05:21:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009036, 120132, 23478, '<td valign="top">NIce photo, just needs a solid color background to set it off.</td>', 'NIce photo, just needs a solid color background to set it off.', '2004-11-13 05:22:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009037, 118257, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this idea very much. I would like to see this same shot with back lighting too so that there are no distracting shadows in the back.</td>', 'I like this idea very much. I would like to see this same shot with back lighting too so that there are no distracting shadows in the back.', '2004-11-13 05:23:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009040, 120015, 27767, '<td valign="top">I wonder if a different white balance would bring out more of the greens and yellows.</td>', 'I wonder if a different white balance would bring out more of the greens and yellows.', '2004-11-13 05:25:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009041, 119724, 27767, '<td valign="top">Feels so abstract I can''t make out much more than the lip of the glass (I think). Being a little more sharply focused wouldn''t hurt.</td>', 'Feels so abstract I can''t make out much more than the lip of the glass (I think). Being a little more sharply focused wouldn''t hurt.', '2004-11-13 05:27:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009042, 120055, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great detail :) I like the lighting to make the tiny hairs glow too.</td>', 'Great detail :) I like the lighting to make the tiny hairs glow too.', '2004-11-13 05:28:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009043, 118554, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good detail, though I think underexposing a little more would help the shot.</td>', 'Good detail, though I think underexposing a little more would help the shot.', '2004-11-13 05:29:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009044, 120287, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great lighting and depth of field. Good composition to lead the eye down the spine of the feather.</td>', 'Great lighting and depth of field. Good composition to lead the eye down the spine of the feather.', '2004-11-13 05:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009045, 120207, 27767, '<td valign="top">I wonder if it would help to adjust the white balance to brighten up the whites in this shot.</td>', 'I wonder if it would help to adjust the white balance to brighten up the whites in this shot.', '2004-11-13 05:31:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009046, 118840, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good macro, though looks a little grainy and a little out of focus.</td>', 'Good macro, though looks a little grainy and a little out of focus.', '2004-11-13 05:32:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009048, 119371, 27767, '<td valign="top">I love this shot.  I love the dramatic contrast of light and dark. Very cool, and awesome timing on the forming drop.</td>', 'I love this shot.  I love the dramatic contrast of light and dark. Very cool, and awesome timing on the forming drop.', '2004-11-13 05:34:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009050, 119789, 27767, '<td valign="top">I am having a hard time finding a focal point for the shot.  Maybe tilting the subject for a more 3d angle would catch some interesting refraction of light or colors.</td>', 'I am having a hard time finding a focal point for the shot.  Maybe tilting the subject for a more 3d angle would catch some interesting refraction of light or colors.', '2004-11-13 05:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009051, 119896, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting lighting and good focus. Can''t quite identify the object on the left.</td>', 'Interesting lighting and good focus. Can''t quite identify the object on the left.', '2004-11-13 05:37:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009052, 120062, 27767, '<td valign="top">So cute and fuzzy.  Good focus and nice border.</td>', 'So cute and fuzzy.  Good focus and nice border.', '2004-11-13 05:38:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009053, 120064, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors of the shot, though the subject doesn''t interest me that much.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors of the shot, though the subject doesn''t interest me that much.', '2004-11-13 05:39:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009054, 118261, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good composition and detail of fabric.</td>', 'Good composition and detail of fabric.', '2004-11-13 05:39:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009055, 119975, 27767, '<td valign="top">Shot is not that close to subject, which could bring out some very interesting details.  More diffuse lighting might help with the harsh shadows.</td>', 'Shot is not that close to subject, which could bring out some very interesting details.  More diffuse lighting might help with the harsh shadows.', '2004-11-13 05:41:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009056, 120115, 27767, '<td valign="top">I really like the dark black contrast to the great lighting and refractions of the glass(?) base.</td>', 'I really like the dark black contrast to the great lighting and refractions of the glass(?) base.', '2004-11-13 05:42:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009057, 120191, 27767, '<td valign="top">Creative idea, though the extremely centered subject doesn''t give the shot it''s full potential.</td>', 'Creative idea, though the extremely centered subject doesn''t give the shot it''s full potential.', '2004-11-13 05:43:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009058, 120161, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  Great depth of field and lighting.  I like the narrow shades of colors and the detail of the closest bullets.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  Great depth of field and lighting.  I like the narrow shades of colors and the detail of the closest bullets.', '2004-11-13 05:44:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009059, 120285, 27767, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject. Maybe different lighting to bring out more of the texture and moving the camera so the shot isn''t so straight on would help.</td>', 'Interesting subject. Maybe different lighting to bring out more of the texture and moving the camera so the shot isn''t so straight on would help.', '2004-11-13 05:45:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009060, 119734, 27767, '<td valign="top">Détail très bon</td>', 'Détail très bon', '2004-11-13 05:48:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009062, 119746, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very cool lighting and setup.  Maybe extending the depth of field a little could show more of the details and reflections.</td>', 'Very cool lighting and setup.  Maybe extending the depth of field a little could show more of the details and reflections.', '2004-11-13 05:49:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009063, 118468, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting. Maybe more diffuse lighting could bring out the color in the whole amethyst.</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting. Maybe more diffuse lighting could bring out the color in the whole amethyst.', '2004-11-13 05:51:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009064, 120180, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and depth of field to give an abstract feel.</td>', 'I like the lighting and depth of field to give an abstract feel.', '2004-11-13 05:52:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009065, 119165, 27767, '<td valign="top">I would like this shot a little more if the subject wasn''t so centered.  This back lighting loses some of the details on the front of the subject.</td>', 'I would like this shot a little more if the subject wasn''t so centered.  This back lighting loses some of the details on the front of the subject.', '2004-11-13 05:54:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009066, 118583, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good macro, though subject doesn''t capture my attention as much.</td>', 'Good macro, though subject doesn''t capture my attention as much.', '2004-11-13 05:55:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009067, 120190, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the shiny surfaces in this shot.  Interesting colors in the water''s surface and reflection.</td>', 'I like the shiny surfaces in this shot.  Interesting colors in the water''s surface and reflection.', '2004-11-13 05:56:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009069, 118739, 27767, '<td valign="top">Picture is really small, but I would love this shot at about 640x480. I might be hard to arrange, but the hand reflection in the eye is a little distracting from the details of the eye itself.</td>', 'Picture is really small, but I would love this shot at about 640x480. I might be hard to arrange, but the hand reflection in the eye is a little distracting from the details of the eye itself.', '2004-11-13 05:57:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009070, 118333, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great detail.  I like the black and gold color contrast.</td>', 'Great detail.  I like the black and gold color contrast.', '2004-11-13 05:58:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009071, 120037, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very pretty vase. I would like this shot a lot more without the distracting chairs in the background. The angle of the edge of the table creates a nice balance with the vase opening to the right.</td>', 'Very pretty vase. I would like this shot a lot more without the distracting chairs in the background. The angle of the edge of the table creates a nice balance with the vase opening to the right.', '2004-11-13 05:59:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009072, 119301, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good balance of subjects in shot, though it doesn''t hold my interest as much.</td>', 'Good balance of subjects in shot, though it doesn''t hold my interest as much.', '2004-11-13 06:01:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009073, 118984, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this shot a lot.  Good delicate balance of dark and light.</td>', 'I like this shot a lot.  Good delicate balance of dark and light.', '2004-11-13 06:02:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009074, 118888, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the lighting and shadows a lot.  Good detail too.</td>', 'I like the lighting and shadows a lot.  Good detail too.', '2004-11-13 06:03:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009075, 119888, 24659, '<td valign="top">a little overdone, but still a very nice photo!</td>', 'a little overdone, but still a very nice photo!', '2004-11-13 06:05:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009076, 118757, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like this the best of all the eye shots. Beautiful blue and great title for the shot. Excelent depth of field and details :)</td>', 'I like this the best of all the eye shots. Beautiful blue and great title for the shot. Excelent depth of field and details :)', '2004-11-13 06:05:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009078, 118629, 27767, '<td valign="top">I absolutely love this shot.  I wonder if you''ll get docked points because of the extremely shallow depth of field, but I think that is what makes this shot awesome.  Great placement of the drop out of the center.  I love the soft blues and black, and the blurred lashes in the back of the depth of field.</td>', 'I absolutely love this shot.  I wonder if you''ll get docked points because of the extremely shallow depth of field, but I think that is what makes this shot awesome.  Great placement of the drop out of the center.  I love the soft blues and black, and the blurred lashes in the back of the depth of field.', '2004-11-13 06:08:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009079, 120179, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good detail and color. I would like this shot a little more if the lighting was more diffuse to reduce some of the shadows.</td>', 'Good detail and color. I would like this shot a little more if the lighting was more diffuse to reduce some of the shadows.', '2004-11-13 06:13:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009080, 118950, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the detail and depth of field of this shot.  Good composition too.</td>', 'I like the detail and depth of field of this shot.  Good composition too.', '2004-11-13 06:14:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009081, 119965, 24659, '<td valign="top">simple, but very effective!</td>', 'simple, but very effective!', '2004-11-13 06:14:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009082, 118641, 27767, '<td valign="top">I wonder if showing more of the metal subject would bring more of a context to the name. Good detail otherwise.</td>', 'I wonder if showing more of the metal subject would bring more of a context to the name. Good detail otherwise.', '2004-11-13 06:16:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009083, 120219, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very nice colors and detail.  I would like this shot if the light was a little more diffuse though to saturate the amazing colors of the corn kernels.</td>', 'Very nice colors and detail.  I would like this shot if the light was a little more diffuse though to saturate the amazing colors of the corn kernels.', '2004-11-13 06:19:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009084, 118440, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the bright white and strong green colors. Nice abstract feel to the shot.</td>', 'I like the bright white and strong green colors. Nice abstract feel to the shot.', '2004-11-13 06:20:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009085, 120077, 27767, '<td valign="top">The iris seems out of focus, while the blood vessels on the left are in sharp focus. I would like it more if these focus areas were switched.</td>', 'The iris seems out of focus, while the blood vessels on the left are in sharp focus. I would like it more if these focus areas were switched.', '2004-11-13 06:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009086, 120009, 27767, '<td valign="top">Sweet lighting and saturation of colors. I love the glow off the yellow and perl colored kernels.  I like the shadows in this to show overall texture.</td>', 'Sweet lighting and saturation of colors. I love the glow off the yellow and perl colored kernels.  I like the shadows in this to show overall texture.', '2004-11-13 06:23:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009087, 119883, 27767, '<td valign="top">I don''t think I''d want to be close enough to get a Macro shot of this guy :)  Is it smiling and posing for the camera?</td>', 'I don''t think I''d want to be close enough to get a Macro shot of this guy :)  Is it smiling and posing for the camera?', '2004-11-13 06:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009088, 118803, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great details and lovely composition.  I really like the placement of the "belly button" way off center. Good soft lighting too.</td>', 'Great details and lovely composition.  I really like the placement of the "belly button" way off center. Good soft lighting too.', '2004-11-13 06:25:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009089, 118366, 27767, '<td valign="top">I like the details and soft shadows of this shot.  Good depth of field too.</td>', 'I like the details and soft shadows of this shot.  Good depth of field too.', '2004-11-13 06:26:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009090, 119009, 27767, '<td valign="top">Wow, talk about up close and personal.   I love how you can make out all the objects in the reflection off the eye.</td>', 'Wow, talk about up close and personal.   I love how you can make out all the objects in the reflection off the eye.', '2004-11-13 06:27:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009091, 119488, 27767, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail and lighting.  Quite impressive.  Good composition too.</td>', 'Very nice detail and lighting.  Quite impressive.  Good composition too.', '2004-11-13 06:28:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009092, 118638, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice shadows and lighting and good detail.  Brings a nice feel to the subject</td>', 'Nice shadows and lighting and good detail.  Brings a nice feel to the subject', '2004-11-13 06:29:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009093, 119010, 27767, '<td valign="top">Good lighting and placement of focal point using rule of thirds.</td>', 'Good lighting and placement of focal point using rule of thirds.', '2004-11-13 06:31:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009094, 119006, 27767, '<td valign="top">I see the water right at the lip of the spout, though I think that pouring water and using a fast shutter speed could look really cool too.</td>', 'I see the water right at the lip of the spout, though I think that pouring water and using a fast shutter speed could look really cool too.', '2004-11-13 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009095, 118966, 27767, '<td valign="top">Nice play on words in the title :) Good detail too.</td>', 'Nice play on words in the title :) Good detail too.', '2004-11-13 06:32:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009096, 120060, 27767, '<td valign="top">This is a really cool shot.  Excelent detail on the top surface of the candle, and sweet back lighting. Nice suggestion of a flame with the lighting.</td>', 'This is a really cool shot.  Excelent detail on the top surface of the candle, and sweet back lighting. Nice suggestion of a flame with the lighting.', '2004-11-13 06:34:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009097, 120280, 27767, '<td valign="top">Lovely lighting and colors.  Impressive details. I like the placement of the intersection of the main veins at the top center.</td>', 'Lovely lighting and colors.  Impressive details. I like the placement of the intersection of the main veins at the top center.', '2004-11-13 06:35:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009098, 119740, 27767, '<td valign="top">I love the suggested interpretation of the photo by the title.  It doesn''t take much imagination to see a real city on this circuit board. Very cool.</td>', 'I love the suggested interpretation of the photo by the title.  It doesn''t take much imagination to see a real city on this circuit board. Very cool.', '2004-11-13 06:36:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009099, 119326, 27767, '<td valign="top">Cool colors and abstract feel.  I like the border too.</td>', 'Cool colors and abstract feel.  I like the border too.', '2004-11-13 06:37:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009100, 118462, 27767, '<td valign="top">Great frost crystals on the leaf edges.  Maybe placing the dark center of the plant out of the center of the shot would help a little.</td>', 'Great frost crystals on the leaf edges.  Maybe placing the dark center of the plant out of the center of the shot would help a little.', '2004-11-13 06:38:51.000000', NULL, 1),
