(1009214, 118333, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice detail in this. I think the crop is a bit cliché though, and  you could have tried something a bit different like new angles and DoF and stuff.</td>', 'Very nice detail in this. I think the crop is a bit cliché though, and  you could have tried something a bit different like new angles and DoF and stuff.', '2004-11-13 08:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
