(1009216, 118755, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would work well in the impressionism challenge I think, it''s a very nice capture with good pastel colours. The only thing I don''t like is the black bar in the top right. Can you recompose to avoid that?</td>', 'This would work well in the impressionism challenge I think, it''s a very nice capture with good pastel colours. The only thing I don''t like is the black bar in the top right. Can you recompose to avoid that?', '2004-11-13 08:20:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009217, 118767, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the colours from the rust, good shot.</td>', 'I like the colours from the rust, good shot.', '2004-11-13 08:21:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009218, 118409, 2780, '<td valign="top">More contrast would improve this shot in my opinion. It looks a little flat at the moment. Try rotating it for a more dramatic angle too :)</td>', 'More contrast would improve this shot in my opinion. It looks a little flat at the moment. Try rotating it for a more dramatic angle too :)', '2004-11-13 08:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009219, 118573, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really good idea and a great overall result. The high key lighting works very well and so does the centered composition in this case.</td>', 'Really good idea and a great overall result. The high key lighting works very well and so does the centered composition in this case.', '2004-11-13 08:22:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009220, 120066, 2780, '<td valign="top">The B&amp;W and contrast are spot on. I would have used a slightly wider DoF to the that sticking up bit above the 75 in focus though.</td>', 'The B&W and contrast are spot on. I would have used a slightly wider DoF to the that sticking up bit above the 75 in focus though.', '2004-11-13 08:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009221, 120151, 2780, '<td valign="top">A different angle rather than flat on would make this photo more interesting.</td>', 'A different angle rather than flat on would make this photo more interesting.', '2004-11-13 08:23:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009223, 119809, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, but I feel the lighting is a bit harsh. Try diffusing the light to avoid such bright spots on the pills.</td>', 'Nice shot, but I feel the lighting is a bit harsh. Try diffusing the light to avoid such bright spots on the pills.', '2004-11-13 08:24:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009225, 118776, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the crop is a bit thin. Seeing the pens go back further with white space at the top to match the bottom would look good I think.</td>', 'I think the crop is a bit thin. Seeing the pens go back further with white space at the top to match the bottom would look good I think.', '2004-11-13 08:25:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009228, 119647, 2780, '<td valign="top">This isn''t a macro or a closeup... unless the plain is about 1cm long.</td>', 'This isn''t a macro or a closeup... unless the plain is about 1cm long.', '2004-11-13 08:25:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009231, 119976, 2780, '<td valign="top">Boosting contrast and making this black and white would disguise the obvious flaws here: (1) The coloured noise would be more like acceptable B&amp;W grain. (2) The flat lighting would be strong contrast B&amp;W lighting. Give it a try :)</td>', 'Boosting contrast and making this black and white would disguise the obvious flaws here: (1) The coloured noise would be more like acceptable B&W grain. (2) The flat lighting would be strong contrast B&W lighting. Give it a try :)', '2004-11-13 08:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009232, 118839, 2780, '<td valign="top">The repetition in this shot is good. I would have used an even shallow DoF so that the background was less distracting.</td>', 'The repetition in this shot is good. I would have used an even shallow DoF so that the background was less distracting.', '2004-11-13 08:27:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009233, 118866, 2780, '<td valign="top">I''m not really a fan of photos of figurines, but the lighting from behind the train in this shot is effective.</td>', 'I''m not really a fan of photos of figurines, but the lighting from behind the train in this shot is effective.', '2004-11-13 08:28:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009235, 120191, 2780, '<td valign="top">Did you zoom in during exposure? It looks pretty effective :)</td>', 'Did you zoom in during exposure? It looks pretty effective :)', '2004-11-13 08:29:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009236, 120024, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would look much better in high-contrast B&amp;W but what it really needs in my opinion is a focal point.</td>', 'This would look much better in high-contrast B&W but what it really needs in my opinion is a focal point.', '2004-11-13 08:30:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009238, 118304, 2780, '<td valign="top">USM would stop this looking so soft, but altho the title points to the whiskers, in my opinion there is no focal point. If we could see an eye or something it would be better.</td>', 'USM would stop this looking so soft, but altho the title points to the whiskers, in my opinion there is no focal point. If we could see an eye or something it would be better.', '2004-11-13 08:30:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009239, 118547, 2780, '<td valign="top">The drops don''t really show up very well for some reason, try using different lighting. The primary colours are effective though :)</td>', 'The drops don''t really show up very well for some reason, try using different lighting. The primary colours are effective though :)', '2004-11-13 08:31:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009243, 118257, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is a good shot but the red background looks a bit washed out. How does this look in B&amp;W?</td>', 'This is a good shot but the red background looks a bit washed out. How does this look in B&W?', '2004-11-13 08:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009244, 120118, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice idea and good shot. The exposure and DoF are just right :)</td>', 'Very nice idea and good shot. The exposure and DoF are just right :)', '2004-11-13 08:36:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009245, 119777, 2780, '<td valign="top">There is lots of emotion attached to this shot, and it is a good photojournalistic photo. I think I would prefer it in B&amp;W.</td>', 'There is lots of emotion attached to this shot, and it is a good photojournalistic photo. I think I would prefer it in B&W.', '2004-11-13 08:38:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009248, 119862, 2780, '<td valign="top">The blue toning here works really well, but I think the photo is a bit over exposed and over sharpened.</td>', 'The blue toning here works really well, but I think the photo is a bit over exposed and over sharpened.', '2004-11-13 08:39:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009249, 118966, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a bit flat and the photo is also out of focus. Try boosting the contrast a little and then using USM.</td>', 'The lighting is a bit flat and the photo is also out of focus. Try boosting the contrast a little and then using USM.', '2004-11-13 08:41:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009252, 119968, 2780, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot, the focus and colouring and contrast are all excellent.</td>', 'Very nice shot, the focus and colouring and contrast are all excellent.', '2004-11-13 08:41:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009253, 120283, 2780, '<td valign="top">Nice high key photo, the composition is good and so is the DoF.</td>', 'Nice high key photo, the composition is good and so is the DoF.', '2004-11-13 08:42:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009256, 118331, 2780, '<td valign="top">The yellow cast to the photo suggests you were using the wrong white balance.</td>', 'The yellow cast to the photo suggests you were using the wrong white balance.', '2004-11-13 08:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009258, 120245, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would look so much better on a white background. At the moment it doesn''t really stand out enough from the dull greens.</td>', 'This would look so much better on a white background. At the moment it doesn''t really stand out enough from the dull greens.', '2004-11-13 08:43:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009260, 118643, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think you should stick with 1 title. I really dont like these types of titles and they ruin the photo for me before the picture has even loaded! Still, the photo is okay, but the statue is out of focus.</td>', 'I think you should stick with 1 title. I really dont like these types of titles and they ruin the photo for me before the picture has even loaded! Still, the photo is okay, but the statue is out of focus.', '2004-11-13 08:45:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009261, 120252, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t really like photos of figurines as they dont show much imagination in my opinion.</td>', 'I don''t really like photos of figurines as they dont show much imagination in my opinion.', '2004-11-13 08:45:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009262, 119792, 2780, '<td valign="top">The abstract shapes are good but the lighting is too flat and the contrast is almost non existant. The subject has a lot of potential but it''s up to you to release it all.</td>', 'The abstract shapes are good but the lighting is too flat and the contrast is almost non existant. The subject has a lot of potential but it''s up to you to release it all.', '2004-11-13 08:46:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009263, 118875, 2780, '<td valign="top">I really dont like your choice of border colour. A subtle black or white would have worked much better in my opinion.</td>', 'I really dont like your choice of border colour. A subtle black or white would have worked much better in my opinion.', '2004-11-13 08:51:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009265, 120181, 2780, '<td valign="top">If the green carries on through the whole photo this would be even better, the colours in the splash are great. Nice and tropical :)</td>', 'If the green carries on through the whole photo this would be even better, the colours in the splash are great. Nice and tropical :)', '2004-11-13 08:52:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009266, 119813, 2780, '<td valign="top">The 2 colours go well together but I think there is too much red space. I would have cropped a bit closer.</td>', 'The 2 colours go well together but I think there is too much red space. I would have cropped a bit closer.', '2004-11-13 08:52:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009267, 118943, 2780, '<td valign="top">really nice lighting, very dramatic.</td>', 'really nice lighting, very dramatic.', '2004-11-13 08:53:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009268, 119069, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF is slightly too shallow in my opinion.</td>', 'The DoF is slightly too shallow in my opinion.', '2004-11-13 08:53:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009269, 120292, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent DoF and composition. I''m unsure how the title related to the photo but that doesn''t matter. Good shot.</td>', 'Excellent DoF and composition. I''m unsure how the title related to the photo but that doesn''t matter. Good shot.', '2004-11-13 08:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009270, 119747, 2780, '<td valign="top">The harsh shadow is distracting, looks like you just used the flash. Try lighting from different angles if possible.</td>', 'The harsh shadow is distracting, looks like you just used the flash. Try lighting from different angles if possible.', '2004-11-13 08:54:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009271, 120173, 2780, '<td valign="top">This would look a lot better with a close crop so we cant see the wood in the background, and also in B&amp;W.</td>', 'This would look a lot better with a close crop so we cant see the wood in the background, and also in B&W.', '2004-11-13 08:54:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009272, 118576, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think rotating this was not a good idea. If it were just the match it would look good because it would look windy, but with the candle on its side it just looks a bit wrong.</td>', 'I think rotating this was not a good idea. If it were just the match it would look good because it would look windy, but with the candle on its side it just looks a bit wrong.', '2004-11-13 08:55:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009273, 118363, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the shot but think there is too much empty space at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the shot but think there is too much empty space at the bottom.', '2004-11-13 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009274, 118692, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot, I want to read the discription so I can see what the man is doing.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot, I want to read the discription so I can see what the man is doing.', '2004-11-13 08:57:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009276, 120261, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. The colours and DoF make it very abstract which looks great. 9</td>', 'Really nice shot. The colours and DoF make it very abstract which looks great. 9', '2004-11-13 08:57:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009277, 119201, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the DoF and repetition is good, but ther photo is overall too dark. Try boosting the contrast a little.</td>', 'I think the DoF and repetition is good, but ther photo is overall too dark. Try boosting the contrast a little.', '2004-11-13 08:58:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009278, 120262, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the white border distracts and black would have looked better. The lighting in the shot is good and makes it quite dramatic.</td>', 'I think the white border distracts and black would have looked better. The lighting in the shot is good and makes it quite dramatic.', '2004-11-13 08:58:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009280, 118366, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent DoF. The composition looks a bit ''horizontal'' and I would have preferred the pen coming on at an angle. Still, very nice shot with good B&amp;W. 8</td>', 'Excellent DoF. The composition looks a bit ''horizontal'' and I would have preferred the pen coming on at an angle. Still, very nice shot with good B&W. 8', '2004-11-13 08:59:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009281, 119795, 2780, '<td valign="top">The photo seems a bit soft. Try applying USM after you resize.</td>', 'The photo seems a bit soft. Try applying USM after you resize.', '2004-11-13 08:59:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009282, 119165, 2780, '<td valign="top">Odd indeed... not sure what it is but it makes quite a good photo. Less centered composition would be better I think.</td>', 'Odd indeed... not sure what it is but it makes quite a good photo. Less centered composition would be better I think.', '2004-11-13 09:00:14.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(1009283, 120242, 2780, '<td valign="top">The warm colours look really nice, and the lighting makes a good gradient on the red. I think the crop at the bottom is a bit tight though.</td>', 'The warm colours look really nice, and the lighting makes a good gradient on the red. I think the crop at the bottom is a bit tight though.', '2004-11-13 09:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009284, 119884, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think with more dramatic lighting this would be much better. At the moment it seems a bit flat.</td>', 'I think with more dramatic lighting this would be much better. At the moment it seems a bit flat.', '2004-11-13 09:04:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009285, 119732, 2780, '<td valign="top">I don''t really get this photo... but the exposure is very good, as the black has detail all over and lots of subtle shades. Nice work,</td>', 'I don''t really get this photo... but the exposure is very good, as the black has detail all over and lots of subtle shades. Nice work,', '2004-11-13 09:05:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009286, 118476, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF is very effective here, but the grain is a bit distracting. Have you tried using neatimage? (//www.neatimage.com)</td>', 'The DoF is very effective here, but the grain is a bit distracting. Have you tried using neatimage? (//www.neatimage.com)', '2004-11-13 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009287, 118984, 28763, '<td valign="top">out of focus</td>', 'out of focus', '2004-11-13 09:06:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009288, 119856, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like how the glass diffracts the psychodelic background, but I can see your desktop icons in the top part, hehe. Good work all the same :)</td>', 'I like how the glass diffracts the psychodelic background, but I can see your desktop icons in the top part, hehe. Good work all the same :)', '2004-11-13 09:07:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009290, 119072, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is way too small. Try using the full 640 pixel limit next time so we can see more detail in the photo and vote it higher.</td>', 'This is way too small. Try using the full 640 pixel limit next time so we can see more detail in the photo and vote it higher.', '2004-11-13 09:09:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009291, 120045, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice contrast and sharpness. In this case a centered composition may have worked better. Good shot.</td>', 'Really nice contrast and sharpness. In this case a centered composition may have worked better. Good shot.', '2004-11-13 09:10:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009292, 118697, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit flat, try boosting contrast in PP. Also try to use the full 640px limit so we can see more detail.</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit flat, try boosting contrast in PP. Also try to use the full 640px limit so we can see more detail.', '2004-11-13 09:10:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009293, 118246, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good DoF and composition. I like it.</td>', 'Good DoF and composition. I like it.', '2004-11-13 09:11:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009294, 118775, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good shot, Its interesting. I would have put a thin lines inside the border to separate it from the white in the photo.</td>', 'Good shot, Its interesting. I would have put a thin lines inside the border to separate it from the white in the photo.', '2004-11-13 09:11:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009295, 119814, 2780, '<td valign="top">This is out of focus, and all the white dots in the eye are a bit distracting. Try not being so close when you take the shot, allowing teh camera to focus, then crop in closer later.</td>', 'This is out of focus, and all the white dots in the eye are a bit distracting. Try not being so close when you take the shot, allowing teh camera to focus, then crop in closer later.', '2004-11-13 09:12:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009297, 119382, 2780, '<td valign="top">More dramatic lighting could make this shot a lot more interesting. It''s a bit flat at the moment.</td>', 'More dramatic lighting could make this shot a lot more interesting. It''s a bit flat at the moment.', '2004-11-13 09:13:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009300, 119010, 2780, '<td valign="top">The DoF and lighting here are really great. Excellent shot.</td>', 'The DoF and lighting here are really great. Excellent shot.', '2004-11-13 09:16:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009302, 119748, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the white balance was a bit off in this photo as everything has a blue cast. To fix this you could just make it black and white :) The photo shows a lot of emotion which is great :)</td>', 'I think the white balance was a bit off in this photo as everything has a blue cast. To fix this you could just make it black and white :) The photo shows a lot of emotion which is great :)', '2004-11-13 09:19:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009303, 119947, 2780, '<td valign="top">I think the eye is a bit too close to the top of the frame, but a good shot anyway.</td>', 'I think the eye is a bit too close to the top of the frame, but a good shot anyway.', '2004-11-13 09:19:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009304, 120235, 2780, '<td valign="top">With brighter lighting the colours could have had much more ''pop''. At the moment they look a bit dull, especially the yellow.</td>', 'With brighter lighting the colours could have had much more ''pop''. At the moment they look a bit dull, especially the yellow.', '2004-11-13 09:20:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009306, 118330, 2780, '<td valign="top">Interesting patterns, but I think a different angle with some DoF would make the overall photo more interesting.</td>', 'Interesting patterns, but I think a different angle with some DoF would make the overall photo more interesting.', '2004-11-13 09:20:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009307, 120048, 2780, '<td valign="top">The muted colours and the DoF work very very well here. Great shot. 9</td>', 'The muted colours and the DoF work very very well here. Great shot. 9', '2004-11-13 09:21:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009308, 118745, 2780, '<td valign="top">Lol, funny title :) The DoF works well, but some people might not know what it is.</td>', 'Lol, funny title :) The DoF works well, but some people might not know what it is.', '2004-11-13 09:22:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009309, 118795, 2780, '<td valign="top">The colours all seem a bit flat. Higher contrast might fix this.</td>', 'The colours all seem a bit flat. Higher contrast might fix this.', '2004-11-13 09:22:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009310, 120104, 2780, '<td valign="top">Effective use of DoF. I don''t really think the border was necessary in this case though.</td>', 'Effective use of DoF. I don''t really think the border was necessary in this case though.', '2004-11-13 09:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009311, 118674, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good DoF, focussing well on the eye. Higher contrast would make this photo stand out more. At the moment its a bit flat.</td>', 'Good DoF, focussing well on the eye. Higher contrast would make this photo stand out more. At the moment its a bit flat.', '2004-11-13 09:23:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009313, 119895, 2780, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo. The lighting and DoF and everything is perfect. 10</td>', 'Excellent photo. The lighting and DoF and everything is perfect. 10', '2004-11-13 09:24:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009318, 118988, 2780, '<td valign="top">I like the fact that the background a creamy rather than plain white. The composition is good too. Nice shot.</td>', 'I like the fact that the background a creamy rather than plain white. The composition is good too. Nice shot.', '2004-11-13 09:31:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009319, 118780, 2780, '<td valign="top">Slightly doft focus at the top, which could be fixed by USM, but otherwise a great shot with good DoF and lighting. Nice job.</td>', 'Slightly doft focus at the top, which could be fixed by USM, but otherwise a great shot with good DoF and lighting. Nice job.', '2004-11-13 09:34:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009320, 120017, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting is a little harsh as is visable with the bright reflections. Try diffusing the light source a bit with some paper so that it''s more even.</td>', 'The lighting is a little harsh as is visable with the bright reflections. Try diffusing the light source a bit with some paper so that it''s more even.', '2004-11-13 09:35:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009321, 119982, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good sharp photo, but too much black in my opinion. Having another colour to reflect on the hard drive would have separated it from the background.</td>', 'Good sharp photo, but too much black in my opinion. Having another colour to reflect on the hard drive would have separated it from the background.', '2004-11-13 09:35:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009323, 119879, 2780, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems a bit flat, with no highlighted areas. Try boosting the contrast in PP or if that doesnt work, changing the angle of lighting to add some more colour and shade variation.</td>', 'The lighting seems a bit flat, with no highlighted areas. Try boosting the contrast in PP or if that doesnt work, changing the angle of lighting to add some more colour and shade variation.', '2004-11-13 09:36:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009324, 120149, 2780, '<td valign="top">A slightly wider DoF to make the nose fully in focus would have imrpoved this shot a lot.</td>', 'A slightly wider DoF to make the nose fully in focus would have imrpoved this shot a lot.', '2004-11-13 09:36:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009326, 119896, 2780, '<td valign="top">This photo is good and interesting but overall a bit dark. Try a longer exposure of adjusting the levels in post processing.</td>', 'This photo is good and interesting but overall a bit dark. Try a longer exposure of adjusting the levels in post processing.', '2004-11-13 09:37:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009327, 120084, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours and a great abstract photo.</td>', 'Really nice colours and a great abstract photo.', '2004-11-13 09:37:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009328, 119883, 2780, '<td valign="top">The crop is a bit too tight for my taste and the composition a bit too centered. Try playing around with adding space on different sides to see what you like.</td>', 'The crop is a bit too tight for my taste and the composition a bit too centered. Try playing around with adding space on different sides to see what you like.', '2004-11-13 09:38:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009329, 118768, 2780, '<td valign="top">Good abstract shapes and lines. Increasing the contrast would exaggurate these more and improve the photo in my opinon.</td>', 'Good abstract shapes and lines. Increasing the contrast would exaggurate these more and improve the photo in my opinon.', '2004-11-13 09:39:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009331, 120126, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice shot. The strip of orange just adds that finishing touch. 10</td>', 'Really nice shot. The strip of orange just adds that finishing touch. 10', '2004-11-13 09:39:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009332, 120000, 2780, '<td valign="top">Cute photo :) The lighting does seem a bit flat though, maybe adjusting the levels a bit to darken the background would help.</td>', 'Cute photo :) The lighting does seem a bit flat though, maybe adjusting the levels a bit to darken the background would help.', '2004-11-13 09:40:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009333, 119997, 2780, '<td valign="top">The whites seem all a bit over exposed. You might be able to fix that in PP, but otherwise you should use a shorter shutter speed. It''s easier to brighten a picture dimmer than it is to darken one thats too bright, because if detail wasnt there in the first place you cant bring it back.</td>', 'The whites seem all a bit over exposed. You might be able to fix that in PP, but otherwise you should use a shorter shutter speed. It''s easier to brighten a picture dimmer than it is to darken one thats too bright, because if detail wasnt there in the first place you cant bring it back.', '2004-11-13 09:41:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009335, 118354, 2780, '<td valign="top">A quicker shutter speed would help this be more in focus. Also, try to use the full 640 pixel limit if you can.</td>', 'A quicker shutter speed would help this be more in focus. Also, try to use the full 640 pixel limit if you can.', '2004-11-13 09:42:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009336, 120228, 2780, '<td valign="top">Really nice colours in this shot, are they real? Good photo.</td>', 'Really nice colours in this shot, are they real? Good photo.', '2004-11-13 09:42:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(1009338, 118641, 2780, '<td valign="top">A different angle with some DoF would improve the appeal in this shot, as would a more simple background. The current one is a bit distracting.</td>', 'A different angle with some DoF would improve the appeal in this shot, as would a more simple background. The current one is a bit distracting.', '2004-11-13 09:43:33.000000', NULL, 1),
