(1009624, 120189, 27845, '<td valign="top">Great macro. The center offset somehow takes the harmony out of this picture, which relies on symmetry, after all.</td>', 'Great macro. The center offset somehow takes the harmony out of this picture, which relies on symmetry, after all.', '2004-11-13 16:16:41.000000', NULL, 1),
