(1009640, 119456, 27605, '<td valign="top">Really lovely shot.  In my opinion, could have been a contender if somehow you had communicated the vase''s small size within the photo instead of only in the title.  Good luck, this may ribbon yet!</td>', 'Really lovely shot.  In my opinion, could have been a contender if somehow you had communicated the vase''s small size within the photo instead of only in the title.  Good luck, this may ribbon yet!', '2004-11-13 16:50:14.000000', NULL, 1),
