(1010428, 118739, 12674, '<td valign="top">I can''t really make out your image that well, although it looks like a cat eye.  Work with your processing software to figure out how to utilize the full size allotted for images, which is 640 pixels (I think that''s the unit) along the longest dimension. It will show up much better at that size.</td>', 'I can''t really make out your image that well, although it looks like a cat eye.  Work with your processing software to figure out how to utilize the full size allotted for images, which is 640 pixels (I think that''s the unit) along the longest dimension. It will show up much better at that size.', '2004-11-14 13:21:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010433, 119885, 12674, '<td valign="top">You found an interesting subject to shoot...you might try isolating just the mushroom by cropping more, as the leaves behind are a little distracting.</td>', 'You found an interesting subject to shoot...you might try isolating just the mushroom by cropping more, as the leaves behind are a little distracting.', '2004-11-14 13:25:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010435, 119990, 12674, '<td valign="top">Wow, that''s beautiful...nice shot with striking contrast.  10</td>', 'Wow, that''s beautiful...nice shot with striking contrast.  10', '2004-11-14 13:27:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010473, 120153, 27845, '<td valign="top">Woahw! This ain''t water, is it?Those tiny specks look awesome. And you cropped it just right. I really can''t find anything to critisize. Looks great. The first 10 I''m giving out for this contest!</td>', 'Woahw! This ain''t water, is it?Those tiny specks look awesome. And you cropped it just right. I really can''t find anything to critisize. Looks great. The first 10 I''m giving out for this contest!', '2004-11-14 14:54:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010480, 118950, 7485, '<td valign="top">Oh dear, this one is will surely beat my pen photo :-)  <br/>Great concept, very well executed. Only complaint is that the DOF is a bit too shallow. Would have been even better with the whole pen in focus, or at least both the nib and the emblem - 7</td>', 'Oh dear, this one is will surely beat my pen photo :-)  Great concept, very well executed. Only complaint is that the DOF is a bit too shallow. Would have been even better with the whole pen in focus, or at least both the nib and the emblem - 7', '2004-11-14 15:04:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010482, 119847, 7485, '<td valign="top">Okay I take it back, so far I have not seen a single decent PCB/chip photo in this or any other challenge, so I thought they were just a lost cause. Well, yours proves it can be a great subject. Maybe it''s the glowing green and red dots that make all the difference? 7</td>', 'Okay I take it back, so far I have not seen a single decent PCB/chip photo in this or any other challenge, so I thought they were just a lost cause. Well, yours proves it can be a great subject. Maybe it''s the glowing green and red dots that make all the difference? 7', '2004-11-14 15:08:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010483, 119795, 27845, '<td valign="top">This is scary. I had this very idea this afternoon (14th Nov) when I was eating a mandarine. Unforunatley, ideas often look better than the photographs: The background should be smooth, as opposed to the fruit''s ''toes''. I''d also have liked harder shadows, but I guess that''s a matter of taste.</td>', 'This is scary. I had this very idea this afternoon (14th Nov) when I was eating a mandarine. Unforunatley, ideas often look better than the photographs: The background should be smooth, as opposed to the fruit''s ''toes''. I''d also have liked harder shadows, but I guess that''s a matter of taste.', '2004-11-14 15:08:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(1010484, 119637, 27845, '<td valign="top">What a nice oxymoron. Another background would have made the cube come out better.</td>', 'What a nice oxymoron. Another background would have made the cube come out better.', '2004-11-14 15:08:57.000000', NULL, 1),
