(1013156, 120263, 29437, '<td valign="top">Really drags you in.  Nice colors and direction.</td>', 'Really drags you in.  Nice colors and direction.', '2004-11-16 03:08:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013162, 119984, 29437, '<td valign="top">Nice subject.  Too much is dragging the eye out of frame, though.  I am constantly reminded of the rest of the chicken, and it detracts from the image at hand.  Try to lose some of the lines pulling the eye out of frame.</td>', 'Nice subject.  Too much is dragging the eye out of frame, though.  I am constantly reminded of the rest of the chicken, and it detracts from the image at hand.  Try to lose some of the lines pulling the eye out of frame.', '2004-11-16 03:19:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013164, 118385, 29437, '<td valign="top">Good use of color and negative space.</td>', 'Good use of color and negative space.', '2004-11-16 03:20:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013167, 120196, 29437, '<td valign="top">Perhaps more contrast in color and lighting?  Position is good, but the image falls flat.</td>', 'Perhaps more contrast in color and lighting?  Position is good, but the image falls flat.', '2004-11-16 03:22:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013168, 119880, 29437, '<td valign="top">Fun.  Good placement and excellently creative subject.</td>', 'Fun.  Good placement and excellently creative subject.', '2004-11-16 03:23:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013169, 120046, 29437, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of light and shadow.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Excellent use of light and shadow.  Very nice photo.', '2004-11-16 03:25:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013170, 119941, 29437, '<td valign="top">Good dynamic image of contrasting colors, but they wash out.  If this a choice, be more bold.  If not, keep these colors vivid.</td>', 'Good dynamic image of contrasting colors, but they wash out.  If this a choice, be more bold.  If not, keep these colors vivid.', '2004-11-16 03:28:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013171, 120115, 29437, '<td valign="top">try a more interesting positioning.  Good use of light and shadow.</td>', 'try a more interesting positioning.  Good use of light and shadow.', '2004-11-16 03:29:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013173, 118756, 29437, '<td valign="top">Very nice image.  Who would''ve thought a stapler could be so evocative?</td>', 'Very nice image.  Who would''ve thought a stapler could be so evocative?', '2004-11-16 03:31:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013179, 118315, 29437, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of contrast and direction.  Very nice photo.</td>', 'Excellent use of contrast and direction.  Very nice photo.', '2004-11-16 03:35:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013207, 120150, 24153, '<td valign="top">Simple, but great shot ! Love it.</td>', 'Simple, but great shot ! Love it.', '2004-11-16 04:39:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013209, 118674, 24153, '<td valign="top">Nice close-up shot ! How small is this turtle ?</td>', 'Nice close-up shot ! How small is this turtle ?', '2004-11-16 04:42:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013212, 119894, 24153, '<td valign="top">Love the colors, good shot !</td>', 'Love the colors, good shot !', '2004-11-16 04:45:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013214, 119331, 24906, '<td valign="top">The colour,contrast and depth of field make this a very pleasing photogragh. Itis further enhanced by the double symmetry of reflection and arrangement, and the tight cropping of the subject.</td>', 'The colour,contrast and depth of field make this a very pleasing photogragh. Itis further enhanced by the double symmetry of reflection and arrangement, and the tight cropping of the subject.', '2004-11-16 04:52:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013219, 119028, 16352, '<td valign="top">Striking picture the second it appeared on the screen. it immediatly looked like a mecahanical insect/bug Brilliant. It was a shame put the staples did look a little "posed". I use a three screen setup - all profiled - and tried looking at it side by side with a few adjustments to pulling the histogram around - to give it more punch</td>', 'Striking picture the second it appeared on the screen. it immediatly looked like a mecahanical insect/bug Brilliant. It was a shame put the staples did look a little "posed". I use a three screen setup - all profiled - and tried looking at it side by side with a few adjustments to pulling the histogram around - to give it more punch', '2004-11-16 05:12:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013221, 119984, 16352, '<td valign="top">So horrible (scary) its brilliant - It proves what a new angle on something ordinary can do - I would like to see this at the same eye level - It would then probably look as if it was going to come right out of the screen AT the viewer</td>', 'So horrible (scary) its brilliant - It proves what a new angle on something ordinary can do - I would like to see this at the same eye level - It would then probably look as if it was going to come right out of the screen AT the viewer', '2004-11-16 05:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013227, 120066, 16352, '<td valign="top">Deep solid blacks with pure whites and a surprising spread on the tonal range considering almost everything is black. I find the splodge of light in the top right a little distracting and it competes with the aperture marking highlight behind the focus ring. This would make a good product shot with composition as it is but with dark deadspace at the top of the picture - but for this challenge the composition is spot on</td>', 'Deep solid blacks with pure whites and a surprising spread on the tonal range considering almost everything is black. I find the splodge of light in the top right a little distracting and it competes with the aperture marking highlight behind the focus ring. This would make a good product shot with composition as it is but with dark deadspace at the top of the picture - but for this challenge the composition is spot on', '2004-11-16 05:21:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013233, 120053, 22459, '<td valign="top">Edit:<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2005-10-05 23:38:43.</i></td>', 'Edit:', '2004-11-16 05:27:12.000000', '2005-10-06 00:38:43.000000', 1),
(1013236, 118815, 16352, '<td valign="top">Some of the delicacy of the shell is lost in the highlight - and as it is a static object it could have more DOF in the picture. Either the light directly above it was deliberatly placed or it was shot using available light. It has lots of potential.<br/>If it was shot on a compact with little manual control over lighting then you have done well to emulate this type of still life. If you have a more versatile camera then it needed a little more care setting up and possibly, if you have bracketed exposures, one of the other may look slightly better. Good composition - nice cropping</td>', 'Some of the delicacy of the shell is lost in the highlight - and as it is a static object it could have more DOF in the picture. Either the light directly above it was deliberatly placed or it was shot using available light. It has lots of potential.If it was shot on a compact with little manual control over lighting then you have done well to emulate this type of still life. If you have a more versatile camera then it needed a little more care setting up and possibly, if you have bracketed exposures, one of the other may look slightly better. Good composition - nice cropping', '2004-11-16 05:30:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013238, 118476, 16352, '<td valign="top">An excellent demonstration of what depth of field is but picture falls a little flat. As a picture for a book on DOF then yes it is good but as a "decorative/artistic" work it was not quite the. My immediate thought when I saw it was "sharp vs unsharp" and so maybe if this had been a picture of a very sharp blade it would have had the punch to lift it.</td>', 'An excellent demonstration of what depth of field is but picture falls a little flat. As a picture for a book on DOF then yes it is good but as a "decorative/artistic" work it was not quite the. My immediate thought when I saw it was "sharp vs unsharp" and so maybe if this had been a picture of a very sharp blade it would have had the punch to lift it.', '2004-11-16 05:34:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013240, 120180, 16352, '<td valign="top">Good - well lit - space for advertising - good example of depth of field - maybe focus point could have been more off centre. If I was still shooting this type of item in a studio for magazine use I would have put matt black tape/card over whatever it is putting that light "smudge" near the top right</td>', 'Good - well lit - space for advertising - good example of depth of field - maybe focus point could have been more off centre. If I was still shooting this type of item in a studio for magazine use I would have put matt black tape/card over whatever it is putting that light "smudge" near the top right', '2004-11-16 05:38:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013241, 118776, 16352, '<td valign="top">Great - rich colours - the hi-lights, reflections are all perfectly aligned - lovely detail on the inside top of the pens.<br/>From a photographic point of view it is excellent - exposure spot on. Depth of field just right - point of focus, exact.<br/>For a competition I would definately put in on the list.<br/>As a picture on my wall I cannot say it would get space but that is not the point here. I will definately be looking at some of your other work.</td>', 'Great - rich colours - the hi-lights, reflections are all perfectly aligned - lovely detail on the inside top of the pens.From a photographic point of view it is excellent - exposure spot on. Depth of field just right - point of focus, exact.For a competition I would definately put in on the list.As a picture on my wall I cannot say it would get space but that is not the point here. I will definately be looking at some of your other work.', '2004-11-16 05:44:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013244, 120033, 23394, '<td valign="top">this might have worked better if the lighting was toned down a bit.  as is, it really gives this image an in-your-face feel that is not very pleasant, something akin to the way you would feel if you were this close to someone planting an octopus on your face.  i''ll give you a 5, anyway, for effort.</td>', 'this might have worked better if the lighting was toned down a bit.  as is, it really gives this image an in-your-face feel that is not very pleasant, something akin to the way you would feel if you were this close to someone planting an octopus on your face.  i''ll give you a 5, anyway, for effort.', '2004-11-16 05:55:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013245, 118246, 23394, '<td valign="top">actually (as has probably been repeatedly pointed out), cigar<i>ette</i>.  this would have been better if you had cropped the top 10% off to remove unnecessary distractions.  composition, lighting, colors come together to balance out the parts i don''t like, so i''ll give it a 5.</td>', 'actually (as has probably been repeatedly pointed out), cigarette.  this would have been better if you had cropped the top 10% off to remove unnecessary distractions.  composition, lighting, colors come together to balance out the parts i don''t like, so i''ll give it a 5.', '2004-11-16 06:00:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013246, 118643, 23394, '<td valign="top">oh, how clever.</td>', 'oh, how clever.', '2004-11-16 06:03:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013249, 119901, 23394, '<td valign="top">this would be more inviting if shot with lots of natural light and a broad catchlight and interesting reflections.</td>', 'this would be more inviting if shot with lots of natural light and a broad catchlight and interesting reflections.', '2004-11-16 06:06:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013251, 119103, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice balance of colors and light</td>', 'nice balance of colors and light', '2004-11-16 06:09:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013252, 119808, 23394, '<td valign="top">focus is too soft along top of shell, and that takes away from what would be a killer image.</td>', 'focus is too soft along top of shell, and that takes away from what would be a killer image.', '2004-11-16 06:10:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013253, 120258, 23394, '<td valign="top">intentional or not, the side is too blown out to allow me to focus on your subject.</td>', 'intentional or not, the side is too blown out to allow me to focus on your subject.', '2004-11-16 06:11:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013254, 120077, 23394, '<td valign="top">while i can relate to the sentiment, i don''t like the end result.  maybe if shot without the flash?  this kinda bears out "the whole is greater than the sum of the parts."</td>', 'while i can relate to the sentiment, i don''t like the end result.  maybe if shot without the flash?  this kinda bears out "the whole is greater than the sum of the parts."', '2004-11-16 06:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013255, 119635, 23394, '<td valign="top">just out of curiosity, did you try different colored apples?</td>', 'just out of curiosity, did you try different colored apples?', '2004-11-16 06:14:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013257, 118567, 23394, '<td valign="top">don''t like the shallow dof.  intentional or not, this is hard to look at.  maybe if the lighting wasn''t so strong?  or maybe, if the foreground subject was razor sharp?</td>', 'don''t like the shallow dof.  intentional or not, this is hard to look at.  maybe if the lighting wasn''t so strong?  or maybe, if the foreground subject was razor sharp?', '2004-11-16 06:16:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013259, 120120, 23394, '<td valign="top">well, you must have been on pins and needles, wondering if this was going to be dq''d...</td>', 'well, you must have been on pins and needles, wondering if this was going to be dq''d...', '2004-11-16 06:19:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013260, 120091, 23394, '<td valign="top">this Rocks!!!  thanks for giving me one of the few Wows i''ve seen!</td>', 'this Rocks!!!  thanks for giving me one of the few Wows i''ve seen!', '2004-11-16 06:21:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013261, 119940, 23394, '<td valign="top">i am going to go shoot this to see what background color i find the most pleasing.  somehow, the red seems too strong, but i can''t say for sure.</td>', 'i am going to go shoot this to see what background color i find the most pleasing.  somehow, the red seems too strong, but i can''t say for sure.', '2004-11-16 06:23:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013262, 120236, 23394, '<td valign="top">i''m sorry, but my first impression was "blair witch project".  after trying to look a bit more, my condition hasn''t improved...</td>', 'i''m sorry, but my first impression was "blair witch project".  after trying to look a bit more, my condition hasn''t improved...', '2004-11-16 06:24:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013263, 120114, 23394, '<td valign="top">nice abstract.  curious to see what your post processing is.  also, can''t tell if you have some hot pixels that need attention.</td>', 'nice abstract.  curious to see what your post processing is.  also, can''t tell if you have some hot pixels that need attention.', '2004-11-16 06:26:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013266, 120249, 16352, '<td valign="top">Nearly a brilliant ad shot and one I would certainly have put in the "next round" pile but to be used commercially it would need a much longer depth of field. It may be that you not have the equipment to achieve that, in which case exellent on what you did achieve.<br/>A picture that I would have framed if it was reshot exactly as it is but with different lighting, DOF</td>', 'Nearly a brilliant ad shot and one I would certainly have put in the "next round" pile but to be used commercially it would need a much longer depth of field. It may be that you not have the equipment to achieve that, in which case exellent on what you did achieve.A picture that I would have framed if it was reshot exactly as it is but with different lighting, DOF', '2004-11-16 06:28:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013267, 120142, 23394, '<td valign="top">this is the first eye-shot i''ve seen so far that i can actually look at.  thanks for an image that doesn''t make me go "eewwww".  i think this would be stronger if the eyebrow was cropped out.</td>', 'this is the first eye-shot i''ve seen so far that i can actually look at.  thanks for an image that doesn''t make me go "eewwww".  i think this would be stronger if the eyebrow was cropped out.', '2004-11-16 06:29:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013269, 118217, 23394, '<td valign="top">pretty dog, probably a wonderful companion.  however, a macro would have been a shot of his ear, or eye, or nose, or mouth.</td>', 'pretty dog, probably a wonderful companion.  however, a macro would have been a shot of his ear, or eye, or nose, or mouth.', '2004-11-16 06:31:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013270, 118757, 16352, '<td valign="top">Stunning blue eyes and beautiful lashes. with a beautiful reflection in the eyes. A different angle from other "eye" portraits. <br/>Exposure is spot on.</td>', 'Stunning blue eyes and beautiful lashes. with a beautiful reflection in the eyes. A different angle from other "eye" portraits. Exposure is spot on.', '2004-11-16 06:31:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013271, 120045, 23394, '<td valign="top">fun image, neg space is ok, cropped a little tight for me, though.</td>', 'fun image, neg space is ok, cropped a little tight for me, though.', '2004-11-16 06:32:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013274, 120178, 23394, '<td valign="top">most interesting shot.  if this wasn''t basic editing, i''d say tone down the hot spots on the brush.</td>', 'most interesting shot.  if this wasn''t basic editing, i''d say tone down the hot spots on the brush.', '2004-11-16 06:34:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013275, 119944, 16352, '<td valign="top">As each picture comes on the screen I force my first thought to be "would I want it to hang on my wall" second thought "Would I use it commercially" third thought "would I pay money to have a print" fourth "is it technically correct" (the fourth does not matter if 1,2 and 3 are met)<br/>This makes a yes in all 4.<br/>Excellent.</td>', 'As each picture comes on the screen I force my first thought to be "would I want it to hang on my wall" second thought "Would I use it commercially" third thought "would I pay money to have a print" fourth "is it technically correct" (the fourth does not matter if 1,2 and 3 are met)This makes a yes in all 4.Excellent.', '2004-11-16 06:35:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013278, 120172, 23394, '<td valign="top">i think this would have Rocked, with any other colored background.</td>', 'i think this would have Rocked, with any other colored background.', '2004-11-16 06:36:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013284, 119889, 29271, '<td valign="top">They don''t get much better than this; well, almost....</td>', 'They don''t get much better than this; well, almost....', '2004-11-16 06:41:01.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013286, 118629, 16352, '<td valign="top">What can I say. If I was still judging for publications this would certainly go "next round".<br/>A shame about the dark area "top right" fantastic DOF and stunning catchlight. I am ignoring the crazing top centre dribbling down which I suspect looks softer in the original and put down to compression.<br/>Love it</td>', 'What can I say. If I was still judging for publications this would certainly go "next round".A shame about the dark area "top right" fantastic DOF and stunning catchlight. I am ignoring the crazing top centre dribbling down which I suspect looks softer in the original and put down to compression.Love it', '2004-11-16 06:49:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013290, 119619, 16352, '<td valign="top">This may seem a hard crit of a potentially great picture.<br/> - spoiled by the reflection. It looks like the photographer at a window (I assume thats what it is). The title only seems to explain away an accidental image caught in the eye.<br/>If you can imagine this hung on a wall as it is and then hung on a wall with black eye plus a catchlight I think you would see what I mean.<br/>It may be that it was impossible to get the shot without the reflection, in which case - well done.<br/>If I was still judging it would have to go in the "nearly pile" which is a great shame. Of course to hang it on a wall would be easy after some simple PS editing (I know you can''t for this challenge" so I will mark it as I would have done without the reflection.<br/></td>', 'This may seem a hard crit of a potentially great picture. - spoiled by the reflection. It looks like the photographer at a window (I assume thats what it is). The title only seems to explain away an accidental image caught in the eye.If you can imagine this hung on a wall as it is and then hung on a wall with black eye plus a catchlight I think you would see what I mean.It may be that it was impossible to get the shot without the reflection, in which case - well done.If I was still judging it would have to go in the "nearly pile" which is a great shame. Of course to hang it on a wall would be easy after some simple PS editing (I know you can''t for this challenge" so I will mark it as I would have done without the reflection.', '2004-11-16 06:58:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013294, 120180, 1368, '<td valign="top">the dof and the lighting makes this picture stand out, good job</td>', 'the dof and the lighting makes this picture stand out, good job', '2004-11-16 07:02:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013295, 119057, 16352, '<td valign="top">A brilliant example of where the title and the picture are one.<br/>I earlier grumblued at one entry re their titling explaining how their title competed with their picture. This though is brilliant. It would make a great poster with the text as part of that.</td>', 'A brilliant example of where the title and the picture are one.I earlier grumblued at one entry re their titling explaining how their title competed with their picture. This though is brilliant. It would make a great poster with the text as part of that.', '2004-11-16 07:03:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013297, 119982, 1368, '<td valign="top">how sweet! you have made a hard drive look romantic, love the title and the way it fades into the darkness on the right side</td>', 'how sweet! you have made a hard drive look romantic, love the title and the way it fades into the darkness on the right side', '2004-11-16 07:04:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013298, 119965, 1368, '<td valign="top">Good composition maybe the background could haev been a bit brighter</td>', 'Good composition maybe the background could haev been a bit brighter', '2004-11-16 07:05:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(1013301, 118966, 1368, '<td valign="top">I have been trying to look at the picture from the side hehe maybe cause the letter on the chip are that way. I feel this reminds me of some kind of poster</td>', 'I have been trying to look at the picture from the side hehe maybe cause the letter on the chip are that way. I feel this reminds me of some kind of poster', '2004-11-16 07:07:52.000000', NULL, 1),
