(1014033, 118644, 25218, '<td valign="top">Nice abstract. - I really like the play between the shadow and the subject. Great color gradiation, too.</td>', 'Nice abstract. - I really like the play between the shadow and the subject. Great color gradiation, too.', '2004-11-16 17:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
