(1014051, 118577, 25218, '<td valign="top">you did a really good job focusing, but the subject doesn''t do much for me. I don''t mean because it''s the USA flag, but this particular flag looks like such a cheap, plastic thing (no offense!). Also, the composition isn''t real exciting. But I kind of do like that you shot it on a bigger version(?) or printout of the same image.</td>', 'you did a really good job focusing, but the subject doesn''t do much for me. I don''t mean because it''s the USA flag, but this particular flag looks like such a cheap, plastic thing (no offense!). Also, the composition isn''t real exciting. But I kind of do like that you shot it on a bigger version(?) or printout of the same image.', '2004-11-16 17:49:20.000000', NULL, 1),
