(1014059, 120013, 25218, '<td valign="top">oooh.. you''re not trying to push any buttons, are you? ;)  I like the crop, but it''s not in crisp focus, which is hard with shiny objects, I know (well, any object is hard for me - just check out my profile...)  Good luck!</td>', 'oooh.. you''re not trying to push any buttons, are you? ;)  I like the crop, but it''s not in crisp focus, which is hard with shiny objects, I know (well, any object is hard for me - just check out my profile...)  Good luck!', '2004-11-16 17:52:15.000000', NULL, 1),
