(1014756, 120276, 25873, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments they were very helpful.  It seems that the reflections were both liked and disliked - which is about the way I felt about them.  I decided to leave them in (rather than a submit a shot will less reflection) because I felt it made the image more unique.</td>', 'Thanks for all the comments they were very helpful.  It seems that the reflections were both liked and disliked - which is about the way I felt about them.  I decided to leave them in (rather than a submit a shot will less reflection) because I felt it made the image more unique.', '2004-11-17 00:13:36.000000', NULL, 0),
(1014760, 118629, 4482, '<td valign="top">WOOHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!! <br/> <br/>This is prolly the best ribbon that I''ve won sicne I''ve been here!! Out of 529!!! I''m just stoked right now!!!!<br/> <br/>And by the way, that crisp area on the skin the very shallow DOF (f 2.8)I had to work with. I would hold my breath for every shot... and even then the drop isn''t crystal clear. <br/> <br/>Thanks to all!!! WOOHOOOO!!!!! Party party party!!! :-P<br/> <br/>PS: could an admin or a SC put a space somewhere in Sparky''s post?? It''s making everything all lopsided! Thanks! :-)<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-17 00:34:02.</i></td>', 'WOOHOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO!!!  This is prolly the best ribbon that I''ve won sicne I''ve been here!! Out of 529!!! I''m just stoked right now!!!! And by the way, that crisp area on the skin the very shallow DOF (f 2.8)I had to work with. I would hold my breath for every shot... and even then the drop isn''t crystal clear.  Thanks to all!!! WOOHOOOO!!!!! Party party party!!! :-P PS: could an admin or a SC put a space somewhere in Sparky''s post?? It''s making everything all lopsided! Thanks! :-)', '2004-11-17 00:13:57.000000', '2004-11-17 00:34:02.000000', 0),
