(1015286, 118757, 27440, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for the comments and votes. <br/> <br/>I like this shot very much and I''m proud of it. I thought that I was going to break the 6.0 score with this shot and score higher but well :) maybe next time.<br/> <br/>GoldBerry this saying is reffering to the fact that only a handfull of photographs is really good from out of them all. Let''s say it''s a humble saying :) But to tell the truth a very real one.<br/>I wouldn''t say that a photographer is all-seeing.<br/> <br/>Cheers :)</td>', 'Thanks to all for the comments and votes.  I like this shot very much and I''m proud of it. I thought that I was going to break the 6.0 score with this shot and score higher but well :) maybe next time. GoldBerry this saying is reffering to the fact that only a handfull of photographs is really good from out of them all. Let''s say it''s a humble saying :) But to tell the truth a very real one.I wouldn''t say that a photographer is all-seeing. Cheers :)', '2004-11-17 02:43:37.000000', NULL, 0),
