(1015453, 120133, 3585, '<td valign="top">Solid composition, even though it feels a little robust for my taste (probably the centered diagonals). Contrary to about 500 camera owners that have joined this household inventory challenge you have presented, with some grace, a nicely toned objet with caracter and history.</td>', 'Solid composition, even though it feels a little robust for my taste (probably the centered diagonals). Contrary to about 500 camera owners that have joined this household inventory challenge you have presented, with some grace, a nicely toned objet with caracter and history.', '2004-11-17 04:11:37.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015456, 120091, 6388, '<td valign="top">dood this completely rocks.  i thought about your skateboard from the feet challenge when i first saw it.  very imaginative, and well executed.<br/> <br/>that and RC Race cars are really cool.  thank goodness i have a four year old and can justify playing with them<br/> <br/>Pedro<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-17 04:36:34.</i></td>', 'dood this completely rocks.  i thought about your skateboard from the feet challenge when i first saw it.  very imaginative, and well executed. that and RC Race cars are really cool.  thank goodness i have a four year old and can justify playing with them Pedro', '2004-11-17 04:16:46.000000', '2004-11-17 04:36:34.000000', 0),
(1015475, 119666, 19952, '<td valign="top">I''m really shocked that this shot didn''t do better in the ratings. I thought it had a good chance to ribbon and was sure that it would at least make the top ten. It''s amazing what you were able to do with a simple fish head.</td>', 'I''m really shocked that this shot didn''t do better in the ratings. I thought it had a good chance to ribbon and was sure that it would at least make the top ten. It''s amazing what you were able to do with a simple fish head.', '2004-11-17 04:35:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015489, 118363, 93, '<td valign="top">Huh.. I thought I had a real winner here, but my camera''s technical limitations are definitely showing.  <br/> <br/>Eugene - I USM''d this piece to death.. :)  As for getting a better DOF, it''s just not possible with my cam.  Oh well, what can you do eh?<br/> <br/>I dunno if many people actually *got* this one, or spent long enough looking at it.  Some of you did though, so that''s good :)  More 3s on this photo than I''ve had in a long time.. confusing.<br/> <br/>Oh well, I just have to keep trying.  I may bitch about my scores and stuff, but as long as I keep submitting stuff *I* like, instead of stuff I think everyone *else* will like, I''ll just have to eventually learn to like scores like this :)<br/> <br/>Can I say like any more than that!?</td>', 'Huh.. I thought I had a real winner here, but my camera''s technical limitations are definitely showing.   Eugene - I USM''d this piece to death.. :)  As for getting a better DOF, it''s just not possible with my cam.  Oh well, what can you do eh? I dunno if many people actually *got* this one, or spent long enough looking at it.  Some of you did though, so that''s good :)  More 3s on this photo than I''ve had in a long time.. confusing. Oh well, I just have to keep trying.  I may bitch about my scores and stuff, but as long as I keep submitting stuff *I* like, instead of stuff I think everyone *else* will like, I''ll just have to eventually learn to like scores like this :) Can I say like any more than that!?', '2004-11-17 04:56:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015516, 120178, 6130, '<td valign="top">Fantastic. If I not have filled my quota of favorites I have choose it as a favorite.</td>', 'Fantastic. If I not have filled my quota of favorites I have choose it as a favorite.', '2004-11-17 05:32:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015537, 120133, 14603, '<td valign="top">A large dose of my "NI trick" would have had this in the top ten <br/>Shame on you for being so dull and boring :)<br/> <br/>Seriously !!!...A very refreshing shot that deserved a high placing.</td>', 'A large dose of my "NI trick" would have had this in the top ten Shame on you for being so dull and boring :) Seriously !!!...A very refreshing shot that deserved a high placing.', '2004-11-17 05:48:58.000000', NULL, 0),
