(1015705, 118629, 8125, '<td valign="top">This is an awesome image, and a great idea!  This is true inspiration to those of us (that means me) who find it hard to think of macro subjects other than bugs or flowers!  Great work and congrats on the very well deserved blue!  :-)</td>', 'This is an awesome image, and a great idea!  This is true inspiration to those of us (that means me) who find it hard to think of macro subjects other than bugs or flowers!  Great work and congrats on the very well deserved blue!  :-)', '2004-11-17 07:50:18.000000', NULL, 0),
