(1015718, 120153, 8125, '<td valign="top">Great job and congrats on your ribbon!  I love the ideas that came pouring out with this challenge, it''s an insiration for me...</td>', 'Great job and congrats on your ribbon!  I love the ideas that came pouring out with this challenge, it''s an insiration for me...', '2004-11-17 07:56:25.000000', NULL, 0),
