(1015759, 119740, 23141, '<td valign="top">Some constructive criticism (or nitpicking!) :)<br/> <br/>- A bigger depth of field would have kept the tops of your "buildings" in focus.  The entire "city" itself seems a tad bit out of focus, but that could be due to resizing, handheld camera, or even my screen.  The base may be just fine on your screen in your imaging software.<br/>- Removal of the sticker would have helped people to see the "city" better.  I would like to compare a color version to see which really shows off the city idea better.<br/>- The lighting in this picture creates really harsh shadows.  A second light or bouncing light in from the bottom left would help to reduce those.<br/>- There are two blank spaces (top left and bottom right) that are distracting and could have been cropped out.<br/> <br/>My two cents... hope that helps!</td>', 'Some constructive criticism (or nitpicking!) :) - A bigger depth of field would have kept the tops of your "buildings" in focus.  The entire "city" itself seems a tad bit out of focus, but that could be due to resizing, handheld camera, or even my screen.  The base may be just fine on your screen in your imaging software.- Removal of the sticker would have helped people to see the "city" better.  I would like to compare a color version to see which really shows off the city idea better.- The lighting in this picture creates really harsh shadows.  A second light or bouncing light in from the bottom left would help to reduce those.- There are two blank spaces (top left and bottom right) that are distracting and could have been cropped out. My two cents... hope that helps!', '2004-11-17 08:11:56.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015763, 119740, 24128, '<td valign="top">There are many elements on the image that are prominent (capacitors, 2pin socket) which, due to the shallow dof are out of focus.<br/> <br/>You chose to use monochrome for the image but the tonal range is somewhat lacking in dynamism.<br/> <br/>Overall the image is rather boring and nondescript, I gave it a 4.<br/> <br/>All the best for future entries :)</td>', 'There are many elements on the image that are prominent (capacitors, 2pin socket) which, due to the shallow dof are out of focus. You chose to use monochrome for the image but the tonal range is somewhat lacking in dynamism. Overall the image is rather boring and nondescript, I gave it a 4. All the best for future entries :)', '2004-11-17 08:14:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015770, 120153, 18349, '<td valign="top">Congrats Brad...you never cease to amaze me!  :o)</td>', 'Congrats Brad...you never cease to amaze me!  :o)', '2004-11-17 08:16:24.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015788, 118996, 14369, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the comments. They always help with the next challenge with making me think before shooting.<br/> <br/>BYork<br/><a href="//www.BigDPhoto.com" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">//www.BigDPhoto.com</a></td>', 'Thanks for all the comments. They always help with the next challenge with making me think before shooting. BYork//www.BigDPhoto.com', '2004-11-17 08:24:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(1015819, 119371, 24715, '<td valign="top">Thank you all who voted and especially the ones who commented. I am happy to just make the top 20 in this huge challenge. <br/> <br/>I wasn''t expecting to do this well so I am very pleased. I know that this image is far from perfect, but I couldn''t not to enter it into the macro challenge. In response to the focus comments - I can only say that what you''re seeing is some motion blur. Good eye!<br/> <br/>Thanks again!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-18 13:14:38.</i></td>', 'Thank you all who voted and especially the ones who commented. I am happy to just make the top 20 in this huge challenge.  I wasn''t expecting to do this well so I am very pleased. I know that this image is far from perfect, but I couldn''t not to enter it into the macro challenge. In response to the focus comments - I can only say that what you''re seeing is some motion blur. Good eye! Thanks again!', '2004-11-17 08:40:42.000000', '2004-11-18 13:14:38.000000', 0),
(1015832, 119791, 28771, '<td valign="top">:(</td>', ':(', '2004-11-17 08:45:26.000000', NULL, 0),
