(1015970, 120174, 10402, '<td valign="top">Lighting here was from behind. I adjusted the gamma using Levels to show off the subtle boundaries of the juice sacs, which were barely visible in the original.<br/> <br/>I guess to get a top score I should have squeezed the fruit and photographed a drop of juice coming off it.  :)   But seriously, I can''t complain about a top 75 finish in a contest with so many entries!<br/> <br/>Thanks to all who took time to vote and especially those who commented.<br/> <br/>Rick</td>', 'Lighting here was from behind. I adjusted the gamma using Levels to show off the subtle boundaries of the juice sacs, which were barely visible in the original. I guess to get a top score I should have squeezed the fruit and photographed a drop of juice coming off it.  :)   But seriously, I can''t complain about a top 75 finish in a contest with so many entries! Thanks to all who took time to vote and especially those who commented. Rick', '2004-11-17 09:35:55.000000', NULL, 0),
