(1018246, 119992, 9668, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Konador:</b></div><hr/><i> Since I''m commenting on every photo in this challenge, I thought I''d better comment on this one too. I really like the duotone you''ve used, and the DoF works really well, although a little less shallow I think would look better. The lighting, specially on the drops, is pretty good. Nice shot. </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Hilarious. You really did get %100 comments!<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2004-11-17 20:05:17.</i></td>', 'Originally posted by Konador: Since I''m commenting on every photo in this challenge, I thought I''d better comment on this one too. I really like the duotone you''ve used, and the DoF works really well, although a little less shallow I think would look better. The lighting, specially on the drops, is pretty good. Nice shot.   Hilarious. You really did get %100 comments!', '2004-11-17 20:05:00.000000', '2004-11-17 20:05:17.000000', 0),
