(1100631, 120249, 22140, '<td valign="top">Wow - what a spectrum of comments!  it was a very iffy submission....so I guess I should have expedted both sides.  I agree that the DOF is too narrow - there really is just a sliver that''s in perfect focus...and while I would love to blame it on the equipment, we were really just dealing with bad lighting - opened the aperture almost all the way just to be able to get the shot.  I hadn''t planned to retake it, but all the positive comments may inspire me to!</td>', 'Wow - what a spectrum of comments!  it was a very iffy submission....so I guess I should have expedted both sides.  I agree that the DOF is too narrow - there really is just a sliver that''s in perfect focus...and while I would love to blame it on the equipment, we were really just dealing with bad lighting - opened the aperture almost all the way just to be able to get the shot.  I hadn''t planned to retake it, but all the positive comments may inspire me to!', '2005-01-10 20:56:36.000000', NULL, 0),
