(1486965, 119940, 22748, '<td valign="top"><b>Self-critique</b>, and including the biggest points made by commenters. I''m doing this to try to improve for future shots.<br/> <br/><b>The Good:</b> <br/> + color color color! complementary colors w/ high saturation<br/> + interesting and sharp detail on the peel<br/> + the darkness of the peel provides contrast to the bright areas, and separates the red and green areas<br/> + lighting, the lime looks like it''s glowing, and good balance between background and foreground brightness<br/> <br/><b>The Bad:</b> <br/> - some red bled through the the lime<br/> - border too bold<br/> - little yellow highlights<br/></td>', 'Self-critique, and including the biggest points made by commenters. I''m doing this to try to improve for future shots. The Good:  + color color color! complementary colors w/ high saturation + interesting and sharp detail on the peel + the darkness of the peel provides contrast to the bright areas, and separates the red and green areas + lighting, the lime looks like it''s glowing, and good balance between background and foreground brightness The Bad:  - some red bled through the the lime - border too bold - little yellow highlights', '2005-06-27 18:40:26.000000', NULL, 0),
